<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">- Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Oduwaa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Haneeddabaa Odiyaa Koyro Mas'aafaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Oduwaa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Od.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Haneeddabaa Odiyaa Koyro Mas'aafaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Haneeddabaa Odiyaa mas'aafatuu, Saammeela mas'aafatuwaaninne Kaatetuwaa mas'aafatuwan s'aafetteedda taariketuwaa dumma ogiyaan omooduwaan de'iyaawanttoo laa"entsiide odiino. Haneeddabaa odiyaa mas'aafatuwan Israa'eeliyaa kaatetuwaa kawutetsaa taarikii laa"u huup'e huup'e shaakuwaan shaakettiide odetteedda.</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Israa'eelanne Yihudaa kawutetsatuu bayzuwaan kunddeeddawantta giddooppene, S'oossay bare asaw geleedda k'aalaa ubbaa naageeddawaanne Yihudaan de'iyaawanttu baggana bare asaw bare halchcheedda halchchuwaa poleeddawaa bessanaassa. Hawe tuma gidiyaawaa erissanaw, ha mas'aafaa s'aafeeddawee Daawitenne Solomone ootseedda wolk'k'aama wolk'k'aama oosatuwaa, Yoosaafees'e, Hizk'k'iyaasinne Iyoosiyaase asaa de'uwaa ooras's'iseedda ooras's'isuwaanne S'oossaw minniide ammanetteeda asaa hanotaa loytsiide s'eelleedda.</para>
  <para style="ili">2. Yerusaalamen de'iyaa Geeshsha Golliyaan S'oossaw goynniyaa goynay waaniide doometteeddentto odanaassa. K'ay he wode goynnuwaa wogaa kaaletsiyaawanttu k'eesetuwaa gidiyaa diraw, unttunttu kaaletsiyaa oosuwaa keetsay waaniide doometteeddenttonne k'onc'c'issanaassa. Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'eeddawe Solomona gidooppenne, Geeshsha Golliyaanne goynnuwaa wogaa koyro esseeddawe Daawita gidiyaawaa odanaassa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Addaamappe Kaatiyaa Saa'oola Gakkanaw <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 1:1-9:44">1:1—9:44</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Saa'oolanne Aa Naanatuwaa Hayk'k'uwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 10:1-14">10:1-14</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Daawite Kaatetussaanne Yerusaalame Oyk'k'ussaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 11:1-9">11:1-9</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Waariyaanna De'iyaa Daawita Wotaadaratuwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 11:10-12:40">11:10—12:40</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">K'aalaa C'aak'k'uwaa Taabootay Yerusaalame Buussaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 13:1-16:43">13:1—16:43</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Geeshsha Golliyaa Kees's'iyaawe Solomona Gidussaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 17:1-27">17:1-27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Daawita Olaa S'oonuwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 18:1-20:8">18:1—20:8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Daawite Asaa Paydina Yeedda S'oossaa Hank'k'uwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 21:1-30">21:1-30</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Geeshsha Golliyaa Kees's'anaw Haneedda Giiguwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 22:1-29:20">22:1—29:20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Solomone Kaatetussaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 29:21-25">29:21-25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Daawita Hayk'k'uwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 29:26-30">29:26-30</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1"/>
  <para style="ms">Addaamappe Kaatiyaa Saa'oola Gakkanaw</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="1CH 1:1-9:44">1:1—9:44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Addaamappe Biide Abrahaama Gakkanaw De'iyaa Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 5:1-32">Dom. 5:1-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 10:1-32">10:1-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 11:10-26">11:10-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1"/>Addaame Seeta yeleedda; Seete Heenoosa yeleedda; Heenoosi K'aynaana yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2"/>K'aynaani Malaali'eela yeleedda; Malaali'eeli Yaareedda yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3"/>Yaareed Heenooka yeleedda; Heenooki Maatusaala yeleedda; Maatusaali Laameeka yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4"/>Laameeki Noha yeleedda. Nohe Seema, Kaamanne Yaafeeta yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5"/>Yaafeeta attuma naanay Goomera, Maagooga, Maadaaya, Yaawaana, Tubaala, Meshekanne Tiiraasa. <verse eid="1CH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6"/>Goomera attuma naanay Ashkkanaaza, Riifaatanne Togarmma. <verse eid="1CH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7"/>Yaawaana attuma naanay Eliisha, Tarsseesa, Kitiimanne Rooda.<verse eid="1CH 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8"/>Kaama attuma naanay Kuusha, Mis'irayma, Puus'anne Kanaana. <verse eid="1CH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9"/>Kuusha attuma naanay Saaba, Hawiila, Saabita, Raa'imanne Sabttaka. Raa'ima attuma naanay Saabanne Dadaana. <verse eid="1CH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10"/>K'ay Kuushi Naamiruuda yeleedda. Naamiruudi sa'aan wolk'k'aama olanchchaa gideedda. <verse eid="1CH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11"/>Mis'iraymi Ludeta, Anaameta, Lahaabeta, Nafttuuheta, <verse eid="1CH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12"/>Patiroosata, Kaasiluhetanne Piliss's'eema zeretsaa yeleedda Kafttooreta yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13"/>Kanaane bayira na'aa Sidoonanne Aa teefa Heeta yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14"/>k'ay Kanaane Yaabuusatuwa, Amooretuwaa, Gerggeesetuwaa, <verse eid="1CH 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15"/>Hiiwetuwaa, Ark'k'eta, Siinata, <verse eid="1CH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16"/>Ariwaadeta, S'amaaretanne Hamaatata yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17"/>Seema attuma naanay Elaama, Asoora, Arifaakisaada, Luuda, Araama, Uus'a, Huula, Geteeranne Mesheka. <verse eid="1CH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18"/>Arifaakisaadi Shelaaha yeleedda; Shelaahi Eboora yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19"/>Eboori laa"u naanaa yeleedda; ittuu yeletteedda wode sa'ay shaaketteedda diraw, Aa suntsay Peeleega geetetteedda; Aa ishaa suntsay Yok'is'aana. <verse eid="1CH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20"/>Yok'is'aani Almmodaada, Sheleefa, Has'armmaaweta, Yeraaha, <verse eid="1CH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21"/>Hadoraama, Uzaala, Diik'ila, <verse eid="1CH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22"/>Eebaala, Abimaa'eela, Saaba, <verse eid="1CH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23"/>Ofiira, Hawiilanne Yobaaba yeleedda. Hawanttu ubbatuu Yok'is'aana zeretsaa.<verse eid="1CH 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24"/>Seemappe biide, Abrahaama gakkanaw de'iyaa yeletay hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawaa: Seema, Arifaakisaada, Shelaaha, <verse eid="1CH 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25"/>Eboora, Peeleega, Raa'a, <verse eid="1CH 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26"/>Saruuga, Naakoora, Taaranne <verse eid="1CH 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27"/>Abrahaama geetettiide s'eesettiyaa Abraama.<verse eid="1CH 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isimaa'eela Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 25:12-16">Dom. 25:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28"/>Abrahaama attuma naanay Yisaak'anne Isimaa'eela. <verse eid="1CH 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29"/>Unttunttu yeletay hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:29">Isimaa'eela bayiray Nabaayoota; hewaappe simmina K'eedaare, Adibi'eeli, Mibssaami, <verse eid="1CH 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30"/>Mishimaa'i, Duumi, Maasi, Hadaadi, Teemi, <verse eid="1CH 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31"/>Yis'uri, Naafiishinne K'eedimi yeletteeddino. Hawanttu Isimaa'eela naanaa.<verse eid="1CH 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32"/>Abrahaama k'oomatuu K'as'uri attuma naanay Ziimiraana, Yok'ishaana, Madaana, Midiyaama, Yishibaak'anne Shuha. Yok'ishaana attuma naanay Saabanne Dadaana. <verse eid="1CH 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33"/>Midiyaama attuma naanay Eefa, Efeera, Hanooka, Abiidaa'anne Elddaa'a. Hawanttu ubbatuu K'as'uri zeretsaa.<verse eid="1CH 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eesaa Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:1-19">Dom. 36:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34"/>Abrahaame Yisaak'a yeleedda. Yisaak'a attuma naanay Eesaanne Israa'eeliyaa. <verse eid="1CH 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35"/>Eesaa attuma naanay Elifaaza, Ra'u'eela, Yi'uusha, Yaa'ilaamanne K'oraaha. <verse eid="1CH 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36"/>Elifaaza attuma naanay Temaana, Omaara, S'afa, Ga'itaama, K'anaaza, Timinaa'anne Amaaleek'a. <verse eid="1CH 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37"/>Ra'u'eela attuma naanay Nahaata, Zaraaha, Shammanne Miizaa.<verse eid="1CH 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eedooman Koyro De'eedda Asatuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:20-30">Dom. 36:20-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38"/>Eedooman koyro de'eedda Se'iira attuma naanay Los'aana, Shobaala, S'ibaa'oona, Aana, Dishoona, Es'eeranne Dishaana. <verse eid="1CH 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39"/>Los'aana attuma naanay Hooranne Homaama; Los'aana michchata Timinaa'o. <verse eid="1CH 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40"/>Shobaala attuma naanay Aaliwaana, Manahaata, Eebaala, Shefanne Oonaama. S'ibaa'oona attuma naanay Aayanne Aana. <verse eid="1CH 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41"/>Aana na'ay Dishoona. Dishoona attuma naanay Hemddaana, Eshibaana, Yitiraananne Karaana. <verse eid="1CH 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42"/>Es'eera attuma naanay Bilihaana, Za'iwaananne Ak'ana. Dishaana attuma naanay Uus'anne Araana.<verse eid="1CH 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eedooma Kaatetuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:31-43">Dom. 36:31-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43"/>Israa'eelan ayaa kaatii kawutanappe kase Eedooma biittan kaateteedda kaatetuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:43">Ba'oora na'ay Belaa'i kaateteedda; Aa katamaa suntsay Dinaaba.<verse eid="1CH 1:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44"/>Belaa'i hayk'k'ina, Boos'irappe yeedda Zaraaha na'ay Yobaabi Aa kotan kaateteedda.<verse eid="1CH 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45"/>Yobaabi hayk'k'ina, Temaana gadiyaappe yeedda Hushaami Aa kotan kaateteedda.<verse eid="1CH 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46"/>Hushaami hayk'k'ina, Moo'aabe gadiyaan Midiyaamatuwaa s'ooneedda Badaada na'aa Hadaadi Aa kotan kaateteedda; Aa katamaa suntsay Awiita.<verse eid="1CH 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47"/>Hadaadi hayk'k'ina, Maasireek'appe yeedda Saamili Aa kotan kaateteedda.<verse eid="1CH 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48"/>Saamili hayk'k'ina, shaafaa matan de'iyaa Rahobootappe yeedda Shaa'uli Aa kotan kaateteedda.<verse eid="1CH 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49"/>Shaa'uli hayk'k'ina, Akiboora na'ay Ba'aalihanaani Aa kotan kaateteedda.<verse eid="1CH 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50"/>Ba'aalihanaani hayk'k'ina, Hadaadi Aa kotan kaateteedda; Aa katamaa suntsay Paa'a. Aa machata Mezaahaaba naatti Maas'ireedi naatto Mahes'aabi'eelo.<verse eid="1CH 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Hadaadi hayk'k'eedda. Eedooma zaratuwaa kaappatuu hawantta: Timinaa'a, Aliwa, Yeteeta, <verse eid="1CH 1:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52"/>Oholiibaama, Eelah, Piinoona, <verse eid="1CH 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53"/>K'anaaza, Temaana, Mibs's'aara, <verse eid="1CH 1:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54"/>Maagidi'eelanne Iraama. Hawanttu Eedooma kaappatuwaa.<verse eid="1CH 1:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yihudaa Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1"/>Israa'eeliyaa attuma naanay hawantta: Roobeela, Simoona, Leewiyaa, Yihudaa, Yisaakoora, Zaabiloona, <verse eid="1CH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2"/>Daana, Yooseefa, Biiniyaama, Nifttaaleema, Gaadanne Aaseera.<verse eid="1CH 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3"/>Kanaane Baatishu'ippe Yihuday yeleedda heezzu attuma naanay Eera, Oonaananne Sheela. Yihudaa na'ay bayiray, Eeri Med'inaa Godaa sintsan iitabaa ootseedda diraw, Med'inaa Goday Aa wod'eedda. <verse eid="1CH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4"/>Yihudaa na'aa machchata Ti'imaara Yihudaw Paareesanne Zaraaha yelaaddu. Yihudaw ubbaanna ichcheshu attuma naanay de'iino.<verse eid="1CH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5"/>Paareesa attuma naanay Hes'iroonanne Hamuula.<verse eid="1CH 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6"/>Zaraaha attuma naanay Zimira, Etaana, Hemaana, Kalkkoolanne Darddaa'a; unttunttu ubbaanna ichchesha. <verse eid="1CH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7"/>Zaraaha zeretsaappe gideedda Karmma na'ay Akaani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Akaani: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Bashshaa» giyaawaa.</char></note> S'iiniyaa geetetti utteedda miishshaa omooduwaa akkiide, Israa'eeliyaa asaa waayisseeddawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:1">Iya. 7:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8"/>Etaana na'ay Azaariyaa.<verse eid="1CH 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hes'iroonappe Biide Daawita Gakkanaw De'iyaa Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9"/>Hes'iroone yeleedda naanay Yiraahima'eela, Raamanne Kaaleeba. <verse eid="1CH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10"/>Raame Aminaadaaba yeleedda. Aminaadaabe Yihudaa zaratuwaa kaappuwaa Na'asoona yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11"/>Na'asoone Salmoona yeleedda; Salmooni Boo'eeza yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12"/>Boo'eeze Yoobeeda yeleedda; Yoobeedi Isseya yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13"/>Isseyi bare bayira na'aa Eli'aaba, laa'entso na'aa Aminaadaaba, heezzentso na'aa Shaama, <verse eid="1CH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14"/>oyddentso na'aa Nataani'eela, ichcheshantso na'aa Raddaaya, <verse eid="1CH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15"/>usuppuntso na'aa Oos'eemanne laappuntsa na'ay Daawita yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16"/>Isseya mac'c'a naanay S'aruuyonne Abigaalo. S'aruuyi naanay heezzatuu Abishaaya, Yoo'aabanne Asaaheela. <verse eid="1CH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17"/>Abigaala Amaasa yelaaddu; Amaasa aawuu Isimaa'eeliyaa Yetera.<verse eid="1CH 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hes'iroona Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18"/>Hes'iroona na'ay Kaaleebi bare machati Azuubina, Yirii'ooto geetettiyaa naatto yeleedda. Yirii'oota Yesheera, Shobaabanne Arddoona yelaaddu. <verse eid="1CH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19"/>Azuuba hayk'k'ina, Kaaleebi Efiraato akkeedda; Efiraataa Huura yelaaddu. <verse eid="1CH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20"/>Huuri Uura yeleedda; Uuri Bas'aali'eela yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21"/>Hes'iroone usuppun tammu laytsaappe guyyiyaan, Gala'aade aawuwaa Maakira naatto akkiide, Saguba yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22"/>Sagubi Yaa'iira yeleedda. Yaa'iiri beni Gala'aade gadiyaan laatamanne heezzu katamatuwaa mooddeedda. <verse eid="1CH 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23"/>Shin Gashuuranne Sooriyaa kaatetuu Habooti-Yaa'iira katamatuwaa K'anaataanne aa heeratuwaa usuppun tammu katamatuwaa olettiide oyk'k'eeddino; yaan de'eedda Asay ubbay Gala'aade aawuwaa Maakira zariyaa. <verse eid="1CH 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24"/>Hes'iroone Kaaleeba Efiraataa giyaa saan hayk'k'eeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Hes'iroona machata Abiiya Tak'o"a aawuwaa Ashihuura yelaaddu.<verse eid="1CH 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yiraahima'eela Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25"/>Hes'iroona na'aa bayiraa Yiraahima'eela na'ay bayray Raama; teefatuu Buuna, Oreena, Oos'eemanne Akiiya. <verse eid="1CH 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26"/>Yiraahima'eelaw Ataaro geetettiyaa hara machchata de'aw; Ataara Oonaama daayo.<verse eid="1CH 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27"/>Yiraahima'eela na'aa bayraa Raama naanay Ma'aas'a, Yaamiinanne Ek'eera.<verse eid="1CH 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28"/>Oonaama naanay Shammaayanne Yaade.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 2:28">Shammaaya naanay Nadaabanne Abishuura. <verse eid="1CH 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29"/>Abishuura machata Abihayila Ahibaananne Moliida yelaaddu. <verse eid="1CH 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30"/>Nadaaba attuma naanay Seledanne Afaayima; Seledi na'aa yelennaan hayk'k'eedda. <verse eid="1CH 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31"/>Afaayima na'ay Yishi'a; Yishi'a na'ay Sheeshaana; Sheeshaana na'ay Ahilaaya.<verse eid="1CH 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32"/>Shammaaya ishaa Yaade naanay Yeteranne Yoonataana; Yeteri na'aa yelennaan hayk'k'eedda. <verse eid="1CH 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33"/>Yoonataana naanay Peleetanne Zaaza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 2:33">Hawanttu Yiraahima'eela zeretsaa.<verse eid="1CH 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34"/>Sheeshaanaw mac'c'awaappe attina, attuma naanay baawa. Sheeshaanaw Yaariha'a geetettiyaa k'oomay Gibs'e gadiyaappe yeeddawe de'ee. <verse eid="1CH 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35"/>Sheeshaani bare k'oomaa Yaariha'aw bare mac'c'a naanatuwaappe ittinno immina naatta Attaaya yelaaddu. <verse eid="1CH 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36"/>Attaayi Naataana yeleedda; Naataani Zabaada yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37"/>Zabaad Efilaala yeleedda; Efilaali Yoobeeda yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38"/>Yoobeedi Yeeha yeleedda; Yeehu Azaariyaa yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39"/>Azaarii Helees'a yeleedda; Helees'i El"aasa yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40"/>El"aasi Sisimaaya yeleedda; Sisimaayi Shaaluuma yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41"/>Shaaluumi Yik'aamiyaa yeleedda; Yik'aame Elishamaa'a yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaaleeba Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42"/>Yiraahima'eela ishaa Kaaleeba na'ay bayiray Meesha. Meesha na'ay Ziifa; Ziifa na'ay Mareesha; Mareesha na'ay Kebroona. <verse eid="1CH 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43"/>Kebroone naanay K'oraaha, Taappuha, Rek'eemanne Shemaa'a. <verse eid="1CH 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44"/>Shemaa'i York'k'a'aama aawuwaa Rahaama yeleedda. Rek'eemi Shammaaya yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45"/>Shammaaya na'ay Maa'oona. Maa'ooni Beetis'uura yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 2:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46"/>Kaaleeba k'oomatta Eefa Haaraana, Moos'anne Gazeeza yelaaddu; Haaraani Gazeeza yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 2:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47"/>Yaahidaaya naanay Regeema, Yo'aataama, Geshaana, Pelees'a, Eefanne Sha'aafa.<verse eid="1CH 2:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48"/>Kaaleeba k'oomatta Maa'ika Shebeeranne Tirihaana yelaaddu. <verse eid="1CH 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49"/>K'aykka Maa'ika Sha'aafanne Shawa yelaaddu. Sha'aafi Madimaana yeleedda. Shawi Maakibeenanne Gibaa'a yeleedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 2:49">Kaaleeba naatta Aakkiso.<verse eid="1CH 2:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50"/>Kaaleeba naanay haratuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddino. Kaaleebi bare bayra na'aa Huura bare machchatti Efiraatin yeleedda. Huura naanay K'iriyaati-Yi'aariima aawuwaa Shobaala, <verse eid="1CH 2:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51"/>Beeteleheeme aawuwaa Salmoonanne Beeti-Gadeera aawuwaa Hareefa. <verse eid="1CH 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52"/>K'iriyaati-Yi'aariima aawuwaa Shobaala yaratuu Haro'eetatanne Manuhoota yaratuwaappe baggatuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 2:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53"/>K'iriyaati-Yi'aariima yaratuu Yatirata, Puutata, Shumaatatanne Mishiraa'ata. S'or"atinne Eshttaa'oolati hawanttuppe yeletteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 2:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54"/>Beeteleheeme aawuwaa Salmoona yaratuu Nas'oofata, As'irooti-Beetayoo'aabata, Manuhoota yaratuwaappe attiyaa baggatuwaanne S'or"ata. <verse eid="1CH 2:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55"/>Yaabees'a kataman de'iyaa s'aafiyaawanttu yaratuu k'ay Tir"ata, Shim"aatatanne Sukkata. Hawanttu Rekaabatu aawuwaa Haamatuwaappe yeletteedda K'eenata.<verse eid="1CH 2:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kaatiyaa Daawita Naanaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1"/>Kebroone kataman Daawite yeleedda naanay; Iziraa'eeliyaa Ahino'aama yeleedda Aa bayray Aminoona. K'armmeloosiyaa Abigaala yeleedda Aa laa'entso na'ay Daaneela. <verse eid="1CH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2"/>Gashuura gadiyaa Kaatiyaa Talmmaaya naatta Maa'ika yeleedda Aa heezzentso na'ay Abeselooma. Haggiita yeleedda Aa oyddentso na'ay Adooniyaana. <verse eid="1CH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3"/>Abiis'aala yeleedda Aa ichcheshantso na'ay Shafaas'iyaa. Aa machata Egila yeleedda Aa usuppuntsa na'ay Yitira'aama. <verse eid="1CH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4"/>Daawite he usuppun naanaa Kebroonan yeleedda. Daawite Kebroonan laappun laytsanne usuppun aginaa kaateteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:4-5">2 Sam. 5:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:11">1 Kat. 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:27">1 Od. 29:27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 3:4">K'ay Yerusaalamen hattamanne heezzu laytsaa kaateteedda. <verse eid="1CH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5"/>Daawite Yerusaalamen yeleedda naanay oyddatuu Ami'eela naatta Berssaaba yeleedda Shim"a, Shobaaba, Naataananne Solomona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:3">2 Sam. 11:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6"/>K'ay hara udduppun attuma naanay Yibihaara, Elishamaa'a, Elifelees'a, <verse eid="1CH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7"/>Nogaaha, Nefeega, Yaafi'a, <verse eid="1CH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8"/>Elishamaa'a, Eliyadaa'anne Elifelees'a. <verse eid="1CH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9"/>Ha attuma naanaa ubbaa bollakka Daawitaw hara machatuwaappe yeletteedda attuma naanay de'iino; k'ay Taamaara ha attuma naanaa michchato.<verse eid="1CH 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaatiyaa Solomone Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10"/>Kaatiyaa Solomone na'ay Robi'aama; Robi'aama na'ay Abiiya; Abiiya na'ay Asaa; Asaa na'ay Yoosaafees'a; <verse eid="1CH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11"/>Yoosaafees'a na'ay Yoraama; Yoraama na'ay Akaaziyaasa; Akaaziyaasa na'ay Yo'aasha; <verse eid="1CH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12"/>Yo'aasha na'ay Amesiyaasa; Amesiyaasa na'ay Ooziyaana; Ooziyaana na'ay Yo'aataama; <verse eid="1CH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13"/>Yo'aataama na'ay Akaaza; Akaaza na'ay Hizk'k'iyaasa; Hizk'k'iyaasa na'ay Minaasa; <verse eid="1CH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14"/>Minaase na'ay Amoona; Amoona na'ay Yoosiyaasa. <verse eid="1CH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15"/>Yoosiyaasa na'ay bayray Yohanaana; laa"entsuu Yo'aak'eema; heezzentsuu Sedek'iyaasa; oyddentsuu Shaaluuma. <verse eid="1CH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16"/>Yo'aak'eema naanay Yo'aakiinanne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yo'aakiinanne: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetsuwaan ha suntsay «Yokoniyaa» geetettee.</char></note> Sedek'iyaasa.<verse eid="1CH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaatiyaa Yo'aakiina Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17"/>Omoodettiide Baabloone beedda Yo'aakiina attuma naanay Salaatiyaala, <verse eid="1CH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18"/>Malkkiraama, Padaaya, Shenaas'aara, Yik'aamiyaa, Hoshamaa'anne Nadaabiyaa. <verse eid="1CH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19"/>Padaaya attuma naanay Zarubaabeelanne Shim"a. Zarubaabeela attuma naanay Mashulaamanne Hanaaniyaa; unttunttu michchatta Shalomiito. <verse eid="1CH 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20"/>Hawanttu bollan hara ichcheshu attuma naanay Zarubaabeelaw de'iino; unttunttukka Haashshuuba, Oheela, Berekiyaa, Hasaadiyaanne Yushaabi-Heseeda.<verse eid="1CH 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21"/>Hanaaniyaa attuma naanay Palaas'iyaanne Yishaa'iyaa. Yishaa'iyaa na'ay Rafaaya; Rafaaya na'ay Arnnaana; Arnnaana na'ay Obaadiyaa; Obaadiyaa na'ay Shakaaniyaa; <verse eid="1CH 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22"/>Shakaaniyaw usuppun naanay de'ee; Shamaa'iyaa giyaa Aa na'aynne na'aa naanatuu, Has's'uusha, Yigi'aala, Bariyaaha, Na'aariyaanne Shafaas'a. <verse eid="1CH 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23"/>Na'aariyaa naanay heezzatuu Eliyoo'enaaya, Hizk'k'anne Azirik'aama. <verse eid="1CH 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24"/>Eliyoo'enaaya naanay laappunatuu Hodaawiyaa, Eliyaashiba, Palaaya, Ak'k'uuba, Yohanaana, Dalaayanne Anaana.<verse eid="1CH 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yihudaa Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1"/>Yihudaa zaratuu Paareesa, Hes'iroona, Karmma, Huuranne Shobaala.<verse eid="1CH 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2"/>Shobaala na'ay Ra'aayi Yahaata yeleedda; Yahaati Ahumaayanne Lahaada yeleedda. Hawanttu S'or"atu yaratuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 4:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3-4"/>Huuri bare daay Efiraatiw bayra na'aa; Huuri Beeteleheeme yeleedda. Es'aama attuma naanay Iziraa'eela, Yuushimanne Yidibaasha; unttunttu michchatta Has'ilelppoono. Panu'eeli Gadoora yeleedda. Es'eeri Huusha yeleedda. Hawanttu Huura yaratuwaa.<verse eid="1CH 4:3-4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5"/>Tak'o"a aawuwaa Ashihuuraw Heelonne Naa'iro geetettiyaa laa"u mac'c'a asatuu de'iino. <verse eid="1CH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6"/>Naa'ira Ahuzaama, Hefeera, Teminanne Ahashittaara Ashihuuraw yelaaddu; hawanttu Naa'iri naanaa. <verse eid="1CH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7"/>Heela S'eereta, S'oohaaranne Etinaana Ashihuuraw yelaaddu. <verse eid="1CH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8"/>K'oos'i Anuuba, s'obeebanne Haruuma na'aa Ahariheela yaratuwaa yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9"/>Yaabees'i bare ishatuwaa ubbaappe aad'd'i bonchchetee. Aa daaya, «Taani Aa iita yeluwaan yeleedda diraw, Aa suntsay Yaabees'a» gaade suntsaaddu. <verse eid="1CH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10"/>Yaabees'i<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yaabees'i: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha suntsaa biletsay Ibraaweetsuwaan, «Sakuwaa» giyaawaa.</char></note> Israa'eeliyaa S'oossaa s'eesiide, «Abeet S'oossaw, hay taana neeni anjja; ta gadiyaakka aassa. Taananna ittippe gidaa; taana sakkennaadan taana k'ohiyaabaappe neeni naaga» yaagiide woosseedda. S'oossay Aa woosaa siseedda.<verse eid="1CH 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hara Asatuu Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11"/>Shuha ishay Kaluubi Mahiira yeleedda; Mahiiri Eshttoona yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12"/>Eshttooni Beetiraafa, Paaseehanne Tahinna yeleedda. Tahinni Iri-Nahaasha katamaa asaa yeleedda. Hawanttu Reeka gadiyaan de'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13"/>K'anaaza naanay Otini'eelanne Saraaya; Otini'eela naanay Hataatanne Ma'onootaaya. <verse eid="1CH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14"/>Ma'onootaayi Oofira yeleedda. Saraayi Yoo'aaba yeleedda. Yoo'aabe Je-Harashiima yeleedda; Kushiyaa Hiillanchatuwaa gidiyaa asatuwaa yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15"/>Yifune na'aa Kaaleeba naanay Ira, Elahinne Na'aama. Elah na'ay K'anaaza.<verse eid="1CH 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16"/>Yihaali'eela naanay Ziifa, Ziifaaha, Tiirayanne Asaari'eela.<verse eid="1CH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17"/>Eezira naanay Yetera, Mereda, Efeeranne Yaaloona. Meredi Gibs'e kaatiyaa naatto Biito akkina iza Miiriyaamo, Shammaayanne Yishiba aw yelaaddu. Yishibi Eshttamoo'a yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:18"/>Yihudaa gadiyaappe akkeedda machata Gadoora aawuwaa Yereedda, Sookko aawuwaa Hebeeranne Zaanoha aawuwaa Yak'iiti'eela Meredaw yelaaddu. <verse eid="1CH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19"/>Nahaama michchati, Hodiyaa machati naanay Gaariman de'eedda K'a'iila aawuwaanne Maa'ikan de'eedda Eshttamoo'a aawuwaa.<verse eid="1CH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20"/>Shimoona naanay Aminoona, Riinna, Benihanaananne Tiiloona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 4:20">Yishi'a naanay Zoheetanne Benzzoheeta.<verse eid="1CH 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sheela Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21"/>Yihudaa na'aa Sheela zaratuu Leeka aawuwaa Eera, Mareesha aawuwaa Laa'idanne Beeti-Ashibee'a kataman de'iyaa suufiyaa geetettiyaa mayuwaa daddiyaawanttu yaratuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:22"/>Haratuu k'ay Yok'iima, Yo'aasha, Yaashubiliheema, Moo'aabe gadiyaa mooddeedda Saraafanne Kozeeba kataman de'eedda asatuwaa. Ha yeletaa mazggobay beni wodeppekka de'iyaawaa. <verse eid="1CH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23"/>Hawanttu Nas'a'iimaaninne Gadeeran de'eedda urk'k'aa med'd'iyaa asatuwaa. Unttunttu kaatiyaa kiitaa ootsanaw aanana ittippe de'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Simoona Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24"/>Simoona naanay Nemu'eela, Yaamiina, Yaariiba, Zaraahanne Shaa'ula. <verse eid="1CH 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25"/>Shaa'ula na'ay Shaaluuma; Shaaluuma na'ay Mibssaama; Mibssaama na'ay Mishimaa'a; <verse eid="1CH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26"/>Mishimaa'a na'ay Hammu'eela; Hammu'eela na'ay Zakkuura; Zakkuura na'ay Shim"a. <verse eid="1CH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27"/>Shim"aw tammanne usuppun attuma naanaynne usuppun mac'c'a naanay de'iino; shin Aa ishatoo c'ora naanay baawa. Yihudaa zaratuwaadan Simoona zaratuu c'orattibeykkino.<verse eid="1CH 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28"/>Simoona zaratuu Berssaabeha katamaaninne Molaada, Has'aari-Shu'aala,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:28-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:2-8">Iya. 19:2-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 4:29"/>Baala, Es'eema, Tolaadda, <verse eid="1CH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 4:30"/>Baatu'eela, Horima, S'ik'ilaaga, <verse eid="1CH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:31"/>Beeti-Markkaboota, Hos'aari-Susiima, Beetibiiranne Shaa'irayma katamatuwaan de'eeddino. Daawite kaatetana gakkanaw hawanttu unttunttu katamatuwaa gidiide de'eeddino. <verse eid="1CH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32"/>K'ay unttunttu mootsatuu Es'aama, Ayina, Rimoona, Tokeenanne Ashaana. Unttunttu ubbaanna ichcheshu katamatuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33"/>Ba'aalaata gakkanaw, ha katamatuwaa yuushshuwaan de'iyaa mootsatuu ubbay unttunttun gujettiino. Hawantta unttunttu de'eedda sa'aa unttunttu barenttu yeletaa maaran mazggobiyaan s'aafiide oyk'k'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34"/>Simoona yaratuu kaappatuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta. Unttunttu Mashobaaba, Yaamileeka, Amesiyaasa na'aa Yoosha, <verse eid="1CH 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35"/>Yuu'eelanne Yoshiibiyaa na'aa Yeeha. Yeehu aawuwaa aawuu Asa'eela na'aa Saraaya. <verse eid="1CH 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36"/>Hara kaappatuu k'ay Eliyoo'enaaya, Yaa'ikooba, Yashohaaya, Asaaya, Adii'eela, Yashimi'eela, Banaayanne <verse eid="1CH 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37"/>Ziiza. Ziizi Shif"a na'aa; Shif"i Alloona na'aa; Allooni Yadaaya na'aa; Yadaayi Shiimira na'aa; Shiimiri Shamaa'iyaa na'aa. <verse eid="1CH 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38"/>Simoona yaratuu kaappatuu hawantta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 4:38">Unttunttu aawotuwaa zeretsay loytsi c'oratteedda. <verse eid="1CH 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39"/>Unttunttu barenttu mehiyaw heemmiyaa sa'aa koyanaw Gadoora geliyaa sa'aa matan de'iyaa wombbaw away doliyaa baggana de'iyaa sa'aa gakkanaw beeddino. <verse eid="1CH 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40"/>Itti loytsi araddeeda lo"o heemmiyaa sa'aa demmeeddino; he biittay woppaynne sarotetsay kumeedda aako biittaa. Beni wode he gadiyaan de'eeddawantu Kaama zeretsatuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41"/>Hawaappe k'ommo baggana suntsay s'aafetteedda Simoona zaratuu Yihudaa Kaatiyaa Hizk'k'iyaasa wode Gadoora gadiyaa biide, yaan de'iyaa Kaama zeretsatuwaanne Ma'uuna asatuwaa olettiide d'aysseeddino. He gadiyaan unttunttu mehiyaw heemmiyaa sa'ay de'iyaa diraw, Simoona zaratuu hachche gatsanaw yaan utteeddino.<verse eid="1CH 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42"/>Simoona zaratuwaappe ichcheshu s'eetu asatuu Se'iira Deriyaakko beeddino. Unttunttu kaappatuu Palaas'iyaa, Na'aariyaa, Rafaayanne Uuzi'eela; unttunttu Yishi'a naanaa. <verse eid="1CH 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43"/>Amaaleek'a asatuwaappe kase bak'ati atteeddawantta Simoona asatuu d'aysseeddino. Unttunttu hachche gakkanaw he biittan de'iino.<verse eid="1CH 4:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Roobeela Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1"/>Israa'eeliyaa na'aa bayiraa Roobeela yeletay hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawaa. Roobeeli bayira na'aa; shin bare aawuwaa gisuwaa I tunisseedda diraw, bayiratetsaw bessiyaabay Israa'eeliyaa na'aa Yooseefo naanaw imetteedda. Hewaa diraw, I yeletaan bayira gideeddawe s'aafettibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:22">Dom. 35:22</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:3-4">49:3-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2"/>Yihuday bare ishatuwaappe minneedda; Aa bayiratetsay Yooseefoo imetteeddawaa gidooppenne, Israa'eeliyaa asaa mooddiyaawe Yihudaappe kesseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:8-10">Dom. 49:8-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3"/>Israa'eeliyaa na'aa bayiraa Roobeela attuma naanay Hanooka, Paala, Hes'iroonanne Karmma.<verse eid="1CH 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4"/>Yuu'eela na'ay Shamaa'iyaa; Shamaa'iyaa na'ay Googa; Googa na'ay Shim"a; <verse eid="1CH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5"/>Shim"a na'ay Mikiyaasa; Mikiyaasa na'ay Ra'aaya; Ra'aaya na'ay Ba'aala. <verse eid="1CH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:6"/>Ba'aala na'ay Asoore Kaatiyaa Tigilaati-Paleseeri omoodiide afeedda Ba'eera; Ba'eeri Roobeela zaratuwaa kaappuwaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:29">2 Kat. 15:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7"/>Ba'eera dabbotuu, barenttu yeletaa mazggobiyaan s'aafetteedda Roobeela yaratuu kaappatuu Yi'i'eela, Zakkaraasanne <verse eid="1CH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:8"/>Belaa'a. Belaa'i Azaaza na'aa; Azaazii Shemaa'a na'aa; Shemaa'i Yuu'eela zariyaa. Yuu'eela zaratuu Aaro'eera kataman, Nabo biittaaninne Ba'aali-Ma'oona gadiyaan de'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9"/>Roobeela zaratuwaa mehii Gala'aaden c'oratteedda diraw, unttunttu yaappe away doliyaa bagga biide, Efiraas'iisa Shaafaa gakkanaw mic'eteedda mela biittaan utteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10"/>Saa'oola laytsan Aggaaratuwaa yaratuwaanna Roobeela yaratuu olettina, Roobeela yaratuu s'ooneeddino. Gala'aadeppe away doliyaa baggana de'iyaa Aggaaratuwaa yaratuu gadiyaan utteeddino.<verse eid="1CH 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaade Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11"/>Gaade zaratuu Roobeela zaratuwaappe huup'issa baggan, Salaaka gakkanaw de'iyaa Baasaane gadiyaan utteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12"/>Yuu'eeli koyro yaratoo kaappuwaa; Shafaami laa'entso yaratoo kaappuwaa. Yaa'inaaynne Shafaas'i Baasaanen utteedda yaratoo kaappatuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13"/>Unttunttu dabbotuu, laappun yaratuwaa kaappatuu, Mikaa'eela, Mashulaama, Saaba, Yoraaya, Yaa'ikaana, Zii'anne Ebeera. <verse eid="1CH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14"/>Hawanttu Abihayila naanay Buuza zeretsaa. Buuzi Yaahida yeleedda; Yaahidi Yeshishaaya yeleedda; Yeshishaayi Mikaa'eela yeleedda; Mikaa'eeli Gala'aade yeleedda; Gala'aade Yaarooha yeleedda; Yaaroohi Huura yeleedda; Huuri Abihayila yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15"/>Unttunttu aawotuwaa soo kaappuu Guna na'aa na'aa Abddi'eela na'aa Aaha. <verse eid="1CH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16"/>Unttunttu Gala'aadeninne Baasaanen he biittatuwaa katamatuwaaninne Saaroona gadiyaan mehii heemettiyaa gishuwaan utteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17"/>Hawanttu ubbaa yeletay Yihudaa Kaatiyaa Yo'aataama wodenne Israa'eeliyaa Kaatiyaa Iyorbbaama wode yeletaa mazggobiyaan s'aafetteedda.<verse eid="1CH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Away doliyaa Baggan Utteedda Olanchchatuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18"/>Roobeela zaratuwaappe, Gaade zaratuwaappenne Minaase zaratuwaappe baggatuwaappe olanchchatuu, wolk'k'aamatuu, gonddalliyaanne mashshaa oyk'k'iyaawanttu, wonddaafiyaan dukan looheeddawanttunne olaa salppiyaa eriyaawanttu oytamanne oyddu sha"anne laappun s'eetanne usuppun tamma. <verse eid="1CH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19"/>Unttunttu Aggaaratuwaa yaratuwaanna, Yis'uratuwaana, Naafiishatuwaanne Nodaabatuwaanna oletteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20"/>Unttunttu he asatuwaana olettiide, S'oossaakko waasseedda diraw, maaduwaa demmeeddino. Unttunttu S'oossan ammanetteeda diraw, I unttunttoo woosetteedda. Hewaa diraw, Aggaaratuwaa yaratuwaanne unttunttunna de'iyaa haratuu unttunttu kushiyan geleeddino. <verse eid="1CH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21"/>Barenttu morkkatuwaappe ishatamu sha"a gaalotuwaa, laa"u s'eetanne ishatamu sha"a dorssatuwaa, laa"u sha"a haretuwaanne s'eetu sha"a asatuwaa omoodiide afeedino. <verse eid="1CH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22"/>Olay S'oossaawaa gideedda diraw, daratu hayk'k'eeddino. S'ooneeddawanttu omooduwaa wodii gakkanaasikka he asatuwaa kotan utteeddino.<verse eid="1CH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Away doliyaa Baggan Utteedda Minaase Zeretsaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23"/>Minaase zaratuwaappe bakka yaratuu Baasaaneppe doommiide, Ba'aali-Hermmoone, Saniiranne Hermmoone Deriyaa gakkanaw de'iyaa he biittatuwaan utteeddino; unttunttu he gishuwaan c'oratteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24"/>Unttunttu aawotuwaa soy kaappatuu Efeera, Yishi'a, Eli'eela, Aziri'eela, Ermaasa, Hodaawiyaanne Yaahidi'eela. Hawanttu unttunttu aawuwaa gollen eretteedda, s'alanne wolk'k'aama asatuwaa.<verse eid="1CH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25"/>Shin ha zaratuu barenttu aawotuwaa S'oossaa naak'k'eddino; S'oossay unttunttu sintsaappe d'aysseedda he gadiyaa asatuwaa s'oossatuwaanna shaarmus'eeddino. <verse eid="1CH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26"/>Hewaa diraw, Israa'eeliyaa S'oossay Tigilaati-Paleseera woy Puula geetettiyaa Asoore kaatiyaa ayaanaa dentsetseedda. Yaatiide Roobeela zeretsaa, Gaade zaratuwaanne Minaase zaratuwaappe baggatuwaa omoodiide, Halaaha, Habooranne Haara biittatuwaanne Gozaana Shaafaa afeedda. Unttunttu hachche gakkanaw yaan de'iino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:19">2 Kat. 15:19</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 15:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:6">17:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CH 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6"/>
  <para style="s">K'eesiyaa Ubbatuwaa Kaappuwaa Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1"/>Leewiyaa naanay Gershshoona, K'ahaatanne Maraara.<verse eid="1CH 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2"/>K'ahaata naanay Amiraama, Yis'ihaara, Kebroonanne Uuzi'eela.<verse eid="1CH 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3"/>Amiraama naanay Aaroona, Musanne Miiriyaamo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:3">Aaroona naanay Nadaaba, Abiiha, El"aazaranne Itaamaara.<verse eid="1CH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4"/>El"aazare Piinihaasa yeleedda; Piinihaasi Abishuu'a yeleedda; Abishuu'i Buuk'a yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5"/>Buuk'i Uuza yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6"/>Uuzi Zaraahiyaa yeleedda; Zaraahe Maraayoota yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7"/>Maraayooti Amaariyaa yeleedda; Amaari Ahis'uuba yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8"/>Ahis'uubi S'aadook'a yeleedda; S'aadook'e Ahima'aas'a yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9"/>Ahima'aas'i Azaariyaasa yeleedda; Azaariyaasi Yohanaana yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10"/>Yohanaani Azaariyaasa yeleedda. Solomone Yerusaalamen kees'isseedda Geeshsha Golliyaa ootseedda k'eesii Azaariyaasa. <verse eid="1CH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11"/>Azaariyaasi Amaariyaa yeleedda; Amaari Ahis'uuba yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12"/>Ahis'uubi S'aadook'a yeleedda; S'aadook'e Shaaluuma yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13"/>Shaaluumi Hilk'k'iyaa yeleedda; Hilk'k'ii Azaariyaasa yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14"/>Azaariyaasi Saraaya yeleedda; Saraayi Yos'edeek'a yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15"/>Med'inaa Goday Yihudaanne Yerusaalame Naabukadanas'ooran omoodisseedda wode Yos'edeek'ikka omoodettiide beedda.<verse eid="1CH 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Leewiyaa Zaretuwaa Haratuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16"/>Leewiyaa naanay Gershshoona, K'ahaatanne Maraara. <verse eid="1CH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17"/>Gershshoona naanatuwaa suntsay Liibinanne Shim"a. <verse eid="1CH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18"/>K'ahaata naanay Amiraama, Yis'ihaara, Kebroonanne Uuzi'eela. <verse eid="1CH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19"/>Maraara naanay Maahilanne Musha. Barenttu aawuwaa gollen gollen s'aafetteedda Leewatuu yaratuu hawantta.<verse eid="1CH 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20"/>Gershshoona na'ay Liibina; Liibina na'ay Yahaata; Yahaata na'ay Ziimma. <verse eid="1CH 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21"/>Ziimma na'ay Yo'aaha; Yo'aaha na'ay Idda; Iddo na'ay Zaraaha; Zaraaha na'ay Ya'atiraaya.<verse eid="1CH 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22"/>K'ahaata na'ay Aminaadaaba; Aminaadaaba na'ay K'oraaha; K'oraaha na'ay Asiira; <verse eid="1CH 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23"/>Asiira na'ay Elk'k'aana; Elk'k'aana na'ay Ebiyaasaafa; Ebiyaasaafa na'ay Asiira; <verse eid="1CH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24"/>Asiira na'ay Tahaata; Tahaata na'ay Uri'eela; Uri'eela na'ay Uuziyaana; Uuziyaana na'ay Shaa'ula.<verse eid="1CH 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25"/>Elk'k'aana naanay Amaasaayanne Ahimoota. <verse eid="1CH 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26"/>Ahimoota na'ay Elk'k'aana; Elk'k'aana na'ay S'ofaaya; S'ofaaya na'ay Nahaata; <verse eid="1CH 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27"/>Nahaata na'ay Eli'aaba; Eli'aaba na'ay Yirohaama; Yirohaama na'ay Elk'k'aana.<verse eid="1CH 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28"/>Sammeela na'ay bayiray Yuu'eela; teefay Abiiya.<verse eid="1CH 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29"/>Maraara na'ay Maahila; Maahila na'ay Liibina; Liibina na'ay Shim"a; Shim"a na'ay Uuza; <verse eid="1CH 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30"/>Uuza na'ay Shim"a; Shim"a na'ay Haggiiya; Haggiiya na'ay Asaaya.<verse eid="1CH 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Geeshsha Golliyaan Yes's'iyaawantta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31"/>Daawite Taabootaa Yerusaalame aheeddawaappe guyyiyaan, mazimuriyaa yes's'anaadan Med'inaa Godaw gollen suntseeddawantu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32"/>Solomone Yerusaalamen Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'ana gakkanaw, S'oossaa Taabootay de'iyaa Dunkkaaniyaa sintsan unttunttu mazimuriyaa yes's'iidde, kaalaan kaalaan ootsino. <verse eid="1CH 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33"/>Barenttu naanatuwaanna ittippe yes's'eeddawanttu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:33">K'ahaata yaratuwaappe yes's'iyaawe Hemaana. Hemaani Yuu'eela na'aa; Yuu'eeli Sammeela na'aa; <verse eid="1CH 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34"/>Sammeeli Elk'k'aana na'aa; Elk'k'aani Yirohaama na'aa; Yirohaami Eli'eela na'aa; Eli'eeli Tooha na'aa; <verse eid="1CH 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35"/>Toohi S'ufa na'aa; S'ufi Elk'k'aana na'aa; Elk'k'aani Mahaata na'aa; Mahaati Amaasaaya na'aa; <verse eid="1CH 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36"/>Amaasaayi Elk'k'aana na'aa; Elk'k'aani Yuu'eela na'aa; Yuu'eeli Azaariyaasa na'aa; Azaariyaasi S'afaaniyaa na'aa; <verse eid="1CH 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37"/>S'afaanii Tahaata na'aa; Tahaati Asiira na'aa; Asiiri Ebiyaasaafa na'aa; Ebiyaasaafi K'oraaha na'aa; <verse eid="1CH 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38"/>K'oraahi Yis'ihaara na'aa; Yis'ihaari K'ahaata na'aa; K'ahaati Leewiyaa na'aa; Leewii Israa'eeliyaa na'aa.<verse eid="1CH 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39"/>Aa dabbuu Asaafe Aa ushechcha baggana ek'k'ee. Asaafe Berekiyaa na'aa; Berekii Shim"a na'aa; <verse eid="1CH 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40"/>Shim"i Mikaa'eela na'aa; Mikaa'eeli Ba'iseeya na'aa; Ba'iseeyi Malkkiyaa na'aa; <verse eid="1CH 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41"/>Malkkii Etaana na'aa; Etaani Zaraaha na'aa; Zaraahi Adaaya na'aa; <verse eid="1CH 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42"/>Adaayi Etaana na'aa; Etaani Ziimma na'aa; Ziimmi Shim"a na'aa; <verse eid="1CH 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43"/>Shim"i Yahaata na'aa; Yahaati Gershshoona na'aa; Gershshooni Leewiyaa na'aa.<verse eid="1CH 6:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44"/>Unttunttuppe haddirssa bagganna unttunttu dabbotuu, Maraara yaratuu ek'k'iino. Etaani K'iisha na'aa; K'iishi Abdda na'aa; Abddi Malluuka na'aa; <verse eid="1CH 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45"/>Malluuki Hashaabiyaa na'aa; Hashaabii Amesiyaasa na'aa; Amesiyaasi Hilk'k'iyaa na'aa; <verse eid="1CH 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46"/>Hilk'k'ii Amoos'a na'aa; Amoos'i Baana na'aa; Baani Shemeera na'aa; <verse eid="1CH 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47"/>Shemeeri Maahila na'aa; Maahili Musha na'aa; Mushi Maraara na'aa; Maraari Leewiyaa na'aa. <verse eid="1CH 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48"/>Unttunttu dabbotuu Leewatuu S'oossaa Dunkkaaniyaw ootsanaw suntsetteeddino.<verse eid="1CH 6:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaroona Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49"/>Shin Aaroonenne Aaroona zeretsatuu is'aanaa c'uwayiino; yarshshiyaa sa'aan s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaakka yarshshiino. S'oossaa k'oomay Muse azazeeddawaadan, Ubbaappe Aad'd'iyaa Geeshsha Sa'aan goynniyaa goynno ubbawunne S'oossay Israa'eeliyaa nagaraa atto geetettiyaa yarshshoo aawotetsay unttunttoo de'ee.<verse eid="1CH 6:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50"/>Aaroona yeletay hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawaa. Aaroona na'ay El"aazara; El"aazara na'ay Piinihaasa; Piinihaasa na'ay Abishuu'a; <verse eid="1CH 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51"/>Abishuu'a na'ay Buuk'a; Buuk'a na'ay Uuza; Uuza na'ay Zaraahiyaa. <verse eid="1CH 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52"/>Zaraahiyaa na'ay Maraayoota; Maraayoota na'ay Amaariyaa; Amaariyaa na'ay Ahis'uuba; <verse eid="1CH 6:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53"/>Ahis'uuba na'ay S'aadook'a; S'aadook'a na'ay Ahima'aas'a.<verse eid="1CH 6:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Leewiyaa Yaratuu De'eedda Sa'atuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54"/>Aaroona zaratuu barenttu zawaa giddon de'anaw unttunttu utetsaadan unttunttoo imetteedda sa'atuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:54">K'ahaata yaratuu koyro saamaa akkeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55"/>He saaman Yihudaan de'iyaa Kebroone katamaanne Kebroone yuushshuwaan de'iyaa hentsaa gadetuwaa unttunttoo immeeddino; <verse eid="1CH 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56"/>shin katamaa goshshaanne katamaa yuushshuwaan de'iyaa mootsatuwaa Yifune na'aa Kaaleebaw immeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57"/>Aaroona naanaw Asay bak'ati biide attiyaa katamaa, Kebroonenne Hara katamatuwaa Yatira, Liibinanne Eshttamoo'a Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, <verse eid="1CH 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58"/>Hiilenanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, Dabiiranne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, <verse eid="1CH 6:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59"/>Ashaananne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaanne Beeti-Shemeshanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa immeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 6:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60"/>K'ay Biiniyaama zaratuwaappe Gebaa'anne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, Alemetanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaanne Anatootanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa immeeddino. Aaroona naanaw imetteedda katamatuu ubbaanna tammanne heezza. <verse eid="1CH 6:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61"/>Minaase yaratuu baggatuu gadiyaappe tammu katamatuwaa atteeda K'ahaata yaratoo saaman immeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 6:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62"/>Yisaakoora zaratuwaa gadiyaappe, Aaseera zaratuwaa gadiyaappe, Nifttaaleema zaratuwaa biittaappenne Baasaanen de'iyaa Minaase yaratuu gadiyaappe tammanne heezzu katamatuwaa Gershshoona yaratoo saaman immeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 6:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63"/>Roobeela zaratuwaa gadiyaappe, Gaade zaratuwaa biittaappenne Zaabiloona zaratuwaa gadiyaappe tammanne laa"u katamatuwaa Maraara yaratoo saaman immeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 6:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64"/>Hewaadan ootsiide, Israa'eeliyaa Asay Leewatoo ha katamatuwaanne katamatuwaa heeraan de'iyaa hentsaa gadetuwaa immeedda. <verse eid="1CH 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65"/>K'ay Yihudaa zaratuwaa gadiyaappe, Simoona zaratuwaa biittaappenne Biiniyaama zaratuwaa gadiyaappe, hawaappe k'ommo baggana barenttu suntsan s'aafetteedda katamatuwaa unttunttoo saaman immeedda.<verse eid="1CH 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66"/>K'ahaata yaratuwaappe amareedawanttu barenttu katamatuwaa Efireema zaratuwaa katamatuwaappe akkeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="1CH 6:67"/>Unttunttoo Asay bak'ati biide attiyaa katamatuwaa, Efireema gezziyaan de'iyaa Sekeemanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, Gezeeranne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, <verse eid="1CH 6:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="1CH 6:68"/>Yok'ima'aamanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, Beeti-Horoonanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, <verse eid="1CH 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="1CH 6:69"/>Ayaaloonanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaanne Gaate-Rimmoonanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa immeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 6:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="1CH 6:70"/>Minaase zaratuwaa baggatuwaappe Aneeranne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaanne Bil"aamanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa akkiide, K'ahaata yaratuwaappe atteeddawanttoo immeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 6:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="1CH 6:71"/>Minaase zaratuwaa baggatuwaappe Baasaanen de'iyaa Golaananne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaanne Asttaarootanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa akkiide, Gershshoona yaratoo immeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 6:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="1CH 6:72"/>K'ay Yisaakoora zaratuwaappe K'aadeesanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, Dabiraatanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, <verse eid="1CH 6:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="1CH 6:73"/>Raamootanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaanne Aaneemanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa akkiide, unttunttoo immeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 6:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="1CH 6:74"/>K'aykka Aaseera zaratuwaappe Maashaalanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, Abddoonanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, <verse eid="1CH 6:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="1CH 6:75"/>Huk'ook'anne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaanne Rahoobanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa akkiide, unttunttoo immeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 6:75"/><verse number="76" style="v" sid="1CH 6:76"/>Hewaadankka Nifttaaleema zaratuwaappe Galiilan de'iyaa K'edeeshanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, Hammoonanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaanne K'iriyaatayimanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa akkiide, unttunttoo immeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 6:76"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="1CH 6:77"/>Atteeda Maraara yaratoo Zaabiloona zaratuwaappe Rimmoonanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaanne Taabooranne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa akkiide immeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 6:77"/><verse number="78" style="v" sid="1CH 6:78"/>K'ay Roobeela zaratuwaappe Yaarikko baggan, Yorddaanoosappe hefintsan away doliyaa baggana, mela biittaan de'iyaa Bee'eranne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, Yaahi'anne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, <verse eid="1CH 6:78"/><verse number="79" style="v" sid="1CH 6:79"/>K'idemootanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaanne Mefa'aatanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa akkiide, unttunttoo immeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 6:79"/><verse number="80" style="v" sid="1CH 6:80"/>K'aykka Gaade zaratuwaappe Gala'aaden de'iyaa Raamootanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, Maahinaymanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa, <verse eid="1CH 6:80"/><verse number="81" style="v" sid="1CH 6:81"/>Haseboonanne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaanne Yaa'izeeranne Aa hentsaa gadetuwaa akkiide unttunttoo immeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 6:81"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yisaakoora Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1"/>Yisaakooraw oyddu naanay de'iino; unttunttukka Tolaa'a, Puuwa, Yaashuubanne Shimiroona.<verse eid="1CH 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2"/>Tolaa'a naanay Uuza, Rafaaya, Yirii'eela, Yaahimaaya, Yibisaamanne Sammeela; unttunttu Tolaa'a yaratuu kaappatuwaa. Unttunttu wolk'k'aamanne s'ala asatuwaa. Daawita wode unttuntta paydu laatamanne laa"u sha"anne usuppun s'eeta.<verse eid="1CH 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3"/>Uuza na'ay Yiziraahiyaa. Yiziraahiyaa naanay Mikaa'eela, Obaadiyaa, Yuu'eelanne Yishiyaa; ha ichcheshatuukka soy asaa kaappatuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4"/>Barenttu aawotuwaa soy asaa yeletaadan olaw giigeedda olanchchatuu hattamanne usuppun sha"a; ayaw gooppe, unttunttoo c'ora machchetuunne c'ora naanay de'iino.<verse eid="1CH 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5"/>Yisaakoora zaratuwaappe olanchchatuu barenttu yeletaa mazggobiyaan paydettiide, ubbaanna hosppun tammanne laappun sha"a gideeddino.<verse eid="1CH 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biiniyaamanne Daana Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6"/>Biiniyaamaw heezzu naanay de'iino; unttunttukka Belaa'a, Bekeeranne Yidi'eela.<verse eid="1CH 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7"/>Belaa'a naanay Es'iboona, Uuza, Uuzi'eela, Yaarimootanne Ira; ha ichcheshatuukka soy asaa kaappatuwaa. Unttunttu wolk'k'aamanne s'ala asatuwaa. Barenttu yeletaadan paydeteedda olanchchatuu laatamanne laa"u sha"anne hattamanne oydda gideeddino.<verse eid="1CH 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8"/>Bekeera naanay Zamiira, Yo'aasha, El"eezera, Eliyoo'enaaya, Omira, Yaarimoota, Abiiya, Anatootanne Alemeeta; hawanttu ubbatuu Bekeera naanaa. <verse eid="1CH 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9"/>Barenttu yeletaa mazggobiyaadan paydeteedda wolk'k'aamanne s'ala asatuu laatamu sha"anne laa"u s'eeta gideeddino.<verse eid="1CH 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10"/>Yidi'eela na'ay Bilihaana. Bilihaana naanay Yi'uusha, Biiniyaama, Ehuuda, Kanaa'ina, Zetaana, Tarsseesanne Ahishahaara; <verse eid="1CH 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11"/>hawanttu ubbatuu Yidi'eela naanaa. Unttunttu soy asaa kaappatuwaanne wolk'k'aamanne s'ala asatuwaa. Barenttu yeletaadan paydeteedda olanchchatuu tammanne laappun sha"anne laa"u s'eeta.<verse eid="1CH 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12"/>K'ay Shufiiminne Hufiimi Ira naanaa. Hushiimi Daana na'aa.<verse eid="1CH 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nifttaaleema Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13"/>Nifttaaleema naanay Yaahis'i'eela, Guuna, Yes'eeranne Shaaluuma; hawanttu Baali naanaa naanaa.<verse eid="1CH 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minaase Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14"/>Minaase zaratuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta. Minaase Sooriyaa gadiyaappe akkeedda k'ubaatata yeleedda attuma naanay Asiri'eelanne Gala'aade aawuwaa Maakiina. <verse eid="1CH 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15"/>Maakiiri Hufiimaassinne Shufiimassi itti itti machchiyaa oochchiide immeedda. Maakiina michchati suntsay Maa'iko. Maakiina na'ay teefay S'alofihaada. S'alofihaad mac'c'a naanatuwaa s'alalaa yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16"/>Maakiina machata Maa'ika aw naanaa yelaaddu. Bayira na'aa Peresha suntsaaddu; Peresha ishaa suntsay Shereesha. Peresha naanay Ulaamanne Rak'eema. <verse eid="1CH 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17"/>Ulaama na'ay Badaana. Hawanttu Minaase na'aa na'aa, Maakiina na'aa Gala'aade zeretsaa.<verse eid="1CH 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18"/>Gala'aade michchata Hamolekeeta Ishooda, Abi'eezeranne Maahila yelaaddu.<verse eid="1CH 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19"/>Shamidaa'a naanay Ahiyaana, Shekeema, Liik'ihanne Ani'aama.<verse eid="1CH 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Efireema Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20"/>Efireema na'ay Shutelaaha; Shutelaaha na'ay Bereeda; Bereeda na'ay Tahaata; Tahaata na'ay El"aada; El"aada na'ay Tahaata; <verse eid="1CH 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21"/>Tahaata na'ay Zabaada; Zabaada na'ay Shutelaaha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 7:21">Efireemaw Ezeeranne El"aada geetettiyaa hara laa"u naanay de'iino. Unttunttu Gaate katamaa asatuwaa mehiyaa wuu"ishin, Asay unttuntta oyk'k'iide wod'eedda. <verse eid="1CH 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22"/>Hewaa diraw, unttunttu aawuu Efireeme daro wodiyaa kayyotteedda; kayyottina Aa ishatuu Aa mintsetsanaw yeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, I bare machchattina gaketteedda; Iza shahaaraade attuma na'aa yelaaddu. Efireema soo gakkeedda iita metuwaa diraw, I bare na'aa Barii'a suntseedda.<verse eid="1CH 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24"/>Efireemaw She'iiro giyaa naatta de'aw; Hirkki Beeti-Horoona, K'ommuwaa Beeti-Horoonanne Uzenishe'iira geetettiyaa katamatuwaa he naatta kees's'aaddu.<verse eid="1CH 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25"/>Efireema attuma na'ay Refaaha; Refaaha na'ay Resheefa; Resheefa na'ay Telaaha; Telaaha na'ay Tahaana; <verse eid="1CH 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26"/>Tahaana na'ay La'idaana; La'idaana na'ay Amihuuda; Amihuuda na'ay Elishamaa'a; <verse eid="1CH 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27"/>Elishamaa'a na'ay Nawa; Neewe na'ay Iyyaasa.<verse eid="1CH 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28"/>Efireema zaratuwaa biittay unttunttu de'iyaasay Beeteelenne Beeteele mootsatuwaa, away doliyaa baggana de'iyaa Na'iraana, away doliyaa baggana de'iyaa Gezeeranne Gezeera mootsatuwaa, Shekeemanne Shekeema mootsatuwaanne Aayanne Aaya mootsatuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29"/>K'ay Minaase zaratuwaa biittaa zawaan de'iyaa Beetishaananne Beetishaana mootsatuwaa, Taa'inaakkanne Taa'inaaka mootsatuwaa, Magidonne Magido mootsatuwaanne Dooranne Doora mootsatuwaa. Israa'eeliyaa na'aa Yooseefo zaratuu ha katamatuwaan de'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaseera Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30"/>Aaseera attuma naanay Yimina, Yishiwaaha, Yishiwaanne Barii'a; unttunttu michchata Seraaho.<verse eid="1CH 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31"/>Barii'a attuma naanay Hebeeranne Birzzaawita aawuwaa Malkki'eela.<verse eid="1CH 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32"/>Hebeeri Yaafilees'a, Shomeeranne Hotaama yeleedda; unttunttu michchati suntsay Shuu'o.<verse eid="1CH 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33"/>Yaafilees'a attuma naanay Paasaaka, Bimihaalanne Ashiwaata; hawanttu Yaafilees'a naanaa.<verse eid="1CH 7:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34"/>Yaafilees'a ishaa Shomeera attuma naanay Aaha, Rohiga, Yahuubanne Araama.<verse eid="1CH 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35"/>Aa ishaa Hotaama attuma naanay S'ofaaha, Yiminaa'a, Sheleeshanne Amaala.<verse eid="1CH 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36"/>S'ofaaha attuma naanay Suha, Harnneefera, Shu'aala, Beera, Yimira, <verse eid="1CH 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37"/>Bees'era, Hooda, Shamma, Shilshsha, Yitiraananne Ba'eera.<verse eid="1CH 7:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38"/>Yetera attuma naanay Yifuna, Pisppanne Aara. <verse eid="1CH 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39"/>Ulla attuma naanay Araaha, Hani'eelanne Riis'iyaa.<verse eid="1CH 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40"/>Hawanttu ubbatuu Aaseera zeretsaa. Unttunttu barenttu aawotuwaa soy asaa kaappatuwaanne dooretteedda wolk'k'aamanne s'ala asatuwaa. Barenttu yeletaadan paydeteedda olanchchatuu laatamanne usuppun sha"aa gideeddino.<verse eid="1CH 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8"/>
  <para style="s">Biiniyaama Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1"/>Biiniyaama na'ay bayiray Belaa'a; teefay Ashibeela; heezzentsuu Ahiraaha; <verse eid="1CH 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2"/>oyddentsuu Noha; ichcheshentsu Raafa.<verse eid="1CH 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3"/>Belaa'a attuma naanay Adaara, Geera, Abihuuda, <verse eid="1CH 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4"/>Abishuu'a, Naa'imaana, Ahooha, <verse eid="1CH 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5"/>Geera, Shafufaamanne Huraama.<verse eid="1CH 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6-7"/>Ehuuda attuma naanay Naa'imaana, Akiiyanne Geera. Unttunttu Gebaa'an de'eedda barenttu aawotuwaa soy asaa kaappatuwaa. Hewaappe guyyiyaan, unttunttu Manahaata gadiyaa omoodetti beeddino. Unttunttu kaappuu Geeri Uuzanne Ahihuuda aawuwaa.<verse eid="1CH 8:6-7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8"/>Shaharaami bare machatuwaa Hushiimonne Baa'iro yeddeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Moo'aabe gadiyaan attuma naanaa yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 8:9"/>Shaharaami bare machati Hodeeshin Yobaaba, S'iibiyaa, Meesha, Malkkaama, <verse eid="1CH 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 8:10"/>Ya'uus'a, Saakiyaanne Mirmma yeleedda. Aa naanay ubbay soy asaa kaappatuwaa gideeddino. <verse eid="1CH 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:11"/>I bare machati Hushiimin, Ahis'uubanne Elppa'aala yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12"/>Elppa'aala attuma naanay Ebeera, Misha'aamanne Shemeda. Shemedi Oonanne Looda katamatuwaanne unttunttu heeraan de'iyaa mootsatuwaa kees's'eedda.<verse eid="1CH 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:13"/>K'ay Shaharaami Barii'anne Shemaa'a yeleedda. Unttunttu Ayaaloona kataman de'iyaa barenttu soy asaa kaappatuwaa. Unttunttu Gaate kataman de'iyaa asaa yedersseeddino. <verse eid="1CH 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14"/>K'aykka Shaharaami Ahiyaa, Shaashak'a, Yiremoota yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15"/>Zabaade, Araadi, Edeeri, <verse eid="1CH 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16"/>Mikaa'eeli, Yishppinne Yoohi Barii'a attuma naanaa.<verse eid="1CH 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17"/>Zabaade, Mashulaami, Hizk'k'i, Hebeeri, <verse eid="1CH 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18"/>Yishimaraayi, Yuzilii'inne Yobaabi Elppa'aala attuma naanaa.<verse eid="1CH 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19"/>Yaak'iimi, Ziikiri, Zabddi, <verse eid="1CH 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20"/>Eli'enaayi, S'ilttaayi, Eli'eeli, <verse eid="1CH 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21"/>Adaayi, Baraayinne Shiimiraati Shim"a attuma naanaa.<verse eid="1CH 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22"/>Yishp'p'aani, Ebeeri, Eli'eeli, <verse eid="1CH 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23"/>Abddooni, Ziikiri, Hanaani, <verse eid="1CH 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24"/>Hanaaniyaa, Elaami, Anttootii, <verse eid="1CH 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25"/>Yifidaaynne Panu'eeli Shaashak'a attuma naanaa.<verse eid="1CH 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26"/>Shaamisharaayi, Shahaari, Ataalii, <verse eid="1CH 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27"/>Yaa'ireeshii, Eelaasinne Ziikiri Yirohaama attuma naanaa.<verse eid="1CH 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28"/>Hawanttu barenttu yeletaan Yerusaalamen utteedda barenttu soy asaa kaappatuwaa.<verse eid="1CH 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaatiyaa Saa'oola Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 9:35-44">9:35-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29"/>Gabaa'oona aawuu Yi'i'eeli Gabaa'oona kataman de'eedda. Aa machchatti suntsay Maa'iko. <verse eid="1CH 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30"/>Aa na'ay bayiray Abddoona; Aa attuma naanay haratuu S'uura, K'iisa, Ba'aala, Nadaaba, <verse eid="1CH 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31"/>Gadoora, Ahiyaa, Zekeranne <verse eid="1CH 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32"/>Mik'iloota. Mik'ilooti Shim"a yeleedda. Hawanttu k'ay Yerusaalamen de'iyaa barenttu dabbattuu matan de'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33"/>Neeri K'iisa yeleedda; K'iisi Saa'oola yeleedda. Saa'ooli Yoonataana, Malkkishuu'a, Abinaadaabanne Eshiba'aala yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34"/>Yoonataana na'ay Mariiba'aala; Mariiba'aali Mikiyaasa yeleedda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:34 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mariiba'aala: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I k'ay Manfibosheeta geetetteedda. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 4:4">2 Sam. 4:4</ref></char> s'eella.</note><verse eid="1CH 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35"/>Mikiyaasa attuma naanay Pittoona, Meleka, Taree'anne Akaaza. <verse eid="1CH 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36"/>Akaazi Yaho'aada yeleedda. Yaho'aad Alemeeta, Azimaaweetuwaanne Zimira yeleedda. Zimiri Moos'a yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37"/>Moos'i Biini'a yeleedda; Biini'i Raafa yeleedda; Raafi El"aasa yeleedda; El"aasi As'eela yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38"/>As'eelaw usuppun attuma naanay de'iino. Unttunttu suntsay Azirik'aama, Bookera, Isimaa'eela, Sha'aariyaa, Obaadiyaanne Hanaana; hawanttu ubbay As'eela naanaa.<verse eid="1CH 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39"/>As'eela ishaa Esheek'aw heezzu naanay de'iino. Aa na'ay bayiray Ulaama; teefay Yi'uusha; heezzentsuu Elifelees'a.<verse eid="1CH 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40"/>Ulaama naanay wolk'k'aamanne s'ala asatuwaa; unttunttu wonddaafiyaa asatuwaa. Ulaamaw s'eetanne ishatamuwaa gidiyaa naanaynne naanaa naanay de'iino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 8:40">Hawanttu ubbatuu Biiniyaama zeretsaa.<verse eid="1CH 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9"/>
  <para style="s">Omooduwaappe Simmeedda Israa'eeliyaa Asaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1"/>Israa'eeliyaa Asay ubbay bare yeletaan yeletaan s'aafetteedda; ha taarikii Israa'eeliyaa Kaatetuu mas'aafan de'ee.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:1">Yihudaa Asay ammanettibeenna diraw, Baabloone gadiyaa omoodetti beeddino. <verse eid="1CH 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2"/>Koyro simmeedda Israa'eeliyaa asay, k'eesatuu, Leewatuunne Geeshsha Golliyaan ootsiyaawanttu barenttu sa'atuwaaninne barenttu katamatuwaan utteeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:27">Izr. 2:27</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 7:73">Nah. 7:73</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3"/>Yihudaa zaratuwaappe, Biiniyaama zaratuwaappe, Efireema zaratuwaappenne Minaase zaratuwaappe amareedawanttu Yerusaalamen de'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yihudaa Yaratuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4"/>Yihudaa na'aa Paareesa yaratuwaappe Utaayi Yerusaalamen utteeddawanttu kaappuwaa. Utaayi Amihuuda na'aa; Amihuudi Omira na'aa; Omiri Imira na'aa; Imiri Baana na'aa.<verse eid="1CH 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 9:5"/>Yihudaa na'aa Sheela yaratuwaappe Asaayinne Aa naanay Yerusaalamen utteeddawanttu kaappatuwaa.<verse eid="1CH 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:6"/>Yihudaa na'aa Zaraaha yaratuwaappe Yi'u'eeli Yerusaalamen utteeddawanttu kaappuwaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:6">Yihudaa zaratuu paydina ubbaanna usuppun s'eetanne udduppun tamma.<verse eid="1CH 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biiniyaama Yaratuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7-9"/>Biiniyaama yaratuu kaappatuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:7-9">Kaappuu Saalu Mashulaama na'aa; Mashulaami Hodaawiyaa na'aa; Hodaawii Hassanuu'a na'aa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:7-9">Kaappuu Yibinaayi Yirohaama na'aa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:7-9">Kaappuu Eeli Uuza na'aa; Uuzi Miikira na'aa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:7-9">Kaappuu Mashulaami Shafaayaa na'aa; Shafaas'i Ra'u'eela na'aa; Ra'u'eeli Yibiniyaa na'aa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:7-9">Biiniyaama zaratuu paydina ubbaanna udduppun s'eetanne ishatamanne usuppuna.<verse eid="1CH 9:7-9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yerusaalamen De'eedda K'eesetuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10"/>Yerusaalamen de'eedda k'eesatuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:10">Unttunttu Yadaaya, Yihoyaariba, Yaakiinanne <verse eid="1CH 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 9:11"/>S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaan kaappotiyaa Azaariyaasa. Azaariyaasi Hilk'k'iyaa na'aa; Hilk'k'ii Mashulaama na'aa; Mashulaami S'aadook'a na'aa; S'aadook'e Maraayoota na'aa; Maraayooti Ahis'uuba na'aa.<verse eid="1CH 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:12"/>Haratuu k'ay Yirohaama na'aa Adaayanne Adii'eela na'aa Ma'isaaya. Yirohaami Paashihuura na'aa; Paashihuuri Malkkiyaa na'aa. Adii'eeli Yaahizeera na'aa; Yaahizeeri Mashulaama na'aa; Mashulaami Mashilemiita na'aa; Mashilemiiti Imeera na'aa.<verse eid="1CH 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13"/>Barenttu soy asaw kaappotiyaa k'eesatuu itti sha"anne laappun s'eetanne usuppun tamma. Hawanttu S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaan ootsanaw danddayiyaa asatuwaa.<verse eid="1CH 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yerusaalamen De'eedda Leewatuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14"/>Yerusaalamen de'eedda Leewatuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:14">Haashshuuba na'ay Shamaa'e Maraara yara. Hashshuubi Azirik'aama na'aa; Azirik'aami Hashaabiyaa na'aa.<verse eid="1CH 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 9:15"/>Haratuu k'ay Bak'ibak'aara, Hereesha, Galaalanne Mataaniyaa. Mataanee Miika na'aa; Miiki Ziikira na'aa; Ziikiri Asaafa na'aa.<verse eid="1CH 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:16"/>Haratuu k'ay Nas'oofa asatuwaa mootsatuwaan utteedda Obaadiyaanne Berekiyaa. Obaadi Shamaa'iyaa na'aa; Shamaa'e Galaala na'aa; Galaali Yidutuuna na'aa. Berekii Asa na'aa; Asay Elk'k'aana na'aa.<verse eid="1CH 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yerusaalamen Penggiyaa Naagiyaawantta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17"/>Geeshsha Golliyaa penggiyaa naagiyaawanttu Shaaluuma, Ak'k'uuba, S'almmoona, Ahimaananne unttunttu dabbotuwaa. Shaaluumi unttunttu kaappuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 9:18"/>Ha yaratuu kase away doliyaa baggana de'iyaa, Kaatiyaa Penggiyaa giyaa penggiyaa naageeddino. Hewaappe kase unttunttu Leewatuu dunkkaaniyaa wode naageeddino.<verse eid="1CH 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:19"/>Shaaluumi Ebiyaasaafa na'aa K'ore na'aa; I K'oraaha yara asaa. K'oraaha yaratuu kase Med'inaa Godaa Dunkkaaniyaa naageeddawaadan, Shaaluuminne K'oraaha yara gidiyaa Aa dabbotuu Geeshsha Golliyaa geliyaa penggiyaa naagiino.<verse eid="1CH 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20"/>El"aazara na'ay Piinihaasi beni wode K'oraaha yaratuu kaappuwaa; Med'inaa Goday aanana de'eedda.<verse eid="1CH 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21"/>Mashelemiyaa na'ay Zakkaraasi Gakketiyaa Dunkkaaniyaa geliyaa penggiyaa naageedda.<verse eid="1CH 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22"/>Penggiyaa naaganaw dooretteeddawanttu ubbaanna laa"u s'eetanne tammanne laa"uwaa; hawanttu barenttu mootsan mootsan paydettiide s'aafetteeddino. Unttunttu yaratoo ha aawotetsaa immeeddawanttu Kaatiyaa Daawitanne timbbitiyaa odiyaa Sammeela. <verse eid="1CH 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23"/>Hewaa diraw, unttunttune unttunttu naanay Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaa geliyaa penggiyaa naagiino. <verse eid="1CH 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24"/>Oyddu zoozetuun wulahaaninne, dolahaan, huup'issaninne gedissanna itti itti penggii de'ee; he penggetuwaa naagiyaawanttukka de'iino. <verse eid="1CH 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25"/>He mootsan de'iyaa unttunttu dabbotuu laappuntsa laappuntsa gallassan laametti naagiide, unttuntta maaddino.<verse eid="1CH 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26"/>Penggiyaa naagiyaa oyddu kaappatuu Leewatuwaa; unttunttu S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaw, Aa giddo kifiletoonne kifiletuu gidduwaan de'iyaa miishshatoo aawotiino. <verse eid="1CH 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27"/>S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaa naagiyaawanttunne k'ay guura guura kariyaa dooyiyaawanttu unttuntta gidiyaa diraw, yaan ak'iino.<verse eid="1CH 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hara Leewatuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28"/>Leewatuwaappe amareedawanttu goynniyaa wode go'ettiyaa miishshatoo aawotiino; he miishshatuwaa kare kessiyaa wodenne soo gelissiyaa wode unttunttu paydiino. <verse eid="1CH 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29"/>K'ay unttuttuppe ittuu ittuu Geeshsha Golliyaa gidduwaan go'ettiyaa hara miishshatoo, liik'o d'iiliyaw, woyniyaa eessaw, zayitiyaw, is'aanaawunne sawotoo aawotiino. <verse eid="1CH 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30"/>Shin k'eesatuwaa naanatuwaappe ittuu ittuu sawuwaa likkii likkiide walakkiino.<verse eid="1CH 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31"/>K'oraaha yaratuwaappe Shaaluuma bayira na'ay Matiite yarshshuwaa ukitsaa uukkiyaawoo aawotee. <verse eid="1CH 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32"/>K'ahaata yara gidiyaa unttunttu dabbatuwaappe amareedawanttu k'ay Sambbatan Sambbatan s'arp'p'eezan wotsiyaa ukitsaa giigissiyaa aawotetsaa oyk'k'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33"/>Leewatuu zaratuwaappe amareeda kaappatuu Geeshsha Golliyaan yes's'iyaawantta. K'ammakka gallassikka unttunttu ootsiyaa diraw, hara oosuwaa ootsennan, eeshshaa Golliyaa dirssaa giddon de'iyaa golletuwaan de'iino.<verse eid="1CH 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34"/>Leewiyaa zaratuwaa soy asaa kaappatuu ubbay hawaappe k'ommonna s'aafetteeddawantta; unttunttu Yerusaalamen de'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaatiyaa Saa'oola Yeletaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 8:29-38">8:29-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35"/>Gabaa'oona aawuu Yi'i'eeli Gabaa'oona kataman de'eedda. Aa machchatti suntsay Maa'iko. <verse eid="1CH 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36"/>Aa na'ay bayiray Abddoona; Aa naanay haratuu S'uura, K'iisa, Ba'aala, Neera, Nadaaba, <verse eid="1CH 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37"/>Gadoora, Ahiyaa, Zakkaraasa Mik'iloota. <verse eid="1CH 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38"/>Mik'ilooti Shim"a yeleedda. Hawanttu k'ay Yerusaalamen de'iyaa barenttu dabbattuu matan de'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39"/>Neeri K'iisa yeleedda; K'iisi Saa'oola yeleedda. Saa'ooli Yoonataana, Malkkishuu'a, Abinaadaabanne Eshiba'aala yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40"/>Yoonataana na'ay Mariiba'aala;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:40 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mariiba'aala: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I k'ay Manfibosheeta geetetteedda. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 4:4">2 Sam. 4:4</ref></char> s'eella.</note> Mariiba'aali Mikiyaasa yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41"/>Mikiyaasa naanay Pittoona, Meleka, Taree'anne Akaaza. <verse eid="1CH 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42"/>Akaazi Yaa'iira yeleedda. Yaa'iiri Alemeeta, Azimaaweetuwaanne Zimira yeleedda. Zimiri Moos'a yeleedda; <verse eid="1CH 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43"/>Moos'i Biini'a yeleedda; Biini'i Rafaaya yeleedda; Rafaayi El"aasa yeleedda; El"aasi As'eela yeleedda.<verse eid="1CH 9:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44"/>As'eelaw usuppun attuma naanay de'iino. Unttunttu suntsay Azirik'aama, Bookera, Isimaa'eela, Sha'aariyaa, Obaadiyaanne Hanaana; hawanttu ubbay As'eela naanaa.<verse eid="1CH 9:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10"/>
  <para style="ms">Saa'oolanne Aa Naanatuwaa Hayk'k'uwaa</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="1CH 10:1-14">10:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Kaatiyaa Saa'oola Hayk'k'uwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">1 Sam. 31:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1"/>Piliss's'eema asatuu Israa'eeliyaa asatuwaana oletteeddino. Israa'eeliyaa asatuu Piliss's'eema asatuwaa sintsaappe bak'atteedino. Daro Israa'eelatuu Gilbboo'a Deriyan hayk'k'eeddino. <verse eid="1CH 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2"/>Piliss's'eema asatuu Saa'oolanne Aa attuma naanaa yederssi gakkiide, Saa'oola naanaa Yoonataana, Abinaadaabanne Malkkishuu'a wod'eeddino. <verse eid="1CH 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3"/>Olay Saa'oola yuuyyi aad'd'iide un"etteedda; wonddaafiyaa asatuu Saa'oola demmeedda wode, zubbiyaan Aa c'addiide maduns's'iseeddino.<verse eid="1CH 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4"/>Saa'ooli bare ola miishshaa tookkiyaawaa, «Ha k'as's'arettibeenna Piliss's'eematuu yiide, ta bolla kaa'ennaadan, ne mashshaan c'addaade, taana neeni wod'a» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 10:4">Shin Aa ola miishshaa tookkiyaawe loytsi yayyeedda diraw is's'eedda; Saa'ooli bare mashshaa sa'aan essiide, Aa bolla kunddeedda. <verse eid="1CH 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5"/>Aa ola shaluwaa tookkiyaawe Saa'ooli hayk'k'eeddawaa be'iide, ikka bare mashshaa sa'aan essiide, Aa bolla kunddiide, hayk'k'i aggeeda. <verse eid="1CH 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6"/>Hawaadan haniide, Saa'ooli, Aa naanay heezzuunne Aa soy Asay ubbay he gallassi ittippe hayk'k'eeddino. <verse eid="1CH 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7"/>Wombban de'iyaa Israa'eeliyaa asatuu ubbay barenttu olanchchatuu bak'ateeddawaanne Saa'oolinne Aa naanay hayk'k'eeddawaa siseedda wode, unttunttukka barenttu katamatuwaa aggiide bak'atteedino. Bak'atina Piliss's'eema asatuu yiide, he katamatuwaan de'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8"/>Wonttetsa gallassi Piliss's'eematuu anhatuwaa bollaappe olaa miishshatuwaa k'aari akkanaw yiide, Saa'oolinne Aa naanay Gilbboo'a Deriyan hayk'k'iidde, giseeddawantta demmeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9"/>Unttunttu Saa'oola k'ood'iyaa muuc'eeddinonne Aa ola shaluwaa k'aari akkeeddino. Yaatiide barenttu Eek'atuwaa golleninne barenttu asaa gidduwaan s'oonuwaa awaayana mala, Piliss's'eema biittaw ubbaw asaa kiitaa yedeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10"/>Unttunttu Saa'oola olaa miishshaa barenttu s'oossatuwaa golletuwaappe ittuwaan wotseeddino; Aa guuggiyaakka barenttu s'oossaa Daagoona Eek'aa Gollen kak'k'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11"/>Piliss's'eema asatuu Saa'oola ootseeddawaa ubbaa Gala'aaden de'iyaa Yaabeesha katamaa asatuu siseedda wode, <verse eid="1CH 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12"/>unttunttu mino asatuu ubbay biide, Saa'oola anhaanne Aa naanaa ahaa akkiide, Yaabeesha katamaa aheeddino. Yaabeeshan de'iyaa wolaa garssan unttunttu mek'etsaa moogeeddino; yaatiide laappun gallassaa s'oomeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13-14"/>Saa'ooli Med'inaa Godaw ammanettibeenna diraw hayk'k'eedda. Med'inaa Godaa k'aalaa I naagibeenna; Med'inaa Godaana zorettiyaawaa aggiide, moyttilliyaa s'eesiyaa asaana zoretteedda. Hewaa diraw, Med'inaa Goday Aa wod'iide, Aa kawutetsaa Isseya na'aa Daawitaw aatsiide immeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:31">Wog. 19:31</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:6">20:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 13:8-14">1 Sam. 13:8-14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:1-24">15:1-24</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:7-8">28:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CH 10:13-14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11"/>
  <para style="ms">Daawite Kaatetussaanne Yerusaalame Oyk'k'ussaa</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="1CH 11:1-9">11:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Daawite Israa'eeliyaaninne Yihudaan Kaateteedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:1-10">2 Sam. 5:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Israa'eeliyaa Asay ubbay ittippe Kebroonan de'iyaa Daawitakko shiik'iide, «Nuuni ne suutsanne ne ashuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2"/>Kase Saa'ooli kaatiyaa gidiide de'iyaa wodekka, Israa'eeliyaa asaa olaw kaaletseeddawe neena. Med'inaa Goday ne S'oossay neena, ‹Ta asaa Israa'eeliyaa neeni heemmana; unttunttu bollakka neeni kaatetana› yaageedda» yaageedda. <verse eid="1CH 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3"/>Hewaa diraw, Israa'eeliyaa c'imatuu ubbay Kaatiyaa Daawitakko Kebroone katamaa yeeddino; I unttunttunna Kebroonan Med'inaa Godaa sintsan k'aalaa c'aak'uwaa c'aak'k'eteedda. Med'inaa Goday Sammeela baggana haasayeedda k'aalaadan, Daawite Israa'eeliyaa bolla kaatetanaaddan unttunttu Aa okkeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4"/>Daawitenne Israa'eeliyaa Asay ubbay Yerusaalame katamaa beeddino. He wode Yaabuusa asatuu he sa'aan de'iyaa diraw, he katamay Yaabuusa geetettee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:63">Iya. 15:63</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 1:21">Dat. 1:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5"/>Yaabuusa asatuu Daawita, «Neeni ha katamaa gelanaw ubbakka danddayakka» yaageeddino. Gidooppenne, Daawite S'iyoonen de'iyaa unttunttu geesatuwaa oyk'k'eedda; S'iyoone Daawita Katamaa geetetteedda. <verse eid="1CH 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6"/>Daawite bare olanchchatuwaa, «Yaabuusa asatuu kaseti oliyaa ooninne ola gadaawaa gidanawaa» yaageedda. S'aruuyi na'ay Yoo'aabe kaseti biide oleedda; yaatiide gadaawaa gideedda. <verse eid="1CH 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7"/>Daawite he geessuwaan de'eedda; hewaa diraw, he katamay Daawita Katamaa geetetteedda.<verse eid="1CH 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8"/>Daawite Miilloppe doommiide, he katamaa zaaretsiide kees's'eedda; atteeda katamaa k'ay Yoo'aabe zaaretsiide kees's'eedda. <verse eid="1CH 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9"/>Ubbaappe Wolk'k'aama Med'inaa Goday aanana de'iyaa diraw, Daawite min minniide beedda.<verse eid="1CH 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="ms">Waariyaanna De'iyaa Daawita Wotaadaratuwaa</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="1CH 11:10-12:40">11:10—12:40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Daawita Asatuwaa Minotaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 23:8-39">2 Sam. 23:8-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10"/>Daawita asatuu minotuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddino. Med'inaa Goday Israa'eeliyaabaa haasayeeddawaadan, Daawite kaatetana mala, ha asatuu Israa'eeliyaa asaana gidiide, loytsi maaddeeddino. K'ay Aa kawutetsaakka miniseeddino.<verse eid="1CH 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11"/>Daawita asatuu minotuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta. Unttunttuppe heezzatuu loytsi eretteeddawantta. Heezzatuwaappe koyruu Hakimoonappe yeedda Yaashobi'aama; Yaashobi'aami itti gede olan heezzu s'eetu asaa bare tooraan wod'eedda. <verse eid="1CH 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12"/>Heezzu mino asatuwaa giddon Aa kaalliide de'iyaawe Ahoohiyaa Dooddo na'aa El"aazara. <verse eid="1CH 11:12"/><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13-14"/>Piliss's'eema asatuu olettanaw Pasddaamima giyaa sa'aa shiik'eedda wode, El"aazare Daawitana ittippe de'ee. Israa'eeliyaa olanchchatuu Piliss's'eema asatuwaa sintsaappe bak'atiyaa wode, El"aazare banggaa shooyk'an de'ee. Inne Daawitenne shoyk'aa gidduwaan ek'k'iide, Piliss's'eema asatuwaana oletteeddino. Med'inaa Goday wolk'k'aama s'oonuwaa immiide, unttunttu ashsheeda.<verse eid="1CH 11:13-14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15"/>Piliss's'eema olanchchatuu Rafayma Wombban dunkkaaneedda wode, hattamu kaappatuwaappe heezzatuu Daawite de'iyaa Adulaama gonggoluwaan de'iyaa zaallaakko yeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16"/>He wode Daawite geessuwaa giddon de'ee; Piliss's'eema olanchchatuu c'uguu Beeteleheemen de'ee. <verse eid="1CH 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17"/>Daawite haatsaa ushanaw amottiide, «Beeteleeme katamaa penggiyaa miyiyaan de'iyaa pulttuwaa haatsaappe taana ooni ushshanddeeshsha!» yaageedda. <verse eid="1CH 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18"/>Heezzu mino asatuu Piliss's'eema asatuu dunkkaaneedda sa'aa pini biide, Beeteleeme katamaa penggiyaan de'iyaa pulttuwaappe haatsaa duuk'k'iide, Daawitaw aheeddino. Shin Daawite ushennaan is's'eedda; I he haatsaa Med'inaa Godaa sintsan tigeedda. <verse eid="1CH 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19"/>«Hawaa ushanawe taappe haakko! Barenttu shemppuwaa olettiide beedda ha asatuwaa suutsaa taani ushoo? Ayaw gooppe, unttunttu barenttu shemppuwaa aatsi immiide, haatsaa aheeddino» yaageedda. Hewaa diraw, Daawite he haatsaa ushibeenna. He heezzu mino asatuu hewaa ootseeddino.<verse eid="1CH 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20"/>Yoo'aaba ishay Abishaayi heezatoo kaappuuwaa. I bare tooraan heezzu s'eetu asatuwaa olettiide wod'eedda. Yaatiide ikka hara heezzatuwaadan eretteedda. <verse eid="1CH 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21"/>I laa"entso heezatuwaappe aad'd'i bonchchetteedda asaa; I unttunttoo kaappo gideedda. Shin I he koyro heezzatuwaana k'ara gidena.<verse eid="1CH 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22"/>K'abs's'i'eelappe yeedda Yoodaahe na'ay Banaayi mino asaa; mino oosatuwaa ootseedda. I laa"u eretteedda Moo'aabe gadiyaa asatuu wod'eedda. K'ay shachchay dareedda itti gallassi ollaa giddo geliide, gaammuwaa wod'eedda. <verse eid="1CH 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23"/>Banaayi geesay ichcheshu wad'aa gakkiyaa Gibs'e gade bitaniyaa adussa wod'eedda. Gibs'e bitaniyaa kushiyan shemayinniyaa wonddarashiyaa keeshshaa tooray de'ee; shin Banaayi gatimaa oyk'k'iide, bitaniyaakko beedda. He bitaniyaa kushiyaappe tooraa wotsi akkiide, Aa tooraan Aa wod'eedda. <verse eid="1CH 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24"/>Yoodaahe na'ay Banaayi hawantta ootseedda. Aa suntsaykka he heezzatuwaadan eretteedda. <verse eid="1CH 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25"/>I hattamatuwaa giddon daro bonchchetteedda; shin I heezzatuwaana gujjetena. Daawite Aa barena naagiyaa olanchchatoo kaappuuwaa keseedda.<verse eid="1CH 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26"/>Mino asatuu Yoo'aaba ishaa Asaaheela, Beeteleheemeppe yeedda Dooddo na'aa Elihanaana, <verse eid="1CH 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27"/>Haroodappe yeedda Shammoota, Piloonappe yeedda Helees'a, <verse eid="1CH 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28"/>Tak'o"appe yeedda Ik'k'eesha na'aa Ira, Anatootappe yeedda Abi'eezera, <verse eid="1CH 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29"/>Huushappe yeedda Sibbakaaya, Ahoohiyaa Ilaaya, <verse eid="1CH 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30"/>Nas'oofappe yeedda Maahiraaya, Nas'oofappe yeedda Ba'aana na'aa Heleeda, <verse eid="1CH 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31"/>Biiniyaama gadiyaan de'iyaa Gib'aa katamaappe yeedda Ribaaya na'aa Ittaaya, Pir"aatoonappe yeedda Banaaya, <verse eid="1CH 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32"/>Ga'aasha Zanggaaraa matappe yeedda Huraaya, Aarabappe yeedda Abii'eela, <verse eid="1CH 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33"/>Baahiruumappe yeedda Azimaaweeta, Sha'albboonappe yeedda Eliyaahiba, <verse eid="1CH 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34"/>Giizoonappe yeedda Hasheema, Haaraarappe yeedda Shaage na'aa Yoonataana, <verse eid="1CH 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35"/>Haaraarappe yeedda Sakaara na'aa Ahi'aama, Uura na'aa Elifaala, <verse eid="1CH 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36"/>Makeerappe yeedda Hefeera, Piloonappe yeedda Akiiya, <verse eid="1CH 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37"/>K'armmeloosappe yeedda Hes'ira, Ezbbaaya na'aa Naa'iraaya, <verse eid="1CH 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38"/>Naataana ishaa Yuu'eela, Haagira na'aa Mibihaara, <verse eid="1CH 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39"/>Amoonappe yeedda S'elek'a, S'aruuyi na'aa Yoo'aaba ola miishshaa tookkiyaa Ba'erootappe yeedda Naahiraaya, <verse eid="1CH 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40"/>Yatira yara gidiyaa Ira, Yatira yara gidiyaa Gaareeba, <verse eid="1CH 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41"/>Hiitiyaa Uuriyoona, Ahilaaya na'aa Zabaadanne <verse eid="1CH 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42"/>Roobeela zariyaa gidiyaa Shiiza na'aa Adiina. I Roobeela zaratuwaa kaappuuwaa; aanana ittippe hattamu asatuu de'iino. <verse eid="1CH 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43"/>Hara mino asatuu k'ay Maa'ika na'aa Hanaana, Mitaanappe yeedda Yoshafaas'a, <verse eid="1CH 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44"/>Ashttaarappe yeedda Ooziyaana, Aaro'eerappe yeedda Hotaama naanaa Shamaa'anne Yi'i'eela, <verse eid="1CH 11:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45"/>Shiimira na'aa Yidi'eelanne Aa ishaa Tiis'appe yeedda Yooha, <verse eid="1CH 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46"/>Mahaawaappe yeedda Eli'eela, Elnna'aama naanaa Yiriibaayanne Yooshaawiyaa, Moo'aabe gadiyaappe yeedda Yitima, <verse eid="1CH 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47"/>S'ooba katamaappe yeedda Eli'eela, Yoobeedanne Ya'isi'eela.<verse eid="1CH 11:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12"/>
  <para style="s">Biiniyaama Zariyaappe Daawita Kaalleedda Asatuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1"/>Daawite K'iisa na'aa Saa'oolappe bak'ati biide, S'ik'ilaagan utteedda wode, aakko yeedda asatuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta. Unttunttu kase Daawita olan maaddeedda mino asatuwaa giddon de'iino. <verse eid="1CH 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2"/>Unttunttu wonddaafiyaa asatuwaa; K'ay barenttu ushechcha kushiyaaninne haddirssa kushiyan shuchchaa yambbarshshan olanaw danddayiino. Unttunttu Biiniyaama zariyaa gidiyaa Saa'oola dabbotuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3"/>Unttunttu kaappuu Ahi'eezera; Ahi'eezerappe simmina Yo'aasha; unttunttu Gib"appe yeedda Shamaa'a naanaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 12:3">Haratuu k'ay Azimaaweeta naanaa gidiyaa Yizi'eelanne Pelees'a, Baraaka, Anatootappe yeedda Yeeha, <verse eid="1CH 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4"/>hattamatuwaa giddon wolk'k'aama gidiide, unttuntta kaaletsiyaa Gabaa'oonappe yeedda Yishimaa'iyaa, Ermaasa, Yahaazi'eela, Yohanaana, Gedeerappe yeedda Yozabaada, <verse eid="1CH 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5"/>El"uzaaya, Yaarimoota, Ba'aaliyaa, Shamaariyaa, Hariifappe yeedda Shafaas'iyaa, <verse eid="1CH 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6"/>K'oraaha yaratuwaa gidiyaa Elk'k'aana, Yishiyaa, Azaari'eela, Yo'eezeranne Yaashobi'aama, <verse eid="1CH 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7"/>Gadoorappe yeedda Yirohaama naanaa Yo'eelanne Zabaadiyaa.<verse eid="1CH 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaade Zariyaappe Daawita Kaalleedda Asatuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8"/>Daawite mela biittaan de'iyaa bak'ati attiyaa sa'aan utti de'ishshin, Gaade zariyaappe asatuu aakko yeeddino. Unttunttu mino asatuwaanne olaw giigeeddawantta; k'ay gonddalliyaanne tooraa oyk'k'anaw danddayiyaawantta. Unttunttu som"i gaammuwaa deemuwaa malatee; unttunttu deretuwaa huup'iyaan guppiyaa gen"iyaadan elleelliino. <verse eid="1CH 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9"/>Unttunttu kaappuu Es'eera; laa"entsuu Obaadiyaa; heezzentsuu Eli'aaba; <verse eid="1CH 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 12:10"/>oyddentsuu Mishimaanna; ichcheshentsu Ermaasa; <verse eid="1CH 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 12:11"/>usuppuntsuu Attaaya; laappuntsuu Eli'eela; <verse eid="1CH 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 12:12"/>hosppuntsuu Yohanaana; udduppuntsuu Elzzabaada; <verse eid="1CH 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:13"/>tammantsuu Ermaasa; tammanne ittentsu Maakibanaaya. <verse eid="1CH 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14"/>Hawanttu Gaade zariyaa olanchchatoo kaappatuwaa. Unttunttuppe laafiyaawanttu S'eetoo kaappatuwaa; minniyaawanttu sha''aa kaappatuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15"/>Yorddaanoosa Shaafay, gas'aappe gas'aa gakkanaw kumi kis's'eedda koyro aginaan pinneeddawanttu hawantta. Unttunttu wombban away doliyaa baggananne away wulliyaa baggananne utteedda asaa ubbaa yedersseeddino.<verse eid="1CH 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biiniyaamanne Yihudaa Zaratuwaappe Daawita Kaalleedda Asatuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16"/>Biiniyaama zaratuwaappenne Yihudaa zaratuwaappe amareeda asatuu Daawitakko geessuwaa yeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17"/>Daawite unttunttunna gaketanaw kesiide, hawaadan yaageedda; «Hinttenttu taana maaddanaw saruwaan taakko yeeddawaa gidooppe, ta wozanay hinttenana ittippe gidanawaa. Shin hinttenttu taana ta morkketoo aatsi immanaw yeeddawaa gidooppe, hinttentta erite! Taani ootseedda iitabay baynna diraw, nu aawotuwaa S'oossay hewaa be'o; I hinttentta pirddo!» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, hattamatuwaa kaappuwaa Amaasaaya bolla S'oossaa Ayyaanay wod'd'ina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">«Daawitaa, nuuni newantta!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 12:18">Isseya na'aw, nuuni neenana ittippe de'eetto!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">Saruu new gido!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 12:18">Neena maaddiyaawanttussikka sarotetsay gido!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">Ne S'oossay neena maaddee» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 12:18">Daawite unttuntta akkiide, bare olanchchatoo kaappatuwaa ootseedda.<verse eid="1CH 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minaase Zariyaappe Daawita Kaalleedda Asatuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19"/>Daawite Piliss's'eematuwaanna ittippe gidiide, Saa'oola olanaw beedda wode, Minaase zariyaappe amareeda asatuu Daawitan gaketeeddino. Shin Piliss's'eema asatuwaa kaappatuu Daawitenne Daawita Asay barenana beennaadan diggeeddino. Piliss's'eema asatuu loytsi zoretteeddawaappe guyyiyaan, unttuntta guyye yeddeeddino; ayaw gooppe, Daawitenne Daawita Asay unttunttu Kaatiyaa Saa'oolaw aatsi immanenttonne giide yayyeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20"/>Daawite S'ik'ilaaga katamaa simmishin, Minaase zariyaappe Daawita maaddanaw keseedda shaalak'atuu Adinaaha, Yozabaada, Yidi'eela, Mikaa'eela, Yozabaada, Eelihunne s'ilttaaya. <verse eid="1CH 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21"/>Unttunttu ubbaykka s'alanne wolk'k'aama asaa gidiyaa diraw, Daawite c'uguwaa kaalliyaa wode, unttunttu Aa maaddeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22"/>Daawita olanchchatuu S'oossaa olanchchatuwaadan c'oraana gakkanaw, Aa maaddiyaa Asay gallassi gallassi gujettee.<verse eid="1CH 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Daawita Olanchchatuu Payduwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23"/>Med'inaa Goday haasayeeddawaadan Saa'oola kawutetsaa Daawitaw zaaranaw olaw danc'c'i giigiide, Kebroonan de'iyaa Daawitakko yeedda olanchchatuu paydu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawaa. <verse eid="1CH 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24"/>Gonddalliyaanne tooraa oyk'k'iide, olaw danc'c'i giigeedda Yihudaa zaratuu usuppun sha"anne hosppun s'eeta. <verse eid="1CH 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25"/>Simoona zariyaappe olaw giigeedda s'alanne wolk'k'aama olanchchatuu laappun sha"anne itti s'eeta. <verse eid="1CH 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26"/>Leewiyaa zariyaappe oyddu sha"anne usuppun s'eeta. <verse eid="1CH 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27"/>Aaroona zaratuwaa kaappuu Yoodaaha; Yoodaahena ittippe heezzu sha"anne laappun s'eetu asatuu de'iino. <verse eid="1CH 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28"/>K'ay S'aadook'e yalaga s'alanne wolk'k'aama asaa; S'aadook'a aawuwaa golliyaa asaappe laatamanne laa"u kaappatuu aanana ittippe de'iino. <verse eid="1CH 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29"/>Biiniyaama zariyaa gideedda Saa'oola dabbotuu heezzu sha"a asaa. Shin Biiniyaama zariyaappe dariyaa bagga Asay Saa'oola golliyaa asaw he wodii gakkanaw ammanettiyaawantta. <verse eid="1CH 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30"/>Efireema zariyaappe barenttu aawotuwaa golliyaa asan eretteedda s'alanne wolk'k'aama asatuu laatamu sha"anne hosppun s'eeta. <verse eid="1CH 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31"/>Daawita kaateyanaw baanaw dooretteedda Minaase zariyaappe baggatuu tammanne hosppun sha"a. <verse eid="1CH 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32"/>K'ay Israa'eeliyaa Asay ayaa ootsanaw bessintto, wodiyaabaa shaakki eriyaa akeekanchcha asatuu, Yisaakoora zariyaw kaappatuu laa"u s'eeta; unttunttu dabbotuu ubbay unttunttoo azazettiino. <verse eid="1CH 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33"/>Ola shaluwaa ubbaa oyk'k'iide, barenttu kumentsaa wozanaan Daawita maaddanaw giigeedda olanchchatuwaan Zaabiloona zariyaa asatuu ishatamu sha"a. <verse eid="1CH 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34"/>Nifttaaleema zariyaappe itti sha"a kaappatuu de'iino; gonddalliyaanne tooraa oyk'k'iyaa hattamanne laappun sha"a asatuu unttunttunna ittippe de'iino. <verse eid="1CH 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35"/>Daana zariyaappe olaw giigeedda asatuu laatamanne hosppun sha"anne usuppun s'eeta. <verse eid="1CH 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36"/>Olaw kesanaw Aaseera zariyaappe giigeeddawanttu oytamu sha"a. <verse eid="1CH 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37"/>Yorddaanoosa Shaafaappe hefintsa away doliyaa baggan de'iyaa Roobeela zariyaappe, Gaade zariyaappenne Minaase zariyaa baggappe ola shaluwaa ubbaa oyk'k'iide yeedda asatuu itti s'eetanne laatamu sha"a.<verse eid="1CH 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38"/>Ha olaw giigeedda olanchchatuu ubbay Daawita Israa'eeliyaa bolla kaateyanaw barenttu k'ofaa k'achchiide, Kebroone katamaa yeeddino. K'ay Israa'eeliyaappe atteedawanttukka Kaateyanaw Daawita kaateyiide itti wozana gideeddino. <verse eid="1CH 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39"/>Unttunttu dabbotuu unttunttoo koshshiyaawaa giigissi wotseedda diraw, miiddinne ushiidde Daawitana heezzu gallassaa utteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40"/>Israa'eeliyaa asaw nashechchaa gidiyaa diraw, huup'issa baggana de'iyaa Yisaakoorappe, Zaabiloonappenne Nifttaaleemappe asatuu daro k'umaa aheeddino. D'iiliyaa, balasiyaa ukitsaa, woyniyaa teeraa, woyniyaa eessaanne zayitiyaa hariyaan, bak'uluwaan, gaaluwaaninne booran c'aaniide aheeddino; k'aykka unttunttu miizzaanne dorssaa shukkiide maanaw akkiide yeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 12:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13"/>
  <para style="s">K'aalaa C'aak'uwaa Taabootay Yerusaalam Buussaa <optbreak/>Taabootaa K'iriyaati-Yi'aariimappe Dentseeddino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:1-11">2 Sam. 6:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawite Suntsatuwaanna; shaalak'atuwaananne s'eetuwaa kaappatuwaanna zoretteedda. <verse eid="1CH 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2"/>Israa'eeliyaa asaa ubbaa, «Hinttenttoo lo"a malatiyaabaa giddooppene, Med'inaa Godaa nu S'oossaa shene gidooppe, Israa'eeliyaa biittaa gas'an de'iyaa nu dabbotuu, k'eesatuu nne barenttu kataman de'iyaa Leewatuu nuunanna ittippe shiik'anaadan asaa kiittoytte. <verse eid="1CH 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3"/>Saa'ooli kaateteedda wode sheneko giina, dogettiide atteeda nu S'oossaa Taabootaa ane zaariide ahooytte» yaageedda. <verse eid="1CH 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4"/>Daawite odeedda yewuu suure gideedda diraw, Asay ubbay mayyeedda.<verse eid="1CH 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5"/>Hewaa diraw, Daawite S'oossaa Taabootaa K'iriyaati-Yi'aariimappe ahana mala, Gibs'e zawaappe Shihoora shaafaappe doommiide, Hamaata Pinuwaa gakkanaw de'iyaa Israa'eeliyaa asaa ubbaa shiishsheedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 7:1-2">1 Sam. 7:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6"/>Daawitenne Israa'eeliyaa Asay ubbay kiruubetuwaappe gidduwaan bare kawutetsaa araataa bolla utteedda S'oossaa suntsan s'eesetteedda S'oossaa Taabootaa ahanaw Yihudaa biittan de'iyaa Ba'aala geetettiyaa K'iriyaati-Yi'aariima katamaa beeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Kes. 25:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7"/>S'oossaa Med'inaa Godaa Taabootaa boray goochchiyaa ooratsa gaariyan wotsiide, Abinaadaaba sooppe aheeddino; Uuzinne Ahiyoy gaariyaa laaggiino. <verse eid="1CH 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8"/>Daawitenne Israa'eeliyaa Asay ubbay diitsaanne maasink'k'uwaa diis's'iidde, kabaruwaa bak'k'iidde, daalaa k'aatsiiddenne s'urumbbaa punniidde, barenttu kumentsaa wolk'k'an S'oossaa sintsan nashettiidde bonchcheeddino.<verse eid="1CH 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9"/>Unttunttu Kiidoona giyaa saan de'iyaa katsaa bukkiyaa udduma gakkiyaa wode, booratuu d'ubettina, Uuzi Taabootaa oyk'k'anaw bare kushiyaa yeddeedda. <verse eid="1CH 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10"/>Aa kushii Taabootaa bochcheedda diraw, Med'inaa Godaa hank'k'uu Uuza bolla ees's'i kesseedda. Hewaa diraw, S'oossay Aa shoc'ina, I he sa'aan S'oossaa sintsan hayk'k'i aggeeda. <verse eid="1CH 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11"/>Med'inaa Goday hank'k'ettiide Uuza wod'eedda diraw, Daawite yiloteedda. Hachche gakkanaw, he sa'ay Peerez Uuzaa geetettiide s'eesetteedda. Uuzi Shoc'etto sa'aa geetettee.<verse eid="1CH 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12"/>He gallassi Daawite S'oossaw yayyeedda diraa, «S'oossaa Taabootaa taakko waata ahanaw danddayayitaa?» yaageedda. <verse eid="1CH 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13"/>Hewaa diraw, Taabootaa barenana Daawita Katamaa afibeenna. Shin Gaatiyaa Obeedi-Eedooma geetettiyaa bitaniyaa soo afeedda. <verse eid="1CH 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14"/>S'oossaa Taabootay Obeedi-Eedooma gollen Aa golliyaa asaana heezzu aginaa gam"eedda. Med'inaa Goday Aa golliyaa asaanne aw de'iyaa ubbabaa anjjeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:4-5">1 Od. 26:4-5</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CH 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14"/>
  <para style="s">Daawite Yerusaalamen Ootseedda Oosuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1"/>S'iiroosa Kaatii Kiiraami Daawitaw asatuwaa kiitteedda. Kiitetteedda asatuwaana golliyaa kees's'anaadan zigaa mudetsaanne k'ay shuchchaa massiyaawanttanne anaas'etuwaa aw yeddeedda. <verse eid="1CH 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2"/>Med'inaa Goday Israa'eeliyaa bolla Aa kaatiyaa ootsiide esseeddawaanne bare asaa Israa'eeliyaa diraw, Aa kawutetsaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide bonchcheeddawaa Daawite ereedda.<verse eid="1CH 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawite Yerusaalamen hara mac'c'a asaa gujji akkiide, attumawaa naanaanne mac'c'a naanaa yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4"/>Daawite Yerusaalamen yeleedda attuma naanay Shaamu'a, Shobaaba, Naataana, Solomone, <verse eid="1CH 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5"/>Yibihaara, Elishuu'a, Elppaalees'a, <verse eid="1CH 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6"/>Nogaaha, Nefeega, Yaafi'a, <verse eid="1CH 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7"/>Elishamaa'a, Be'eliyaadanne Elifelees'a.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daawitaw Yerusaalamen yeletteedda attuma naanaa suntsay </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 5:14-16">2 Sam. 5:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:5-7">2 Od. 3:5-7</ref></char> nne 14:4-7 s'aafetteedda: Shin Ibraawetsuwaan ittuwaa ittuwaa suntsay ubbasaan itti mala gidenna.</note><verse eid="1CH 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Daawite Piliss's'eema Asaa S'ooneedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:17-25">2 Sam. 5:17-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8"/>Daawite Israa'eeliyaa ubbaa bolla kaatiyaa gidiide oketteeddawaa Piliss's'eema Asay siseedda wode, unttunttu ubbay Daawita koyanaw keseeddino. Daawite unttunttu kesseeddawaa sisiide, unttunttunna olettanaw kesseedda. <verse eid="1CH 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9"/>Piliss's'eema Asay Rafayma Wombbaa yiide bonk'k'eeddino. <verse eid="1CH 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10"/>Daawite S'oossaa, «Taani baade Piliss's'eematuwaa oloo? Neeni unttunttu taw aatsa immanii?» yaagiide oochcheedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 14:10">Shin Med'inaa Goday Aa, «Baade ola. Taani unttuntta new aatsa immana» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11"/>Daawitenne Aa Asay Ba'aali-Paraas'iima giyaa sa'aa biide, yaan unttuntta s'ooneeddino. Daawite, «Haatsaa di'uu d'uussi aad'd'iyaawaadan S'oossay ta morkkatuwaa gidduwaanna taana aatseedda» yaageedda. Hewaa diraw, he sa'aa suntsay Ba'aali-Paraas'iima geetetteedda. <verse eid="1CH 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12"/>Piliss's'eematuu barenttu eek'atuwaa he sa'aan yeggiide beeddino. Yaatina Daawite azaziide, unttunttu eek'atuwaa tamaan s'uugisseedda.<verse eid="1CH 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13"/>Piliss's'eema asatuu laa'entsuwaa ha wombbaa simmi yiide bonk'k'eeddino. <verse eid="1CH 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14"/>Daawite S'oossaa laa'entsuwaa oochcheedda. Shin S'oossay Aa, «Neeni unttunttu geeduwaa booppa. Unttunttu guyyenna yuuyya aad'd'aade boo'iyaa mitsaappe sintsa baggana olanaw giiga. <verse eid="1CH 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15"/>Boo'iyaa mitsaappe huup'iyaan salppiyaa kooshshaa neeni sisiyaa wode, olanaw kesa. Ayaw gooppe, hewe Piliss's'eema olanchchatuwaa shoc'anaw S'oossay neeppe sintsaw aad'd'eedda giyaawaa» yaageedda. <verse eid="1CH 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16"/>S'oossay azazeeddawaadan Daawite ootseedda. Gabaa'oonappe biide Gezeera gakkanaw, Israa'eeliyaa Asay Piliss's'eema olanchchatuwaa wod'eedda. <verse eid="1CH 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawita worii biittaa ubbaa gakkeedda. Kawutetsatuu ubbay Daawitaw yayanaadan Med'inaa Goday ootseedda.<verse eid="1CH 14:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15"/>
  <para style="s">Taabootaa Ahanaw Haneedda giiguwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1"/>Daawite bare kataman barew golliyaa kees's'eedda; S'oossaa Taabootawukka sa'aa giigissiide, dunkkaaniyaa esseedda. <verse eid="1CH 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan Daawite, «S'oossaa Taabootaa tokkanaadaaninne med'i med'inaw Med'inaa Godaw ootsanaw Med'inaa Goday dooreedda Leewatuwaappe attina, ooninne S'oossaa Taabootaa tookkanaw bessena» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:8">Zar. 10:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3"/>Daawite Med'inaa Goda Taabootaw giigisseedda sa'aa Taabootaa ahanaadan, Israa'eeliyaa asaa ubbaa Yerusaalamen shiishsheedda.<verse eid="1CH 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4"/>K'ay Daawite Aaroona zaratuwaanne Leewatuwaa s'eesiide shiishsheedda. <verse eid="1CH 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5"/>K'ahaata yaratuwaappe kaappuu Uri'eelinne itti s'eetanne laatamu Aa dabbotuu yeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6"/>Maraara yaratuwaappe kaappuu Asaayinne laa"u s'eetanne laatamu Aa dabbotuu yeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7"/>Gershshoona yaratuwaappe kaappuu Yuu'eelinne s'eetanne hattamu Aa dabbotuu yeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8"/>Els's'aafaana yaratuwaappe kaappuu Shamaa'enne laa"u s'eetu Aa dabbotuu yeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9"/>Kebroone yaratuwaappe kaappuu Eli'eelinne hosppun tammu Aa dabbotuu yeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10"/>Uuzi'eela yaratuwaappe kaappuu Aminaadaabinne s'eetanne tammanne laa"u Aa dabbotuu yeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawite k'eesetuwaa S'aadook'anne Abiyaataara, k'ay Leewatuwaa Uri'eela, Asaaya, Yuu'eela, Shamaa'iyaa, Eli'eelanne Aminaadaaba s'eesisseedda. <verse eid="1CH 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12"/>Unttuntta, «Hinttenttu Leewatuu zaretoo kaappatuwaa. S'oossaa Israa'eeliyaa Med'inaa Godaa Taabootaa taani giigissa wotseedda sa'aa ahanaw hinttenne hinttenttu dabbotuu geeyite. <verse eid="1CH 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13"/>Hinttenttu Leewatuu koyro S'oossaa Taabootaa tookkibeenna dirawunne nuuni Aa wogaadan woot afanentto S'oossaa oochchibeenna diraw, Med'inaa Goday nu S'oossay nuuna mureedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Med'inaa Godaa Israa'eeliyaa S'oossaa Taabootaa ahanaw k'eesatuu nne Leewatuu barentta geeshsheeddino. <verse eid="1CH 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15"/>Med'inaa Goday Muse baggana kase azazeeddawaadan, Leewatuu S'oossaa Taabootaa kasuwaanna barenttu hashiyaan tookkeeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:14">Kes. 25:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CH 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, diitsaanne maasink'k'uwaa diis's'iidde, daalaa k'aatsiidde, nashechiyaa yetsaa yes's'ana mala, Leewatuwaa kaaletsiyaawanttu barenttu dabbotuwaa suntsanaadan Daawite azazeedda. <verse eid="1CH 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17"/>Leewatuu Yuu'eela na'aa Hemaana, Aa dabbatuwaappe Berekiyaa na'aa Asaafanne unttunttu dabbatuwaappe Maraara yaraa K'usaaya na'aa Etaana suntseeddino. <verse eid="1CH 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18"/>K'ay laa'entso kaalaan Zakkaraasa, Yaa'izi'eela, Shamiraamoota, Yihi'eela, Uunna, Eli'aaba, Banaaya, Ma'iseeya, Matiitiyaa, Elifaala, Miik'ineeyanne penggiyaa naagiyaawantta Obeedi-Eedoomanne Yi'i'eela suntseeddino.<verse eid="1CH 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19"/>Nahaasiyaa daalaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide k'aatsanaadan Hemaani, Asaafinne Etaani suntsetteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20"/>K'ay Zakkaraasi, Yaa'izi'eeli, Shamiraamooti, Yihi'eeli, Uunni, Eli'aabi, Ma'iseeyinne Banaayi diitsaa lee"uwaan diis's'iino. <verse eid="1CH 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21"/>Matiite, Elifaali, Miik'ineeyi, Obeedi-Eedoomi, Yi'i'eelinne Azaazii diitsaa orddiyaan diis's'iino.<verse eid="1CH 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22"/>Leewatuu kaappuu Kanaane mazimuriyaa kaaletsanaw suntsetteedda; I eranchcha gidiyaa diraw, unttuntta tamaarissee. <verse eid="1CH 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23"/>Berekiyaynne Elk'k'aani Taabootaa dunkkaaniyaa penggiyaa naaganaw dooretteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:24"/>K'ay k'eesatuu Shabaanee, Yoshafaas'i, Nataani'eeli, Amaasaayi, Zakkaraasi, Banaayinne El"eezeri S'oossaa Taabootaa sintsan s'urumbbaa punnanaw dooretteeddino. Obeedi-Eedoominne Yehiyaa Taabootaa penggiyaa naaganaw dooretteeddino.<verse eid="1CH 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taabootaa Yerusaalame Afeedino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:12-22">2 Sam. 6:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan Daawite, Israa'eeliyaa c'imatuunne sha"a kaappatuu Med'inaa Godaa K'aalaa c'aak'uwa Taabootaa Obeedi-Eedooma sooppe ahanaw nashettiidde beeddino. <verse eid="1CH 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26"/>Med'inaa Godaa K'aalaa c'aak'uwa Taabootaa tookkeedda Leewatuwaa S'oossay maaddeedda diraw, unttunttu laappun korumatuwaanne laappun dorssaa orggetuwaa yarshsheeddino. <verse eid="1CH 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27"/>Daawite, Taabootaa tookkeedda Leewatuu ubbay, mazimuriyaa yes's'iyaawanttunne mazimuriyaa yes's'iyaawanttu kaappuu Kanaane suufiyaa geetettiyaa k'ac'inaappe dadetteedda mayuwaa mayyeeddino. Daawitekka k'ay liinuwaappe dadetteedda eefuudiyaa geetettiyaa mayuwaa mayyeedda. <verse eid="1CH 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28"/>Hawaadan ootsiide, Israa'eeliyaa ubbay hombboc'iidde, s'urumbbaanne malakataa punniidde, daalaa k'aatsiiddenne, diitsaanne maasink'k'uwaa diis's'iidde, Med'inaa Godaa K'aalaa c'aak'uwa Taabootaa aheeddino.<verse eid="1CH 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29"/>Med'inaa Godaa K'aalaa c'aak'uwa Taabootay Daawita Katamaa geleedda wode, Saa'oola naatta Miikaala maskkootiyaanna s'eellaade, Kaatii Daawite nashettiidde durishiininne kaa'ishin be'aaddu; Daawita bare wozanaan kad'aaddu.<verse eid="1CH 15:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1"/>Unttunttu S'oossaa Taabootaa ahiidde, Daawite Taabootaa wotsanaw d'ogeedda dunkkaaniyaa gidduwaan wotseeddino. S'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaanne ittippetetsaa yarshshuwaa Med'inaa Godaw yarshsheeddino. <verse eid="1CH 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2"/>Daawite s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaanne ittippetetsaa yarshshuwaa yarshshiide Poleeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Med'inaa Godaa suntsan asaa anjjeedda. <verse eid="1CH 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3"/>Israa'eeliyaa asaw ubbaw, mac'c'aaniwunne attumawoo, huup'iyaan huup'iyaan itti itti komppo ukitsaa, itti itti mus'o ashuwaakka woyniyaa teeraa melaappe itti itti ukitsaa gisheedda.<verse eid="1CH 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4"/>Med'inaa Godaa Taabootaa sintsan ootsanaadaaninne Med'inaa Godaa Israa'eeliyaa S'oossaa sabbanaadan, galatanaadaaninne bonchchanaadan, amareeda Leewatuwaa Daawite suntseedda. <verse eid="1CH 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5"/>Leewatuu kaappuu Asaafa; Asaafa kaalliide laa'entso kaappuu Zakkaraasa. Zakkaraasa kaalliide de'iyaawanttu Yi'i'eela, Shamiraamoota, Yihi'eela, Matiitiyaa, Eli'aaba, Banaaya, Obeedi-Eedoomanne Ye'eela. Unttunttu maasink'k'uwaanne diitsaa diis's'anaw suntsetteeddino; shin Asaafe daalaa k'aatsanaw suntsetteedda. <verse eid="1CH 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6"/>K'eesiyaa Banaayinne Yahaa'i'eeli S'oossaa K'aalaa c'aak'uwa Taabootaa sintsan ubbaa wode s'urumbbaa punnanaw suntsetteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7"/>He gallassi Daawite kasetiide, Asaafinne Aa dabbotuu Med'inaa Godaa sabbanaadan unttunttoo immeedda.<verse eid="1CH 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Galataa Mazimuriyaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 105:1-15">Maz. 105:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:1-13">96:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:47-48">47-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8"/>Med'inaa Godaa galatite; Aa suntsaa s'eesite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:8">I ootseeddawaa kawutetsatuu gidduwaan erissite.<verse eid="1CH 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9"/>Aa sabbite; galataa yetsaa aw yes's'ite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:9">Aa malalissiyaa kiitaa ubbaa odite.<verse eid="1CH 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10"/>Aa geeshsha suntsan c'eek'ettite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:10">Med'inaa Godaa koyiyaawanttu wozanatuu nashettino.<verse eid="1CH 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11"/>Med'inaa Godaanne Aa wolk'k'aa s'omoosite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:11">ubbaade Aa sintsa koyyite.<verse eid="1CH 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12-13"/>Hinttenttoo, Aa k'oomaa Abrahaama zeretsatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:12-13">Dooretteedda Yaak'ooba naatoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:12-13">I ootseedda maalaalissiyaabaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:12-13">Aa malaatanne I pirddeedda pirddaa hassayite.<verse eid="1CH 16:12-13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14"/>I Med'inaa Godaa nu S'oossaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:14">Aa pirddaykka sa'aa ubbaa bollaanna.<verse eid="1CH 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15"/>I bare k'aalaa c'aak'uwaa med'inaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:15">Bare azazeedda k'aalaa sha"a yeletaa gakkanaw naagee.<verse eid="1CH 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16"/>Hewenne, I Abrahaamena c'aak'k'eteedda c'aak'uwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:16">Yisaak'aw c'aak'k'eedda c'aak'uwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Dom. 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CH 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17"/>Yaak'oobaw wogaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:17">Israa'eeliyawukka med'ina c'aak'k'uwaa ootsiide mintseeddawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:13">Dom. 28:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CH 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18"/>I, «New Kanaane biittaa immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:18">I ne zeretsatoo laata gidanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19"/>S'oossaa asatuu payduwaan guutsanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:19">Kanaane biittan bete gidiide de'iyaa wode,<verse eid="1CH 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20"/>itti asaappe hara asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:20">itti kaatetetsaappe hara kawutetsaa yuuyyeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21"/>S'oossay unttuntta ooninne naak'k'anaw immibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:21">unttunttu diraw kaatetuwaa seeriidde,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21-22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:3-7">Dom. 20:3-7</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CH 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22"/>«Taani okkeeddawaa bochchoppite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:22">Ta timbbitiyaa odiyaawantta k'ohoppite» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23"/>Sa'aan de'iyaa asaw, ubbaykka Med'inaa Godaw yes's'ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:23">I ashshiyaa mishiraachchuwaa hachche hachche odite.<verse eid="1CH 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24"/>Kawutetsatuu gidduwaan Aa bonchchuwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:24">asaa ubbaa giddon Aa malalissiyaa oosuwaabaa awaayite.<verse eid="1CH 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25"/>Med'inaa Goday wolk'k'aama; Aad'd'o galatay aw bessee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:25">S'oossatuwaa ubbaappe aad'd'iide, I yayettanaw besse.<verse eid="1CH 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26"/>Hara asaa s'oossatuu ubbay eek'atuwaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:26">shin Med'inaa Goday saluwaa med'd'eedda S'oossaa.<verse eid="1CH 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27"/>Bonchchuunne anggay Aa yuushshuwaan de'ee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:27">minotetsaynne nashechchay I De'iyaa Sa'aan de'ee.<verse eid="1CH 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28"/>Hinttenttoo, asaa zaretoo ubbaw, Med'inaa Godaawaa odite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:28">«Bonchchuunne wolk'k'ay Med'inaa Godaawaa» giide odite.<verse eid="1CH 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29"/>«Bonchchuu Aa suntsaassa» giide Med'inaa Godaawaa odite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:29">Yarshshuwaa akkiide, Aa sintsa yiite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:29">Aa geeshshatetsaa puulan Med'inaa Godaw goynnite.<verse eid="1CH 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30"/>Gadiyaan de'iyaa asaw ubbaw, Aa sintsan kokkorite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:30">Sa'ay min ek'k'eedda; ubbakka k'aas's'enna.<verse eid="1CH 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31"/>Salotuu nashettino; sa'aykka hashshu go!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:31">Kawutetsatuu giddon unttunttu, «Med'inaa Goday kaateteedda!» yaagino.<verse eid="1CH 16:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32"/>Abbayinne Aa giddon kumeeddabatuu guummino.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:32">Shoyk'aynne shooyk'aan de'iyaabatuu ubbatuu nashettino.<verse eid="1CH 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan woran de'iyaa mitsaa ubbay yes's'ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:33">nashechchan Med'inaa Godaa sintsan yes's'ana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:33">Ayaw gooppe, I sa'aa bollan pirddanaw yee.<verse eid="1CH 16:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34"/>S'oossay lo"a gidiyaa dirawunne Med'inaa Godaa galatite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:34">Aggena Aa siik'uu med'inaawaa gidiyaa diraw, galatite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Od. 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Izr. 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Maz. 100:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Erm. 33:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CH 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan hinttenttu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:35">«Abeet nuuna ashshiyaa S'oossaw, nuuna ashsha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:35">Nuuni ne geeshsha suntsaa galatanaadaaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:35">ne bonchchuwaan c'eek'ettanaadan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:35">kawutetsatuu giddoppe shiishshaade ashsha» yaagite.<verse eid="1CH 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36"/>Med'inaa Godaw, Israa'eeliyaa S'oossaw galatay gido.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:36">Med'inaappe med'ina gakkanaw galatetto!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:36">Hewaappe guyyiyaan Asay ubbay, «Amen"i» giide, Med'inaa Godaa galateedda.<verse eid="1CH 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yerusaalameninne Gabaa'oonan Haneedda <optbreak/>Goynnuwaa Maaraa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37"/>Med'inaa Godaa K'aalaa c'aak'uwa Taabootaa sintsan hachche hachche goynaw koshshiyaawaa ubbaa wode unttunttu ootsanaadan, Daawite Asaafanne Aa dabbotuwaa wotseedda. <verse eid="1CH 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38"/>I k'ay Obeedi-Eedoomanne Aa dabbotuwaa usuppun tammanne hosppuntsa unttunttunna ootsanaadan wotseedda; Yidutuuna na'aa Obeedi-Eedoomanne Hoosa penggiyaa naaganaadan wotseedda.<verse eid="1CH 16:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39"/>K'eesii S'aadook'inne aanana ootsiyaa k'eesatuu Gabaa'oonan de'iyaa d'ok'k'a sa'aan, Med'inaa Godaa Dunkkaaniyaa sintsan ootsanaadan yaan atteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40"/>Med'inaa Goday Israa'eeliyaw immeedda higgiyan s'aafetteeddawaadan, unttunttu wonttanne omarssi ubbaa wode s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaa yarshshiyaa sa'aan Med'inaa Godaw yarshshiino. <verse eid="1CH 16:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41"/>Aggena Aa siik'uu med'inaawaa gidiyaa diraw, Med'inaa Godaa yetsan galatanaadan Hemaana, Yidutuunanne dooretteedda haratuwaa Daawite unttunttunna ittippe wotseedda. <verse eid="1CH 16:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42"/>Hemaaninne Yidutuuni s'urumbbaa punniino, daalaa k'aatsiinonne galataa mazimuriyaa yes's'iidde kaa'iyaa hara miishshatuwaa kaa'iino. Yidutuuna attuma naanay penggiyaa naaganaw suntsetteeddino.<verse eid="1CH 16:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Asay ubbay bare soo bare soo beedda. Daawitekka bare soy asaa anjjanaw simmeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:19-20">2 Sam. 6:19-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CH 16:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17"/>
  <para style="s">Geeshsha Golliyaa Kees'iyaawe Solomona Gidussaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:1-27">17:1-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1"/>Daawite bare kaatiyaa gollen de'iidde, timbbitiyaa odiyaa Naataana, «Taani zigaappe kees'etteedda gollen de'ay; shin Med'inaa Godaa K'aalaa c'aak'uwa Taabootay dunkkaaniyaa garssaana» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2"/>Naataani Daawita, «Ootsanaw ne wozanay k'oppeeddawaa ubbaa kiiteta; S'oossay neenana de'ee» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3"/>Shin he gallassaa k'amma S'oossaa k'aalay Naataanakko yiide, <verse eid="1CH 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4"/>«Ba; ta k'oomaa Daawita hawaadan yaaga; ‹Med'inaa Goday hawaadan yaagee; Taani de'ana golliyaa kees's'anawe neena gidakka. <verse eid="1CH 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5"/>Ayaw gooppe, taani Israa'eelatuwaa Gibs'eppe kesseedda gallassaappe doommaade hachche gakkanaw, gollen de'abeykke; taani dunkkaaniyaappe dunkkaaniyaw, k'ay itti saappe hara sa'aw yuuyyaade de'aad. <verse eid="1CH 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6"/>Taani Israa'eeliyaa asaa ubbaanna yuuyyeedda sa'aa ubbaan, ta asaa heemmanaw taani azazeedda Israa'eeliyaa daannatuwaappe oossinne, Taw zigaa golliyaa ayaw kees's'abeykkii? gaade oochchabeykke› yaagee» yaaga.<verse eid="1CH 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7"/>«Hewaa diraw, ha"ikka ta k'oomaa Daawita, ‹Ubbaappe Wolk'k'aama Med'inaa Goday neena hawaadan yaagee; «Taani neena hentsaa gadeppe, dorssaa heemmiyaa saappe dentsaade, ta asaa Israa'eeliyaa kaaletsanaadan akkaad. <verse eid="1CH 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8"/>Neeni beedda sa'aa ubbaan taani neenana ittippe gidaad; ne morkkatuwaa ubbaa ne sintsaappe diggaad. Ha"i simmi taani ha sa'aan eretteedda wolk'k'aama asatuwaappe suntsaadan ne suntsaa gitayana. <verse eid="1CH 17:8"/><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9-10"/>K'ay taani ta asaw, Israa'eeliyaw sa'aa immaade, unttuntta he sa'aan tokkana. Hewaa diraw, unttunttu barenttu sa'aan de'anawantta; unttunttu laa'entso shabbarettikkino. Kase taani ta asaa Israa'eeliyaa bolla yeletatuwaa suntseedda wodiyaappe doommina naak'k'eeddawaadan, laa'entso iita asatuu unttuntta naak'k'ikkino. Taani ne morkkatuwaa ubbaa new moodisana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 17:9-10">« ‹ «Hewaa bollankka Med'inaa Goday bare huup'iyaw ne zaratuu de'anaadan ootsanaawaa new odeedda. <verse eid="1CH 17:9-10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11"/>Ne laytsay wurina, hayk'k'aadda ne mayza aawotuwaan gaketiyaa wode, taani neeppe guyyiyaan ne zariyaa, ne naanatuwaappe ittuwaa dentsaade, Aa kawutetsaa minisana. <verse eid="1CH 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12"/>Taw golliyaa kees's'anawe Aa; taani Aa kawutetsaa araataa med'inaw minissa essana. <verse eid="1CH 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13"/>Taani aw aawuwaa gidana; ikka taw na'aa gidana. Neeppe kase kaateteedda Saa'oolappe taani ta siik'uwaa akka diggeeddawaadan, taani aappe ubbakka akkikke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:18">2 Od. 6:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:5">Ibr. 1:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14"/>Taani Aa ta asaa bollanne ta kawutetsaa bolla med'inaw suntsana; Aa kawutetsaa araataykka med'inaw min ek'k'ana» yaagee› yaaga» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15"/>Naataani S'oossay aw sas'aani k'onc'c'isseedda k'aalaa ubbaa hawaadan Daawitaw odeedda.<verse eid="1CH 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Daawita Woosaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:18-29">2 Sam. 7:18-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Kaatii Daawite dunkkaaniyaa geliide, Med'inaa Godaa sintsan utteedda. Hawaadan yaagiide woosseedda; «Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, S'oossaw, neeni hawaa ubbaa taw ootsanaw taani oonee? Ta soy asaykka ayee? <verse eid="1CH 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, hawe ne ayfiyaa sintsan guutsa malatina, ne k'oomaa zaratuu sintsaappe yaanawaa laytsatuwaan timbbitiyaa odaadda. Taana k'ay wolk'k'aama asaa kessaadda. <verse eid="1CH 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18"/>Neeni taana ne k'oomaa bonchcheedda diraw, taani Daawite simmi ayaa gaanaw danddayayitaa? Neeni taana ne k'oomaa eraasa. <verse eid="1CH 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, ne k'oomaa diraw, ne wozanaa k'ofaadan ha gitabaa ubbaa ootsaade, ha gitatetsaa ubbaa taana erissaadda.<verse eid="1CH 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20"/>«Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, ne mali ittuunne baawa. Nuuni nu haytsaan siseeddawaadan, neeppe attina, hara s'oossi baawa. <verse eid="1CH 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21"/>Neeni ne asaa ootsanaw wozeedda ne asaa Israa'eeliyaa malatiyaa hara kawutetsi sa'aa bollan baawa. Neeni ootseedda gitanne malalissiyaa oosotu gaasuwaan ne suntsay biittan sa'aan eretteedda. Neeni Gibs'eppe wozeedda ne asaa sintsaappe kawutetsatuwaa laaggaadda. <verse eid="1CH 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22"/>Neeni ne asaa Israa'eeliyaa med'inaw nebaa ootsaadda. Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, neenikka unttunttu S'oossaa gidaadda.<verse eid="1CH 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23"/>«Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, neeni ne k'oomaabaanne Aa zeretsaabaa haasayeeddawe med'inaw min ek'k'o; neeni ootsana geeddawaadankka kiiteta. <verse eid="1CH 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24"/>‹Ubbaappe Wolk'k'aama Med'inaa Godaw, Israa'eeliyaa S'oossay tumuwaappe Israa'eeliyaw S'oossaa› geetettanaadan ne suntsay med'inaw min ek'k'ananne gitatana. Ne k'oomaa Daawita zaratuu ne sintsan min ek'k'ana.<verse eid="1CH 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25"/>«Abeet ta S'oossaw, ‹Taani new golliyaa kees's'ana gaade› neeni taw ne k'oomaw k'onc'c'aadda. Hewaa diraw, taani ne k'oomay ha woosaa neena woossanaw s'alaad. <verse eid="1CH 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, neeni S'oossaattee! Neeni ha lo"o k'aalaa taw ne k'oomaw ootsana gaadda. <verse eid="1CH 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27"/>Ne sintsan yaa med'inaw gam"anaadan, ne k'oomaa zariyaa anjjanaw nashetta. Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, neeni anjjeedawe med'inaw anjjetteddawaa gidana» yaagiide woosseedda.<verse eid="1CH 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18"/>
  <para style="s">Daawite Olaa S'oonuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 18:1-20:8">18:1—20:8</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 8:1-18">2 Sam. 8:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawite Piliss's'eematuwaa s'ooniide mooddeedda; yaatiide Gaate geetettiyaa katamaanne Aa mootsatuwaa Piliss's'eema asatuwaa kushiyaappe wotsi akkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2"/>K'ay Daawite Moo'aabe gadiyaa asatuwaa s'oonina, unttunttu aw moodetteeddino; giiraa giireeddino.<verse eid="1CH 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3"/>Hamaata katamaa matan de'iyaa S'ooba biittaa Kaatii Hadaadi'eezere, bare kawutetsaa Efiraas'iisa Shaafaa gakkanaw aassanaw biishshin, Daawite Aa s'ooneedda. <verse eid="1CH 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4"/>Daawite Hadaadi'eezereppe itti sha"a paraa gaaretuwaa, laappun sha"a paraa asatuwaanna laatamu sha"a gedissa asatuwaa omoodeedda. Daawite s'eetu gaaretoo gideedda paratuwaa ashshiide, hara paratuwaa ubbaw gaaduwaa gilddayeedda.<verse eid="1CH 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5"/>Damask'k'o katamaan de'iyaa Sooretuu S'ooba biittaa Kaatiyaa Hadaadi'eezera maaddanaw yeedda wode, Daawite unttunttuppe laatamanne laa"u sha"a asaa wod'eedda. <verse eid="1CH 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Sooriyaa biittan Damask'k'o kataman olanchchatuwaa geessotuwaa med'd'eedda. Yaatina, Sooriyaa asatuu Daawitaw moodettiide, giiraa giireeddino. Daawite beedda sa'aa ubbaan Med'inaa Goday aw s'oonuwaa immeedda.<verse eid="1CH 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7"/>Kaatii Daawite Hadaadi'eezera oosanchchatuu tookkeedda work'k'aa gonddalletuwaa akkiide, Yerusaalame afeedda. <verse eid="1CH 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8"/>K'ay Daawite Hadaadi'eezere mooddiyaa S'ebaahanne Kuna katamatuwaappe nahaasiyaa giyaa birataa loytsi daruwaa akkeedda. Hewaappe simmiide, Solomone he nahaasiyaa birataappe Abbaa Saaniyaa, tuussatuwaanne dumma dumma miishshatuwaa med'd'eedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:40-47">1 Kat. 7:40-47</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:11-18">2 Od. 4:11-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CH 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9"/>Daawite S'ooba biittaa Kaatiyaa Hadaadi'eezera olanchchatuwaa ubbaa s'ooneeddawaa Hamaata Kaatii Too'i siseedda. <verse eid="1CH 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:10"/>Hadaadi'eezera olettiide s'ooneedda diraw, Aa hashshu gaanawunne sarotanaw bare na'aa Hadoraama Kaatiyaa Daawitakko kiitteedda. Ayaw gooppe, Hadaadi'eezere Too'aara olettiide gam"eedda. Hadoraami work'k'aappe, biraappenne nahaasiyaappe med'd'eedda miishshatuwaa akkiide yeedda. <verse eid="1CH 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11"/>Kaatii Daawite Eedoomappe, Moo'aabeppe, Amoona asatuwaappe, Piliss's'eematuwaappenne Amaaleek'a asatuwaappe omooddi akkeedda biraanne work'k'aa ha miishshatuwaanna ittippe gatsiide, Med'inaa Godaw dummayiide wotseedda.<verse eid="1CH 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12"/>S'aruuyi na'ay Abishaayi Eedooma asaappe tammanne hosppun sha"atuwaa Mas'ine Wombban wod'eedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 60">Maz. 60</ref> (Huup'iyaa)</char></note> <verse eid="1CH 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawite Eedooman olanchchatuwaa geessotuwaa med'd'eedda; yaatina, he gadiyaa Asay ubbay Daawitaw moodetteedda. Daawite beedda sa'aa ubbaan Med'inaa Goday aw s'oonuwaa immeedda.<verse eid="1CH 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14"/>Hewaadan ootsiide, Daawite Israa'eeliyaa ubbaa bolla kaateteedda; bare asaa ubbaa s'illotetsaaninne suure pirddan akkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15"/>S'aruuyi na'ay Yoo'aabe ola gadaawaa; Ahiluuda na'ay Yoosaafees'e haneeddabaa s'aafiyaawaa; <verse eid="1CH 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16"/>Ahis'uuba na'ay S'aadook'inne Abiyaataara na'ay Abimeleeki k'eesetuwaa; Shaabisha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Shaabisha: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha bitanii Ibraawetsuwaan oyddu dumma dumma suntsan s'eesettee. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 8:17">2 Sam. 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:25">20:25</ref></char> nne <char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 4:3">1 Kat. 4:3</ref></char> s'eella.</note> waanna s'aafiyaa; <verse eid="1CH 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17"/>Yoodaahe na'ay Banaayi Daawita naagiyaa olanchchatuwaa kaappuwaa; Daawita attumawaa naanay Aa kawutetsaan d'ok'k'a sa'aa oyk'k'iide kaappatuwaa.<verse eid="1CH 18:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19"/>
  <para style="s">Daawite Amoonatuwaanne Sooretuwaa S'ooneedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 10:1-19">2 Sam. 10:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Amoonatuwaa Kaatii Naa'oosi hayk'k'eedda; Aa na'ay Aa kotan kaateteedda. <verse eid="1CH 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2"/>Daawite, «Aa aawuu Naa'oosi taw keekeedda diraw, taani Aa na'aa Hanuunaw keekana» yaageedda. Hanuuna aawuu hayk'k'eedda diraw, Daawite Aa mintsetsanaw asaa kiitteedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 19:2">Daawite kiitteeddawanttuu Hanuuna mintsetsanaw Amoona gadiyaa gakkeedda wode, <verse eid="1CH 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3"/>Amoona asaa kaappatuu Hanuuna, «Daawite neena mintsetsanaw ha asatuwaa kiitteeddawe ne aawuwaa bonchchuwaa diraassa gaaddiyye? I bare asaa kiitteeddawe ha katamaa s'eellanaassa, wochchanaassanne olettiide s'oonanaassa» yaageeddino.<verse eid="1CH 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4"/>Hanuuni Daawite kiitteedda asatuwaa oyk'k'iide, unttunttu buuchchaa meedeedda; unttunttu mayuwaakka uttiyaa dulliyaa baggappe k'ans's'i akkiide, unttuntta yeddeedda. <verse eid="1CH 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5"/>Hewaa diraw, asatuu daro yeellateeddino. Daawite hewaa sisiide, I unttunttunna gakettiyaa asaa kiitteedda. Hewaappe, «Hinttenttu buuchchay dic'c'anaashin, Yaarikko kataman de'ishshite; hewaappe guyyiyaan haa yiite» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6"/>Amoonatuu barenttu kiitan Daawite unttuntta morkkanaadan ootseeddawaa ereedda wode, Hanuuninne Amoonatuu Masp'p'es'oomiyaappenne Sooriyaan de'iyaa Maa'ikanne S'ooba geetettiyaa katamatuwaappe paraa gaaretuwaanne paraa asatuwaa k'as'aranaw hattamanne oyddu sha"a kiilo giraame dees'iyaa s'agaraa biraa yeddeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7"/>Hattamanne laa"u sha"a paraa gaaretuwaa, paraa asatuwaa, Maa'ika kaatiyaanne Aa olanchchatuwaa k'as'areeddino; k'as'arina yiide, Medaaban dunkkaaneeddino. K'ay Amoonatuu barenttu katamaappe shiik'iide, olaw giigeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8"/>Daawite hewaa siseedda wode, Yoo'aabanne olanchchatuwaa ubbaa yeddeedda. <verse eid="1CH 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9"/>Amoonatuu kesiide, katamaa penggiyaan olaw salppeeddino. Unttuntta maaddanaw yeedda kaatetuukka barenttu sa'aa oyk'k'iide, dembbaan shiik'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10"/>Yoo'aabe barena olay sintsananne guyyenna dooddeeddawaa be'eedda wode, Israa'eelatuu giddoppe ubbaappe minniyaa olanchchatuwaa doori akkiide, Sooriyaa asatuwaa sintsan salppisseedda. <verse eid="1CH 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11"/>Atteeda asatuwaappe bare ishay Abishaayi azazana mala ootsiide, Amoona asatuwaa sintsan salppeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12"/>Yoo'aabe bare ishaa Abishaaya, «Sooriyaa asatuu taw wolk'k'aamooppe, neeni yaade taana maadda. K'ay Amoona asatuu new wolk'k'aamooppe, taani yaade neena maaddana. <verse eid="1CH 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13"/>Simmi minna! Nu asaa dirawunne nu S'oossaa katamatuwaa diraw, ane min olettoytte. Med'inaa Goday barena lo"iyaawaa ootso» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yoo'aabinne aananna de'iyaa Asay Sooriyaa asatuwaana olettanaw lawuhu geeddino. Yaatina, Sooriyaa asatuu Aa sintsaappe bak'atteedino. <verse eid="1CH 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15"/>Sooriyaa asatuu bak'ateeddawaa Amoona asatuu be'eedda wode, unttunttukka Aa ishaa Abishaaya sintsaappe bak'atiide, katamaa geleeddino. Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Yoo'aabe Yerusaalame simmeedda.<verse eid="1CH 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16"/>Sooriyaa asatuu Israa'eeliyaa asatuu unttuntta s'ooneeddawaa ereedda wode, asaa kiittiide Efiraas'iisa Shaafaappe hefintsana de'iyaa Sooriyaa asatuwaa ahiseeddino. Hadaadi'eezera ola gadawuu Shobaaki unttuntta kaaletsee.<verse eid="1CH 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17"/>Daawite hewaa siseedda wode, Israa'eeliyaa olanchchatuwaa shiishshiide, Yorddaanoosa Shaafaa pinneedda; Sooriyaa asatuwaana olettanaw unttunttu sintsan salppeeddino. Daawite unttunttunna olettanaw salppina, unttunttukka aanana oletteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18"/>Sooriyaa asatuu Israa'eelatuu sintsaappe bak'atteedino; Daawite Sooriyaa asatuwaappe paraa gaariyaa laaggiyaa laappun sha"a asatuwaanne oytamu sha"a gediyaa asatuwaa wod'eedda; unttunttu olaa gadaawaa Shobaakakka wod'eedda. <verse eid="1CH 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19"/>Hadaadi'eezera olanchchatuu Israa'eelatuwaan s'oonetteeddawaa ereedda wode, Daawitana sigettiide, aw moodetteeddino. Hewaappe simmina, Sooriyaa Asay Amoona asaa maaddanaw dosibeenna.<verse eid="1CH 19:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20"/>
  <para style="s">Daawite Raaba Katamaa Oliide Oyk'k'eedda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 12:26-31">2 Sam. 12:26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1"/>Ofintsan, kaatetuu olaw kesiyaa wode, Yoo'aabe olanchchatuwaa kaaletsiide, Amoona gadiyaa woraajjeedda; mayyiide Raaba katamaa dooddeedda. Shin Daawite Yerusaalamen takkeedda; Yoo'aabe Raaba katamaa olettiide bayzeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:1">2 Sam. 11:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan Daawite yiide, unttunttu kaatiyaa work'k'aa kallachchaa Aa huup'iyaappe akkeedda. Kallachchay mazzaniyaa wode hattamanne oyddu kiilo giraame gideedda; Aa gidduwaan ink'k'uwaa geetettiyaa al"o shuchchay de'ee. He kallachchaa akkiide, Daawita huup'iyaan wotseedda. K'ay Daawite he katamaappe loytsi daro omooduwaa akkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3"/>Yaatiide kataman de'iyaa asaa kessiide, magaaziyan, gomaaninne kalttan oosisseedda. Amoona katamatuwaan de'iyaa asaa ubbaakka hewaadan oosisseedda. Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawitenne Aa Asay ubbay Yerusaalame simmeedda.<verse eid="1CH 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piliss's'eema Asatuwaana Oletteedda Olatuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 21:15-22">2 Sam. 21:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4"/>Hewaappe simmiide, Piliss's'eema asatuwaana Gezeeran olay denddeedda; Huushappe yeedda Sibbakaayi adussa mino asatuwaa yaraappe gideedda Sippaaya wod'eedda. Yaatina, Piliss's'eematuu s'oonetteeddino.<verse eid="1CH 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5"/>Hewaappe doomina Piliss's'eema asatuwaana hara olay denddeedda; Yaa'iira na'ay Elihanaani tooraa toomay shemayinniyaa wanddarashaa keeshshatto, Gaate katamaappe yeedda Gooliyaada ishaa Laahima wod'eedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:4-7">1 Sam. 17:4-7</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CH 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6"/>K'aykka hara olay Gaate kataman denddeedda. He sa'aan itti wogga adussa bitanii de'ee. He bitaniyaw itti itti kushiyan usuppun birad'd'etuu, itti itti gediyaankka usuppun birad'd'etuu, ubbaanna laatamanne oyddu birad'd'etuu de'iino. He bitanii adussa mino asatuwaa yaraappe gideedda asaa. <verse eid="1CH 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7"/>He bitanii Israa'eelatuwaa naasseedda wode, Daawita ishaa Shaama na'ay Yoonataani Aa wod'eedda. <verse eid="1CH 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8"/>Hawanttu Gaate kataman de'iyaa adussa mino asatuwaa yaratuwaa; unttunttu ubbay Daawita kushiyaaninne Aa asaa kushiyan hayk'k'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 20:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21"/>
  <para style="s">Daawite Asaa Paydina Yeedda <optbreak/>S'oossaa Hank'k'uwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 21:1-30">21:1-30</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 24:1-25">2 Sam. 24:1-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1"/>Sees'aanay Israa'eeliyaa bolla metuwaa ahanaw koyiide, Daawite Israa'eeliyaa asaa paydanaadan dentsetseedda. <verse eid="1CH 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2"/>Daawite Yoo'aabanne olanchchatuu kaappatuwaa hawaadan yaageedda; «Daanappe Berssaabeha gakkanaw biite; Israa'eeliyaa asaa paydite. Yaatiide asaa paydu aappunentto taana erissite» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3"/>Shin Yoo'aabe Aa, «Med'inaa Goday ha de'iyaa bare asaa bolla s'eetu kushiyaa gujjo! Ta godaw, kaatiyaw, unttunttu ubbay ta godaa k'oomatuwaa gidikkinooyye? Ta goday hewaa malaa ootsanaw ayaw koyii? Israa'eeliyaa kawutetsaa ayaw bayzanchcha kessii?» yaageedda. <verse eid="1CH 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4"/>Shin kaatiyaa k'aalay Yoo'aaba s'ooneedda. Yoo'aabe kesiide, Israa'eeliyaa biittaa ubbaa yuuyyeedda; Yerusaalame simmeedda. <verse eid="1CH 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5"/>Yoo'aabe paydeedda asaa payduwaa Daawitaw immeedda. Israa'eeliyaa biittan ubbaan mashshaan olettanaw danddayiyaa itti miilonenne itti s'eetu sha"a mino asatuu de'iino. K'ay Yihudaa biittan mashshaan olettanaw danddayiyaa oyddu s'eetanne laappun tammu sha"a mino asatuu de'iino. <verse eid="1CH 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6"/>Yoo'aabe kaatiyaa azazuwaa sheneteedda diraw, Leewatuwaanne Biiniyaama zeretsaa payduwaan gujjibeenna.<verse eid="1CH 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7"/>S'oossay ha yewuwaan nashettibeenna diraw, Israa'eeliyaa mureedda. <verse eid="1CH 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8"/>Yaatina Daawite S'oossaa, «Taani ha kiitan wolk'k'aama nagaraa ootsaad. Shin ha"i neena woossay; ta bayzuwaa, ne k'oomaa bayzuwaa k'uc'c'a. Taani daro eeyyabaa hanaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9"/>Med'inaa Goday Daawitaw timbbitiyaa odiyaa Gaada hawaadan yaagiide haasayisseedda; <verse eid="1CH 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10"/>«Baade; Daawita, ‹Med'inaa Goday neena, «Taani neena heezzubaappe dooruwaa bessay; taani ne bolla polanaw taw unttuttuppe ittuwaa doora» yaagee› yaaga» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11-12"/>Gaadi Daawitakko biide Aa, «Med'inaa Goday neena, ‹Hawanttuppe ittuwaa doora: heezzu laytsaa koshaa dooray? Woy ne morkketuu neena yederssishin, heezzu aginaa unttunttu sintsaappe bak'atanawaa dooray? Woy Med'inaa Godaa mashshay ne gadiyaa heezzu gallassaa shoc'anawaanne hewaanakka k'ay Israa'eeliyaa gadiyaa pini kesanaashin hayk'k'uwaa iita harggiyaan shoc'iyaa kiitanchchaa I kiittiyaawaa dooray?› yaagee. Ane ha"i k'achchaade, taani taana kiitteeddawoo zaariyaawaa oda» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 21:11-12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13"/>Daawite Gaada, «Taani loytsi un"ettaad. Med'inaa Godaa maarotetsay loytsi wolk'k'aama gidiyaa diraw, ane taani Aa kushiyan kunddana; taani asaa kushiyan kunddikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14"/>Hewaa diraw, Med'inaa Goday Israa'eeliyaa bolla iita harggiyaa yeddina, laappun tammu sha"a Israa'eeliyaa asatuu hayk'k'eeddino. <verse eid="1CH 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Med'inaa Goday Yerusaalame bayzanaw kiitanchchaa kiitteedda. Shin kiitanchchay Yerusaalame bayzanaw mata utti de'ishshin, Med'inaa Goday yaatiide kayyotteedda. Kayyottiidde bayziyaa kiitanchchaa, «Agga! Hewe gidanawaa!» yaageedda. He wode S'oossaa kiitanchchay Yaabuusiyaa Ornna udduma matan ek'k'eedda.<verse eid="1CH 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16"/>Med'inaa Godaa Kiitanchchay bare mashshaa bare kushiyan oyk'k'iide, Yerusaalame bayzanaw sa'aappenne saluwaappe gidduwaan ek'k'eeddawaa Daawite be'eedda. Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawitenne c'imatuu waaruwaa mayyiide, barenttu deemuwaan guufanneeddino. <verse eid="1CH 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17"/>Daawite S'oossaa, «Asay paydettanaadan ootseeddawe taana gidikkitaayye? Naak'k'eeddawenne iitabaa ootseeddawe taana. Shin ha dorssatuu, unttunttu ayaa ootseeddino? Abeet Med'inaa Godaa, ta S'oossaw, hayyanaa ne kushii taananne ta aawuwaa soy asaa muro. Ne kushii ne asaa muroppo!» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Med'inaa Godaa kiitanchchay Gaade hawaadan yaagiide azazeedda; «Daawite pude Yaabuusiyaa Ornna udduma biide, Med'inaa Godaw yarshshiyaa sa'aa yaan gimbbanaadan oda» yaageedda. <verse eid="1CH 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19"/>Med'inaa Goday nabiyaa Gaade baggana geedda k'aalaadan Daawite beedda.<verse eid="1CH 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20"/>He wode Ornninne Aa oyddu attuma naanay uddumaan zarggaa bukkiino. Guyye simmi s'eelliide, kiitanchchaa be'eeddino; aanana de'iyaa naanay k'osetteeddinno. <verse eid="1CH 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21"/>Daawite Ornnakko yeedda wode, Ornni Aa be'iide, uddumaappe gas'aa kesiide, bare deemuwaa sa'aa gatsiide, Daawitaw goyneedda.<verse eid="1CH 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawite Ornna, «Boshay asaa bollappe kichchana mala, taani Med'inaa Godaw yarshshiyaa sa'aa kees's'anaw ne uddumma taw zal"aarikkii. Taani new kumentsaa gatiyaa c'iggana» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23"/>Ornni Daawita, «New akka; ta goday kaatii barena nashechchiyaawaa ootso. Be'a, s'uuggiyaa yarshshoo booraa, eetsanaw katsaa bukkiyaa miishshaanne katsaa yarshshoo zarggaa taani immana. Taani ha ubbaakka new immana» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24"/>Shin Kaatii Daawite Ornna, «tuytti, chii! Taani kumentsaa gatiyaa k'ans's'aade shammana. Ayaw gooppe, taani nebaa Med'inaa Godaw akkikke; k'ay taani miishshaa kessabeennawaa s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaa ootsaade yarshshikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25"/>Hewaa diraw, Daawite he uddumaw usuppun s'eetu work'k'aa santtimiyaa immeedda. <verse eid="1CH 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawite he koshiyan Med'inaa Godaw yarshshuwaa yarshshiyaa sa'aa kees's'eedda. Yaatiide s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaanne ittippetetsaa yarshshuwaa yarshsheedda; Med'inaa Godaa woossina, Med'inaa Goday s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaa bolla saluwaappe tamaa yeddiide, aw zaareedda.<verse eid="1CH 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Med'inaa Goday kiitanchchaa azazina, kiitanchchay bare mashshaa shookoo zaareedda. <verse eid="1CH 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28"/>Daawite Med'inaa Goday Aa woosaw zaareeddawaa be'iide, Yaabuusiyaa Ornna uddumaan laa'entsuwaa yarshsheedda. <verse eid="1CH 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29"/>Muse mela biittaan giigisseedda Med'inaa Godaa Dunkkaaniinne s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaa yarshshiyaa sa'ay he wode Gabaa'oonan goynniyaa d'ok'k'a sa'aan de'ee. <verse eid="1CH 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30"/>Shin Daawite Med'inaa Godaa kiitanchchaa mashshaw yayyeedda diraw, S'oossaa oochchanaw he sa'aa baanaw danddayibeenna.<verse eid="1CH 21:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22"/>
  <para style="s">Geeshsha Golliyaa Kees's'anaw Haneedda Giiguwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 22:1-29:20">22:1—29:20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1"/>Hewaa diraw, Daawite, «Med'inaa Godaa S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaa hawaan de'anawaa; Israa'eeliyaa Asay s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaa yarshshana sa'ay hawaa gidanawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Geeshsha Golliyaa Kees's'anaw Giigissiyaa Giiguwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2"/>Hewaa diraw, Daawite Israa'eeliyaa biittan de'iyaa hara biittaa asatuwaa shiishshanaadan azazeedda. S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'anaw shuchchaa massiyaawanttu shuchchaa massiide loytsanaw unttunttu giddoppe suntseedda. <verse eid="1CH 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3"/>Daawite penggiyaa sank'k'aa ootsanaw misimaariyawunne maas'afiyaw haniyaa c'ora birataanne mazzananaw danddayettenna, zawi baynna nahaasiyaa birataa giigisseedda. <verse eid="1CH 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4"/>Sidoona asatuunne S'iiroosa asatuu Daawitaw zigaa ahiyaa diraw, Daawite paydu baynna zigaa giigisseedda. <verse eid="1CH 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5"/>Daawite, «Ta na'ay Solomone oosuwaa meezetibeennanne yalaga na'aa. Med'inaa Godaw kees'ettiyaa Geeshsha Golliyaa biittaa ubbaan eretteeddanne bonchchetteedda, lo"o golliyaa gidanaw besse. Hewaa diraw, aw koshshiyaawaa taani giigissana» yaageedda. Daawite hayk'k'anaappe kasetiide darobaa giigissi wotseedda.<verse eid="1CH 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawite bare na'aa Solomona s'eesiide, Med'inaa Godaw Israa'eeliyaa S'oossaw Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'anaadan azazeedda. <verse eid="1CH 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7"/>Daawite Solomona, «Ta na'aw, taani Med'inaa Godaa ta S'oossaa suntsaw Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'anaw ta wozanaan k'oppaad.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2 Sam. 7:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1 Od. 17:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8"/>Shin Med'inaa Godaa k'aalay taana, ‹Neeni daro suutsaa gussaadda; k'ay daro olaakka olettaadda. Neeni ha sa'aa bollan ta sintsan daro suutsaa gusseedda diraw, ta suntsaw Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'akka. <verse eid="1CH 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9"/>Be'a; new itti saro na'i yelettanawaa. Aa yuushshuwaan de'iyaa morkkatuwaa ubbaanna taani Aa saro ootsana. Aa suntsay Solomona; taani I kaateteedda laytsan Israa'eeliyaa asaw sarotetsaanne woppaa immana. <verse eid="1CH 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10"/>I ta suntsaw Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'ana. I ta na'aa gidanawaa; taanikka aw aawuwaa gidana. Aa kawutetsaa araataa Israa'eelan med'inaw minissa essana› yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11"/>«Ha"ikka ta na'aw, Med'inaa Goday neenana gido. S'oossay kase nebaa haasayeeddawaadan, Med'inaa Godaa ne S'oossay Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'anawaa neena polisso. <verse eid="1CH 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12"/>Med'inaa Goday neena Israa'eeliyaa asaa bolla kaatiyaa ootsiyaa wode, Med'inaa Godaa ne S'oossaa higgiyaa naaganaadan, S'oossay new aad'd'eeda eratetsaanne akeekaa immo. <verse eid="1CH 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13"/>Med'inaa Goday Muse baggana Israa'eeliyaa azazeedda azazuwaanne wogaa naagiyaawaa gidooppe, ubbay new hanana. Aynne baawaa minna! Yayyoppa woy dagammoppa!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:6-9">Iya. 1:6-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14"/>Taani daro tuggaan Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'anaw heezzu sha"anne oyddu s'eetu kiilo giraame dees'iyaa work'k'aanne hattamanne oyddu sha"a kiilo giraame dees'iyaa biraa shiishshay; k'ay zaway baynna nahaasiyaanne birataa shiishshay; k'aykka mitsaanne shuchchaa giigissaad. Gidoppekka, neeni hewaa bolla haraa gujjanaw koshshee. <verse eid="1CH 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15"/>Ne matan daro oosanchchatuu de'iino; shuchchaa k'oo'iyaawanttunne massiyaawanttu, anaas'etuunne ubbaa kiitaa ootsanaw danddayiyaa eranchcha asatuu de'iino. <verse eid="1CH 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:16"/>Unttunttu ootsiyaa work'k'aw, biraw, nahaasiyawunne birataw zaway baawa. Ha"i neeni kiitaa doomma. Med'inaa Goday neenana gido» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17"/>Daawite Israa'eeliyaa kaaletsiyaawanttu ubbay bare na'aa Solomona maaddanaadan hawaadan yaagiide azazeedda; <verse eid="1CH 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18"/>«Med'inaa Goday hinttenttu S'oossay hinttenana de'enneeyye? I hinttentta ubba saanna shemppissibeennee? Ha biittan de'iyaawantta I ta kushiyan aatsi immeedda diraw, ha biittay Med'inaa Godawunne Aa asaw moodetteedda. <verse eid="1CH 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19"/>Ha"ikka Med'inaa Godaa hinttenttu S'oossaa koyanaw hinttenttu wozanaanne hinttenttu shemppuwaa immite. Med'inaa Godaa suntsaw kees'etteedda Geeshsha Golliyaa giddon Med'inaa Godaa K'aalaa c'aak'uwa Taabootaanne S'oossaa geeshsha miishshatuwaa ahiidde wotsanaadan, hinttenttu denddiide, Med'inaa Godaa S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'ite» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 22:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1"/>Daawite c'imeedda wode, bare na'aa Solomona Israa'eeliyaa bolla kaateyeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:1-40">1 Kat. 1:1-40</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CH 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Leewatuu Oosuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2"/>Daawite Israa'eeliyaa kaaletsiyaawantta ubbatuwaa, k'eesetuwaanne Leewatuwaa ittippe shiishsheedda. <verse eid="1CH 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3"/>Hattamu laytsanne hewaappe bollanna de'iyaa Leewatuu paydetteeddino; unttunttu ubbaanna hattamanne hosppun sha"a attuma asaa gideeddino. <verse eid="1CH 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4"/>Hawanttu giddoppe Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaw aawotiyaa laatamanne oyddu sha"atuwaa kaatii wotseedda. K'ay kaappatuwaanne pirddaa yeletatuwaa usuppun sha"atuwaa wotseedda. <verse eid="1CH 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:5"/>Penggiyaa naagiyaawantta oyddu sha"atuwaa wotseedda. Med'inaa Godaa galatanaw Daawite med'd'eedda yetsaa miishshan S'oossaa galatiyaawantta oyddu sha"atuwaa wotseedda.<verse eid="1CH 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6"/>Daawite Leewii yeleedda attuma naanaa Gershshoona, K'ahaatanne Maraara unttuntta yaran yaran heezzu c'itan shaakkeedda.<verse eid="1CH 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7"/>Gershshooni yeleedda attuma naanay La'idaananne Shim"a. <verse eid="1CH 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8"/>La'idaana attuma naanay heezza; unttunttukka Yihi'eela, Zetaamanne Yuu'eela. <verse eid="1CH 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:9"/>Shim"a attuma naanay heezzatuu Shalomoota, Hazii'eelanne Haaraana; hawanttu La'idaana yaratoo kaappatuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10"/>Shim"a attuma naanay oyddatuu, barenttu yeletaa yeletaa maaran Yahaata, Ziiza, Yi'uushanne Barii'a. <verse eid="1CH 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11"/>Yaahati bayiraa Ziizi teefaa shin Yi'uushawunne Barii'assi naanay darenna; hewaa diraw, unttunttu itti yaraadan paydetteeddino.<verse eid="1CH 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12"/>K'ahaata naanay oyddatuu Amiraama, Yis'ihaara, Kebroonanne Uuzi'eela. <verse eid="1CH 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13"/>Amiraama attuma naanay Aaroonanne Musa. Aaroonenne Aa zeretsay ubbaappe aad'd'o geeshsha gideeddawaa S'oossaw dumayanaadan dummateeddino. Unttunttu Med'inaa Godaa sintsan is'aanaa c'uwayanaw, S'oossaw ootsanawunne S'oossaa suntsan asaa anjjanaw med'inaw dummateeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Kes. 28:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14"/>S'oossaa asaa gidiyaa Muse naanay Leewiyaa zaratuwaanna gatso paydetteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15"/>Muse naanay Gershshoomanne El"eezera. <verse eid="1CH 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16"/>Gershshooma naanatuwaa giddoppe kaappuu Shabu'eela. <verse eid="1CH 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17"/>El"eezera na'ay Rahaabi kaappuwaa. El"eezaraw hara na'i baawa; shin Rahaabiyaa naanay loytsi c'ora.<verse eid="1CH 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18"/>Yis'ihaara naanatuwaa kaappuu Shalomiita. <verse eid="1CH 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19"/>Kebroone na'ay bayiray Yiriiya; laa"entsuu Amaariyaa; heezzentsuu Yahaazi'eela; oyddentsuu Yik'ami'aama. <verse eid="1CH 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20"/>Uuzi'eela na'ay bayiray Mikiyaasa; laa"entsuu Yishiyaa.<verse eid="1CH 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21"/>Maraara naanay Maahilanne Musha. Maahila naanay El"aazaranne K'iisha. <verse eid="1CH 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22"/>El"aazare mac'c'a naanatuwaappe attina, attuma naanaa yelennaan hayk'k'eedda. Hewaa diraw, unttunttu ishatuu K'iisha naanay unttuntta akkeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23"/>Musha naanay heezzatuu Maahila, Edeeranne Yiremoota.<verse eid="1CH 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24"/>Leewiyaa yeletaan barenttu zariyaaninne gollen barenttu suntsan mazggabetteeddawanttu hawantta; laatamu laytsanne hewaappe bollanna de'iyaa Leewiyaa zaratuu ubbay Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaan ootseeddino. <verse eid="1CH 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25"/>Daawite, «Med'inaa Goday Israa'eeliyaa S'oossay bare asaa shemppisseedda. S'oossay Yerusaalamen med'inaw de'ana. <verse eid="1CH 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26"/>Hewaa diraw, Dunkkaaniyaanne Aa giddon go'ettiyaa miishshatuwaa hawaappe sintsanaw Leewatuu tookkanaw koshshenna» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:8">Zar. 10:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27"/>Daawite wurssetsan azazeedda azazuwaadankka laatamu laytsanne hewaappe bollanna de'iyaa Leewatuu paydetteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28"/>Unttunttu Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaan ootsiyaa Aaroona zeretsatuwaa maaddino. S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaan laa"u dabaabatuwaan ootsino; Miyiyaan de'iyaa kifiletuwaan, geeshsha miishshaa ubbaa tunennaadaninne hara oosuwaa ubbaa poliino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:28-32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:5-9">Pay. 3:5-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29"/>K'ay unttunttu S'oossaa sintsan wotsiyaa oytsaw, katsaa yarshshoo, shiishshiyaa d'iiliyaw, irshshuu gelibeenna oytsawunne zayitiyan munak'ettiyaa d'iiliyaw aawotiino; unttunttu makkiyaabawunne likkiyaabaw ubbaw aawotiino. <verse eid="1CH 23:29"/><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30-31"/>K'ay unttunttu ubbaa gallassi wonttanne omarssi, Med'inaa Godaw s'uuggiyaa yarshshuu yarshshettiyaa Sambbata gallassi, aginay s'eeriya wodenne higgiyan s'aafetteedda hara baala gallassatuu gakkiyaa wode, Med'inaa Godaa galatanawunne bonchchanaw suntsetteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 23:30-31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32"/>Gaketiyaa Dunkkaaniyaanne Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Sa'aa naaganaadaaninne Aaroona zeretsatuwaappe garssana unttuntta maaddanaadan Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaa aawotetsay Leewatoo imetteedda.<verse eid="1CH 23:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24"/>
  <para style="s">K'eesetuwaa Oosuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1"/>Aaroona zaratuwaa oosuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta. Aaroona naanay Nadaaba, Abiiha, El"aazaranne Itaamaara. <verse eid="1CH 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2"/>Shin Nadaabinne Abiihu na'aa yelennaan barenttu aawuwaappe kase hayk'k'eeddino. Hewaa diraw, El"aazarinne Itaamaari k'eesatuwaa gideeddino.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:1-2">Wog. 10:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3"/>Daawite Aaroona zeretsaa unttunttu oosuwaadan oosuwaadan c'itan shaakkeedda. El"aazara yaraappe S'aadook'inne Itaamaara yaraappe Abimeleeki Daawita maaddeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4"/>El"aazara yaratuu 16 c'uguwaan shaakettina, Itaamaara yaratuu k'ay hosppun c'uguwaan shaaketteeddino. El"aazara yaratuu kaappatuu Itaamaara yaratuu kaappatuwaappekka dari beetteedda diraw, hewaadan haneedda. <verse eid="1CH 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5"/>El"aazara yaratuu giddoninne Itaamaara yaratuu giddon Geeshsha Golliyaw kaappatuunne S'oossaa oosoo kaappatuu de'iyaa diraw, hawanttunne hinkkotuunne kiitaa saaman shaakkeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6"/>El"aazara yaratuunne Itaamaara yaratuu barenttu kaalaa saamaa kesseeddino. Leewiyaa zariyaa gideedda Nataani'eela na'ay s'aafii Shamaa'e unttuntta mazggabeedda. Kaatiinne Aa kaappatuu, k'eesiyaa S'aadook'inne Abiyaataara na'ay Abimeleeki, k'eesatuwaa yaratuu kaappatuunne Leewatuu yaratuu kaappatuu ubbatuu ha yewoo markka.<verse eid="1CH 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7"/>Ha asatuu saamaa kessina, koyro saamay Yihoyaariba gakkeedda. Laa"entso Yadaaya gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8"/>Heezzentsuu Hariima gakkeedda. Oyddentsuu Sa'oorima gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9"/>Ichcheshentso Malkkiyaa gakkeedda. Usuppuntsuu Miyaamiina gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10"/>Laappuntsuu Hak'k'oos'a gakkeedda. Hosppuntsuu Abiiya gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11"/>Udduppuntsuu Iyyaasa gakkeedda. Tammantsuu Shakaaniyaa gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12"/>Tammanne ittentsu Eliyaashiba gakkeedda. Tammanne laa"entsuu Yaak'iima gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13"/>Tammanne heezzentsuu Huppa gakkeedda. Tammanne oyddentsuu Yesheka'aaba gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14"/>Tammanne ichcheshentsu Bilgga gakkeedda. Tammanne usuppuntsuu Imeera gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15"/>Tammanne laappuntsuu Heziira gakkeedda. Tammanne hosppuntsuu Happis'ees'a gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16"/>Tammanne udduppuntsuu Pataahiyaa gakkeedda. Laatamantsuu Yihezk'k'eela gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17"/>Laatamanne ittentsu Yaakiina gakkeedda. Laatamanne laa"entsuu Gamuula gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18"/>Laatamanne heezzentsuu Dalaaya gakkeedda. Laatamanne oyddentsuu Ma'aaziyaa gakkeedda.<verse eid="1CH 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19"/>Med'inaa Goday Israa'eeliyaa S'oossay unttunttu mayza aawuwaa Aaroona bagganna azazeeddawaadan, unttunttu Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaa geliide, kaallan kaallan ootsanaw s'aafetteeddino.<verse eid="1CH 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hara Leewatuu Suntsaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20"/>Leewiyaa zaratuwaa kaappatuu haratuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 24:20">Yehidaayi Shabu'eela baggana Amiraama zariyaa.<verse eid="1CH 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:21"/>Yishe Rahaabiyaa zarii kaappuwaa.<verse eid="1CH 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22"/>Yahaati Shalomiita baggana Yis'ihaara zariyaa.<verse eid="1CH 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23"/>Yiriiyi, Amaari, Yahaazi'eelinne Yik'ami'aami Kebroone zariyaa; unttunttu barenttu yeletaa maaran s'aafetteeddino.<verse eid="1CH 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24"/>Shamiiri Mikiyaasa baggana Uuzi'eela zariyaa.<verse eid="1CH 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:25"/>Zakkaraasi Mikiyaasa ishaa Yishiyaa baggana Uuzi'eela zariyaa.<verse eid="1CH 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26"/>Maahili, Mushinne Yaa'ize Maraara zeretsaa. <verse eid="1CH 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27"/>Yaa'iziyaa naanay heezzatuu Shohaama, Zakkuuranne Iibira. <verse eid="1CH 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28"/>Maahila naanay laa"atuu El"aazaranne K'iisha. El"aazaraw attuma na'i baawa. <verse eid="1CH 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:29"/>K'iishaw Yiraahima'eela geetettiyaa itti attuma na'ay de'ee. <verse eid="1CH 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30"/>Mushaw Maahila, Edeeranne Yiremoota geetettiyaa heezzu attuma naanay de'iino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 24:30">Hawanttu Leewiyaa zaratuwaa kaappatuwaa.<verse eid="1CH 24:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31"/>Kase unttunttu dabbotuu, Aaroona zariyaa k'eesatuu ootseeddawaadan, Leewiyaa zaratuwaa kaappatuunne teefatiyaa ishatuwaappe ittuu saamaa yeggee. Is's'ay kesiyaa wode Kaatii Daawite, S'aadook'e, Abimeleeki, k'eesatuwaa kaappatuunne Leewatuu kaappatuu markka.<verse eid="1CH 24:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25"/>
  <para style="s">Geeshsha Golliyaan Yes's'iyaawantta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1"/>Daawitenne ola gadaawatuu Asaafa naanatuwaappe, Hemaana naanatuwaappenne Yidutuuna naanatuwaappe maasink'k'uwaan diitsaaninne daalan timbbitiyaa odiyaawanttu oosoo ootsanaadan dummayeeddino. Barenttoo imetteedda kiitaa ootsina, suntsay mazggabetteedda asatuu hawantta.<verse eid="1CH 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2"/>Asaafa naanay Zakkuura, Yooseefo, Nataaniyaanne Asaari'eela. Asaafa naanay kaatii azazina, timbbitiyaa odiyaa Asaafappe garssanna azazettiino.<verse eid="1CH 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3"/>Yidutuuna naanay Gadaaliyaa, S'ara, Yishaa'iyaa, Shim"a, Hashaabiyaanne Matiitiyaa. Ha usuppunatuu maasink'k'uwaan timbbitiyaa odiidde, Med'inaa Godaa galatiiddinne bonchchiidde, barenttu aawuwaa Yidutuunappe garssanna azazetteeddino.<verse eid="1CH 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4"/>Hemaana naanay Buk'k'iyaa, Mataaniyaa, Uuzi'eela, Shabu'eela, Yaarimoota, Hanaaniyaa, Hanaana, Eli'aata, Giddaltta, Romamtti'eezera, Yoshibak'aasha, Malloota, Hotiiranne Maahizi'aata. <verse eid="1CH 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5"/>Hawanttu ubbay kaatiyaw timbbitiyaa odiyaa Hemaana naanaa. S'oossay kase immana geeddawaadan, Hemaana d'ok'k'u d'ok'k'u ootsana mala, ha tammanne oyddu attuma naanaanne heezzu mac'c'a naanaa aw immeedda. <verse eid="1CH 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6"/>Hawanttu ubbay Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaan daalaa k'aatsanaw, diitsaanne maasink'k'uwaa diis's'iiddenne yes's'iidde goynnanaw, barenttu aawuwaappe garssanna de'iino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 25:6">Asaafe, Yidutuuninne Hemaani kaatiyaa azazuwaan de'iino. <verse eid="1CH 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7"/>Hawanttu laatamanne oyddu asatuu daro eray de'iyaa asatuwaa. Unttunttu dabbotuu; Med'inaa Godaw yetsan looheeddawantta; unttunttu ubbaanna laa"u s'eetanne hosppun tammanne hosppuna. <verse eid="1CH 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8"/>Unttunttu barenttu kiitaa shaakki eranaw daruu guutsay, asttamaarii tamaarii, ubbaykka laggetsaa saamaa yegeeddino.<verse eid="1CH 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9"/>Koyro saamay Asaafa na'aa Yooseefo gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"uwaa. Laa"entso saamay Gadaaliyaa gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"uwaa. <verse eid="1CH 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 25:10"/>Heezzantso saamay Zakkuura gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"uwaa. <verse eid="1CH 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 25:11"/>Oyddentso saamay S'ara gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 25:12"/>Ichcheshentso saamay Nataaniyaa gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 25:13"/>Usuppuntsa saamay Buk'k'iyaa gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 25:14"/>Laappuntsa saamay Asaari'eela gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 25:15"/>Hosppuntsa saamay Yishaa'iyaa gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 25:16"/>Udduppuntsa saamay Mataaniyaa gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 25:17"/>Tammantsa saamay Shim"a gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 25:18"/>Tammanne ittentsiyaa saamay Uuzi'eela gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 25:19"/>Tammanne laa"entsa saamay Hashaabiyaa gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 25:20"/>Tammanne heezzentsa saamay Shabu'eela gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 25:21"/>Tammanne oyddentso saamay Matiitiyaa gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 25:22"/>Tammanne ichcheshantsa saamay Yaarimoota gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 25:23"/>Tammanne usuppuntsa saamay Hanaaniyaa gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 25:24"/>Tammanne laappuntsa saamay Yoshibak'aasha gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 25:25"/>Tammanne hosppuntsa saamay Hanaana gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 25:26"/>Tammanne udduppuntsa saamay Malloota gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 25:27"/>Laatamantsa saamay Eli'aata gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 25:28"/>Laatamanne ittentsiyaa saamay Hotiira gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 25:29"/>Laatamanne laa"entsa saamay Giddaltta gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 25:30"/>Laatamanne heezzentsa saamay Maahizi'aata gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a. <verse eid="1CH 25:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:31"/>Laatamanne oyddentso saamay Romamtti'eezera gakkeedda; I, Aa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne laa"a.<verse eid="1CH 25:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26"/>
  <para style="s">Geeshsha Golliyaa Naagiyaawantta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1"/>Geeshsha Golliyaa penggiyaa naagiyaawanttu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 26:1">Koyruu K'oraaha yaraappe Asaafa baggana K'ore na'aa Mashelemiyaa. <verse eid="1CH 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2"/>Mashelemee laappun attuma naanaa yeleedda; unttunttu barenttu yeletaa maaran Zakkaraasa, Yidi'eela, Zabaadiyaa, Yaatini'eela, <verse eid="1CH 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3"/>Elaama, Yahohanaananne Eliyaho'enaaya.<verse eid="1CH 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4"/>S'oossay Obeedi-Eedoomakka anjjeedda diraw, I hosppun attuma naanaa yeleedda. Unttunttu barenttu yeletaa maaran Shamaa'iyaa, Yihozabaada, Yo'aaha, Sakaara, Nataani'eela,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:11">2 Sam. 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 13:14">1 Od. 13:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:5"/>Ami'eela, Yisaakooranne Pa'ulttaaya. <verse eid="1CH 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6"/>K'ay Obeedi-Eedooma na'ay Shamaa'ekka usuppun attuma naanaa yeleedda; unttunttu mino asaa gideedda diraw, barenttu aawuwaa gollen kaappuwaa gideeddino. <verse eid="1CH 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7"/>Shamaa'iyaa naanay Ootina, Rafaa'eela, Yobeedanne Elzzabaada; unttunttu ishatuu Eelihunne Samaake aad'd'eeda mino asatuwaa. <verse eid="1CH 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8"/>Hawanttu ubbatuu Obeedi-Eedooma zeretsaa; unttunttu, unttunttu naanaynne unttunttu dabbotuu oosoo mino. Obeedi-Eedooma zaratuu ubbaanna usuppun tammanne laa"a.<verse eid="1CH 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9"/>Mashelemiyaw mino naanaynne mino dabbotuu de'iino; unttunttu ubbaanna tammanne hosppuna.<verse eid="1CH 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10"/>Maraara yaraappe Hoosayyookka naanay de'iino. Shiimiri bayira na'aa gidenna; shin Aa aawuu Aa kaappuuwaa ootseedda. <verse eid="1CH 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11"/>Aa ishatuu Hilk'k'iyaa, S'abaaliyaanne Zakkaraasa. Hoosa naanaynne Aa dabbotuu ubbaanna tammanne heezza.<verse eid="1CH 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12"/>Geeshsha Golliyaa penggiyaa naagiyaawanttu barenttu golliyaa asaa kaappatuwaanna, c'uguwaan c'uguwaan shaaketteeddino. Hara Leewatuwaadan unttunttakka Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaa kiitay gishuwaan gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13"/>Penggiyaa ubbaa naaganaw barenttu gollen gollen guutsay gitay saamaa kesseeddino. <verse eid="1CH 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14"/>Away doliyaa Penggiyaa giyaa penggiyaa naagiyaa saamay Sheleemiyaa gakkeedda. Lo"o zoriyaa Aa na'aa Zakkaraasa Huup'issa Penggiyaa geetettiyaa penggiyaa naagiyaa saamay gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15"/>Obeedi-Eedooma Gedissa Penggiyaa giyaa penggiyaa naagiyaa saamay gakkeedda. Aa naanaa miishshaa minjjiyaa golliyaa naagiyaa saamay gakkeedda. <verse eid="1CH 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16"/>Awaay wulliyaa Penggiyaanne bolla ogiyaa baggana de'iyaa Shalekoota Penggiyaa geetettiyaa penggetuwaa naagiyaa saamay Shufiimanne Hoosa gakkeedda. Naagu kaallan kaallan gakkee.<verse eid="1CH 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17"/>Gallassan gallassan away doliyaa baggana usuppun Leewatuu naagiino. Huup'issa baggana oyddatuu naagiino. Gedissa baggana oyddatuu naagiino. K'ay laa"u laa"u miishshaa minjjiyaa golliyaa naagiino. <verse eid="1CH 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18"/>Awaay wulliyaa baggana dabaabaw afiyaa ogiyaa oyddatuu naagiino. K'ay dabaabaa gidduwaa laa"atuu naagiino. <verse eid="1CH 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19"/>Simmi k'oraaha yaratoonne Maraara yaratoo imetteedda pengge naago kiitay hawaa.<verse eid="1CH 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Geeshsha Golliyaa Giddon Ootsiyaa Hara Oosotuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20"/>Akiiya geetettiyaa Leewii S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaan de'iyaa shaluwaanne S'oossaw dummayi wotseedda imotaa naaganaw suntsetteedda. <verse eid="1CH 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21"/>Gershshoona na'aa La'idaana yaraappe Yihi'eeli dumma dumma golliyaa asaw aawotee. <verse eid="1CH 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22"/>Yihi'eela naanay Zetaamanne Aa ishaa Yuu'eela; unttunttu Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaan de'iyaa miishshaa naaganaw suntsetteeddino.<verse eid="1CH 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23"/>Amiraama yaratoo, Yis'ihaara yaratoo, Kebroona yaratoo Uuzi'eela yaratoo kiitay shaaketti imetteedda. <verse eid="1CH 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24"/>Muse na'aa Gershshooma yara gidiyaa Shabu'eeli Geeshsha Golliyaan de'iyaa miishshaa naagiyaawanttu kaappatuu bolla suntsetteedda. <verse eid="1CH 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25"/>I Gershshooma ishaa El"eezera baggana Shalomiitaw dabbotee. El"eezeri Rahaabiyaa yeleedda; Rahaabii Yishaa'iyaa yeleedda; Yishaa'ii Yoraama yeleedda; Yoraame Ziikira yeleedda; Ziikiri Shalomiita yeleedda. <verse eid="1CH 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26"/>Kaatii Daawite, aawotuwaa golliyaa asaa kaappatuu, sha"a kaappatuu, s'eetuwaa Kaappatuunne ola gadaawatuu S'oossaw dummayi wotseedda shaluwaa ubbaa bolla Shalomiitinne Aa dabbotuu suntsetteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27"/>Ha shaluwaa Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaa ooratsanaw dummayi wotseedda asatuu ha miishshaa kase olaappe omooddi wotseeddino. <verse eid="1CH 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28"/>K'ay timbbitiyaa odiyaa Sammeeli, K'iisa na'ay Saa'ooli, Neera na'ay Abaneerinne S'aruuyi na'ay Yoo'aabe kase dummayi wotseedda imotaa ubbaa Shalomiitinne Aa dabbotuu naagiino.<verse eid="1CH 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hara Leewatuwaa Gakkeedda Oosuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29"/>Yis'ihaara yaratuwaappe Kanaanenne Aa naanay Geeshsha Golliyaappe karenna de'iyaa kiitan Israa'eeliyaa asaa ayissanawunne daannatanaw suntsetteeddino.<verse eid="1CH 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30"/>Kebroone yaratuwaappe Hashaabeenne Aa dabbotuu, itti sha"anne laappun s'eetu mino asatuu, Med'inaa Godaa oosuwaa ubbawunne kaatiyaa oosuwaa ubbaw Yorddaanoosa Shaafaappe hefintsan away wulliyaa baggana de'iyaa Israa'eeliyaa asaa bolla suntsetteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31"/>Kebroone yaratuwaappe kaappotiyaawe Yiriiya. Daawite kaateteedda oytamantso laytsan koyina, unttunttu asaa giddoppe mino asatuu Gala'aade biittan Yaa'izeera geetettiyaa koshiyan beetteeddino. <verse eid="1CH 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32"/>Aawotuwaa golliyaa asaw kaappotiyaa Yiriiya dabbotuu minotuu laa"u sha"anne laappun s'eeta. Kaatii Daawite S'oossaa oosuwaa ubbawunne kaatiyaa oosuwaa ubbaw unttunttu Roobeela zaratuwaa biittaa bolla, Gaade zaratuwaa biittaa bollanne Minaase zaratuwaappe baggatuu biittaa bolla suntseedda.<verse eid="1CH 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27"/>
  <para style="s">Israa'eeliyaa Asaa Kaaletsiyaawantta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1"/>Barenttu c'uguwaan c'uguwaan kawutetsaa ayisseedda Israa'eeliyaa golliyaa asatuwaa kaappatuu, sha"aa kaappatuunne s'eetuwaa kaappatuu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta. Itti itti c'uguwaan laatamanne oyddu sha"a asatuu de'iino. Itti itti c'uguu laytsaa giddon itti itti aginaw kaalan kaalan kawutetsaa kiitaa ootsanaw kessee.<verse eid="1CH 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2"/>Koyro aginaan kesiyaa c'uguwaa kaaletsiyaawe Zabddi'eela na'aa Yaashobi'aama; Aa c'uguwaan laatamanne oyddu sha"a Asay de'ee. <verse eid="1CH 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3"/>Yaashobi'aami Paareesa zeretsaa; I koyro aginaw olanchchatuu kaappatuwaa gadaawuwaa.<verse eid="1CH 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4"/>Laa"entso aginaan kesiyaa c'uguwaa kaaletsiyaawe Ahoohiyaa Dodaaya; Aa c'uguwaan laatamanne oyddu sha"a Asay de'ee. Aappe kaalliyaawe Mik'iloota.<verse eid="1CH 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5"/>Heezzantso aginaan kesiyaa c'uguwaa kaaletsiyaawe k'eesiyaa Yoodaahe na'aa Banaaya; Aa c'uguwaan laatamanne oyddu sha"a Asay de'ee. <verse eid="1CH 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6"/>Banaayi hattamu eretteedda asatuwaa giddon mino asaa gidiide, hattamatoo kaappoteedda. Aa sa'aan Aa na'ay Amizabaadi kaappoteedda.<verse eid="1CH 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7"/>Oyddentso aginaan kesiyaa c'uguwaa kaaletsiyaawe Yoo'aaba ishaa Asaaheela; Aa c'uguwaan laatamanne oyddu sha"a Asay de'ee. Aa kotan Aa na'ay Zabaade kaappoteedda.<verse eid="1CH 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8"/>Ichcheshentso aginaan kesiyaa c'uguwaa kaaletsiyaawe Yis'ihaara yaraappe Shamihuuta; Aa c'uguwaan laatamanne oyddu sha"a Asay de'ee.<verse eid="1CH 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9"/>Usuppuntsa aginaan kesiyaa c'uguwaa kaaletsiyaawe Tak'o"appe yeedda Ik'k'eesha na'aa Ira; Aa c'uguwaan laatamanne oyddu sha"a Asay de'ee.<verse eid="1CH 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10"/>Laappuntsa aginaan kesiyaa c'uguwaa kaaletsiyaawe Efireema zariyaappe Piloonappe yeedda Helees'a; Aa c'uguwaan laatamanne oyddu sha"a Asay de'ee.<verse eid="1CH 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11"/>Hosppuntsa aginaan kesiyaa c'uguwaa kaaletsiyaawe Huushappe yeedda Sibbakaaya; Aa c'uguwaan laatamanne oyddu sha"a Asay de'ee. Sibbakaayi Yihudaa zarenne Zaraaha yara.<verse eid="1CH 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12"/>Udduppuntsa aginaan kesiyaa c'uguwaa kaaletsiyaawe Biiniyaama zare gideedda Anatootiyaa Abi'eezera; Aa c'uguwaan laatamanne oyddu sha"a Asay de'ee.<verse eid="1CH 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13"/>Tammantsa aginaan kesiyaa c'uguwaa kaaletsiyaawe Nas'oofappe yeedda, Zaraaha yara gideedda Maahiraaya; Aa c'uguwaan laatamanne oyddu sha"a Asay de'ee.<verse eid="1CH 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14"/>Tammanne ittentsiyaa aginaan kesiyaa c'uguwaa kaaletsiyaawe Pir"aatoonappe yeedda, Efireema zariyaa gideedda Banaaya; Aa c'uguwaan laatamanne oyddu sha"a Asay de'ee.<verse eid="1CH 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15"/>Tammanne laa'entso aginaan kesiyaa c'uguwaa kaaletsiyaawe Nas'oofappe yeedda, Otini'eela yara gideedda Helddaaya; Aa c'uguwaan laatamanne oyddu sha"a Asay de'ee.<verse eid="1CH 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Israa'eeliyaa Zaretuwaa Ayissiyaawantta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16"/>Israa'eeliyaa zeretsaa ayissanaw suntsetteeddawanttu hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteeddawantta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:16">Roobeela zariyaa ayissiyaawe Ziikira na'aa El"eezera.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:16">Simoona zariyaa ayissiyaawe Maa'ika na'aa Shafaas'iyaa.<verse eid="1CH 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17"/>Leewiyaa zariyaa ayissiyaawe K'amu'eela na'aa Hashaabiyaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:17">Aaroona zariyaa ayissiyaawe S'aadook'a.<verse eid="1CH 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18"/>Yihudaa zariyaa ayissiyaawe Daawita ishaa Eeliha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:18">Yisaakoora zariyaa ayissiyaawe Mikaa'eela na'aa Omira.<verse eid="1CH 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19"/>Zaabiloona zariyaa ayissiyaawe Obaadiyaa na'aa Yishimaa'iyaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:19">Nifttaaleema zariyaa ayissiyaawe Aziri'eela na'aa Yaarimoota.<verse eid="1CH 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20"/>Efireema zariyaa ayissiyaawe Azaaziyaa na'aa Hoshee'a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:20">Yorddaanoosa Shaafaappe away wulliyaa baggan de'iyaa Minaase zaratuwaappe bagga ayissiyaawe Padaaya na'aa Yuu'eela.<verse eid="1CH 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21"/>Yorddaanoosa Shaafaappe away doliyaa bagga Gala'aaden de'iyaa Minaase zaratuwaappe bagga ayissiyaawe Zakkaraasa na'aa Idda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:21">Biiniyaama zariyaa ayissiyaawe Abaneera na'aa Ya'isi'eela.<verse eid="1CH 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22"/>Daana zariyaa ayissiyaawe Yirohaama na'aa Azaari'eela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:22">Hawanttu Israa'eeliyaa zeretsaa ayissiyaawantta.<verse eid="1CH 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23"/>Med'inaa Goday Israa'eeliyaa asaa saluwaa s'oolinttiyaadan c'orissana geedda diraw, Daawite laatamu laytsanne laatamu laytsaappe garssanna de'iyaawantta payduwaan gelissibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Dom. 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:4">26:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24"/>S'aruuyi na'ay Yoo'aabe asaa payduwaa doommeedda; shin paydi wurssibeenna. Asaa paydeedda gaasuwaan S'oossay Israa'eeliyaa asaa bolla hank'k'etteedda. Hewaa diraw, unttunttu paydu Kaatiyaa Daawita taarikiyaa mazggobaan s'aafettibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:1-15">2 Sam. 24:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 21:1-14">1 Od. 21:1-14</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CH 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaatiyaa Miishshaan Aawotiyaawantta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25"/>Kaatiyaa miishshaa minjjiyaa sa'aw aawotiyaawe Adii'eela na'aa Azimaaweeta. Gas'ariyan, katamatuwaaninne mootsatuwaan, wochchiyaa saa de'iyaa miishshaw aawotiyaawe Ooziyaana na'aa Yoonataana. <verse eid="1CH 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26"/>Biittaa goshiyaa goshshanchchatuwaa bolla aawotiyaawe Kaluuba na'aa Eezira. <verse eid="1CH 27:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27"/>Woynniyaa turaa sa'atoo aawotiyaawe Raamappe yeedda Shim"a. Woynniyaa eessaa minjjiyaa sa'aw aawotiyaawe Shafaamappe yeedda Zabdda.<verse eid="1CH 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28"/>Away wulliyaa bagga Geziyan de'iyaa wogarawunne unttunttoo aawotiyaawe Gedeerappe yeedda Ba'aalihanaana. Zayitiyaa minjjiyaa sa'aw aawotiyaawe Yo'aasha. <verse eid="1CH 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29"/>Saaroona Dembban heemettiyaa miizzaw aawotiyaawe Saarooniyaa Shiis'iraaya. Wombban hemettiyaa miizzaw aawotiyaawe Adilaaya na'aa Shafaas'a. <verse eid="1CH 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30"/>Gaalotoo aawotiyaawe Isimaa'eeliyaa Obiila. Haretoo aawotiyaawe Meronootiyaa Yehidaaya. <verse eid="1CH 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31"/>Dorssatoonne deeshshatoo aawotiyaawe Aggaari zariyaappe Yaaziiza. Hawanttu ubbay Daawita ak'uwaa bolla aawoteedawantta.<verse eid="1CH 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Daawita Zoriyaawantta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32"/>Daawita aawuwaa ishay Yoonataani s'aafii, akeekanchcha asanne kaatiyaa zoriyaa asaa. Hakimoona na'ay Yihi'eeli kaatiyaa naanaa naagee. <verse eid="1CH 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33"/>Akis'oofeeli k'ay kaatiyaa zoriyaawaa. Arkkiyaa Hushaayi kaatii siik'iyaa asaa. <verse eid="1CH 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34"/>Akis'oofeeli hayk'k'ina, Aa koshiyan Banaaya na'ay Yoodaahenne Abiyaataare kaatiyaa zoriyaawantta; Yoo'aabe kaatiyaa ola gadaawaa.<verse eid="1CH 27:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28"/>
  <para style="s">Daawite Geeshsha Golliyaa Waati Kees's'anentto Odeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1"/>Israa'eeliyaa kaappatuu ubbay Yerusaalamen shiik'anaadan Kaatii Daawite azazeedda; hewaa diraw, zaratuwaa kaappotuu, kaatiyaa oosanchchatuu kaappatuu, sha"a kaappatuu, s'eetuwaa kaappatuu, kaatiyaw kaatiyaa naanaw de'iyaa ak'oonne mehiyaw aawotiyaawanttu, kaatiyaa gollen ootsiyaa kaappatuu, eretteedda mino asatuunne wolk'k'aama asatuu ubbay Yerusaalamen shiik'eeddino.<verse eid="1CH 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2"/>Kaatii Daawite denddi ek'k'iide, hawaadan yaageedda; «Ta ishatoo, ta asatoo, sisite! Med'inaa Godaa K'aalaa c'aak'uwa Taabootaa wotsiyaanne nu S'oossaa gedii shemppiyaa Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'anaw ta wozanaan k'oppaad; kees's'anaw koshshiyaawanttakka giigissaad.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2 Sam. 7:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1 Od. 17:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3"/>Shin S'oossay taana, ‹Neeni olanchchanne suutsaa gusseedda asaa gidiyaa diraw, ta suntsaw golliyaa kees's'akka› yaageedda. <verse eid="1CH 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4"/>Taani Israa'eeliyaa bolla med'inaw kaatetanaadan, Med'inaa Goday Israa'eeliyaa S'oossay ta aawuwaa golliyaa asaa ubbaappe taana dooreedda. Kaaletsanaadan koyro Yihudaa zariyaa dooreedda; Yihudaa zariyaappe ta aawuwaa soy asaa dooreedda; ta aawuwaa naanaa giddoppe taana dooriide, Israa'eeliyaa ubbaa bolla kaateyanaw nashetteedda. <verse eid="1CH 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5"/>Med'inaa Goday taw c'ora naanaa immeedda; ta naanaa ubbaappe Med'inaa Godaa kawutetsaa araatan uttiide, Israa'eeliyaa bolla kaatetanaadan ta na'aa Solomona dooreedda.<verse eid="1CH 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6"/>«S'oossay taana, ‹Ta Geeshsha Golliyaanne ta dabaabaa kees's'anawe ne na'aa Solomona. Ayaw gooppe, I taw na'aa gidanaadan taani Aa dooraad; taanikka aw aawuwaa gidanawaa. <verse eid="1CH 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7"/>I ha"i ootsiyaawaadan sintsappekka ta azazuwaanne ta higgiyaa minniide naagooppe, taani Aa kawutetsaa med'inaw mintsana› yaageedda. <verse eid="1CH 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8"/>Hewaa diraw, ha"ikka Med'inaa Godaa yaa'ay, Israa'eeliyaa Asay ubbay be'ishiinanne nu S'oossay sisishshin, Med'inaa Godaa hinttenttu S'oossaa azazuwaa ubbaa hinttenttu minisiide naagana mala, taani hinttenttoo oday. Yaatooppe, hinttenttu ha lo"o biittaa laattananne hinttenttu naanaakka med'inaw laatissanawaa.<verse eid="1CH 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9"/>«Solomona, ta na'aw, ne aawuwaa S'oossaa era. Ne kumentsaa wozanaaninne ne eeno giyaa k'ofaan aw kiiteta. Ayaw gooppe, Med'inaa Goday wozanaa ubbaa k'oree; k'ofaan de'iyaa halchchuwaa ubbaakka ereedda. Neeni Aa koyooppe, I new beettana; shin neeni Aa aggooppe, I neena med'inaw aggi bashana. <verse eid="1CH 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10"/>Ha"ikka Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'anaw Med'inaa Goday neena dooreeddawaa dogoppa. Minnaade kiitaa kiiteta» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawite bare na'aa Solomonaw Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'iyaa halchchuwaa immeedda; baranddaa halchchuwaa, miishshaa minjjiyaa sa'aa halchchuwaa, bolla kifiliyaanne giddo kifiliyaa halchchuwaanne nagaray atto geetettiyaa sa'aa k'um"iyaa wotsiyaa kifiliyaa halchchuwaa immeedda. <verse eid="1CH 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12"/>K'aykka Daawite aw Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaa dabaabaa kees's'anaw bare k'ofaan de'iyaa halchchuwaa, Aa yuushshuwaan de'iyaa ubbaa kifiletuu halchchuwaanne S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaa miishshaa minjjiyaa sa'atuunne S'oossaw dummayi wotseedda imotaa minjjiyaa sa'atuu halchchuwaa immeedda.<verse eid="1CH 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13"/>Hewaadankka Daawite k'eesatuu nne Leewatuu c'ugotuu barenttu kiitaa ootsana maaraa, Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaa kiitaa ootsana maaraanne Geeshsha Golliyaa miishshatuwaa naagiyaa maaraa odiyaa halchchuwaa aw immeedda.<verse eid="1CH 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14"/>K'aykka Daawite hawaappe kaalliide s'aafetteedda dumma dumma miishshatuwaa med'd'anaw woyssa keeshshaa dees'iyaa work'k'aanne woyssa keeshshaa dees'iyaa biraa koshshintto s'aafiide, Solomonaw immeedda. <verse eid="1CH 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15"/>Hewanttukka, work'k'aa s'omppetuwaa wotsiyaa ballaanne work'k'aa s'omppetuwaa, biraa s'omppetuwaa wotsiyaa ballaanne biraa s'omppetuwaa, <verse eid="1CH 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16"/>S'oossaa sintsan ukitsaa wotsiyaa work'k'aa s'arp'p'eezatuwaa, biraa s'arp'p'eezatuwaa, <verse eid="1CH 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17"/>work'k'aa oyk'k'iyaawaa, work'k'aa keretuwaa, work'k'aa wanc'c'atuwaa, work'k'aa kuyis'aarotuwaa, biraa kuyis'aarotuwaanne <verse eid="1CH 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18"/>is'aanaa c'uwayiyaa geeshsha work'k'aa saas'iniyaa. Med'inaa Godaa K'aalaa c'aak'uwa Taabootaa bolla barenttu k'efiyaa mic'c'iide kammiyaa, kiruubela wotsiyaa work'k'aa gaariyaa giigissiyaa halchchuwaakka aw immeedda. <verse eid="1CH 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19"/>Daawite, «Med'inaa Goday bare kushiyaa ta bolla wotsiide, ha s'aafetteedda halchchuwaa ubbaa taana eriseedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawite bare na'aa Solomona, «Aynne baawa; minna! Oosuwaa ootsa! Med'inaa Goday S'oossay, ta S'oossay neenana de'iyaa diraw, yayyoppa; dagammoppa! Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaa kiitay polettana gakkanaw, S'oossay neena yeggennanne aggena. <verse eid="1CH 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21"/>S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaan de'iyaa oosuwaa ubbaw k'eesatuu nne Leewatuu suntsetti utteeddino. Kushiyaa hiillaa eray de'iyaa Asay ubbay neena oosuwaa ubbaan maaddana. Kaappatuunne Asay ubbay new ubbabankka azazettana» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 28:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29"/>
  <para style="s">Geeshsha Golliyaa Kees's'anaw Imetteedda Imotaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Kaatii Daawite shiik'eedda asaw ubbaw hawaadan yaageedda; «S'oossay dooreeddawe ta na'aa Solomona; I yalaganne oosookka meezetibeenna. Ha kees'ettana keetsay asaa golliyaa gidennaan Med'inaa Godaa S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaa gidiyaa diraw, kiitay wolk'k'aama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:5">1 Od. 22:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2"/>Taani taw de'iyaa wolk'k'aa keeshshaa ta S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaw work'k'aan oosettanabaw work'k'aa, biran oosettanabaw biraa, nahaasiyaan oosettanabaw nahaasiyaa, birataan oosettanabaw birataanne mitsan oosettanabaw mitsaa giigissa wotsaad. K'ay margidiyaa, ibinabaradiyaa, dumma dumma malaanna de'iyaa alleek'k'o shuchchatuwaa, al"o shuchchatuwaanne ink'k'otuwaa giigissa wotsaad. <verse eid="1CH 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3"/>Ta S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaa taani loytsa siik'iyaa diraw, taani ta S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaw giigisseeddawaappe haraa taw buzo de'iyaa work'k'aappenne biraappe geeshsha Geeshsha Golliyaw immaad. <verse eid="1CH 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4"/>Geeshsha Golliyaa godaa mayzzanaw s'eetu sha"a kiilo giraame dees'iyaa geeshsha work'k'aanne laa"u s'eetanne oytamu sha"a kiilo giraame dees'iyaa geeshsha biraa immaad. <verse eid="1CH 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5"/>Kushiyaa hiillatuu ootsana oosuwaa ubbaw, work'k'aan oosettanabaw work'k'aa, biran oosettanabaw biraa, immaad. Yaatina, hintteppe hachche bare sheniyaan Med'inaa Godaw keekkiidde immanawe oonee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="1CH 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6"/>Israa'eeliyaa golliyaa asatuwaa Kaappatuu, zaratuwaa kaappatuu, sha"aa kaappatuu, s'eetuwaa kaappatuunne kaatiyaa oosanchchatuu kaappatuu barenttu sheniyaan barenttoo de'iyaawaa immeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7"/>Unttunttu S'oossaa Geeshsha Golliyaa oosoo itti s'eetanne laappun tammu sha"a kiilo giraame dees'iyaa work'k'aa, heezzu s'eetanne oytamu sha"a kiilo giraame dees'iyaa biraa, usuppun s'eetanne laatamu sha"a kiilo giraame dees'iyaa nahaasiyaa birataanne heezzu miiliyoonenne oyddu s'eetu sha"a kiilo giraame dees'iyaa birataa immeeddino. <verse eid="1CH 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8"/>Al"o shuchchay de'iyaa Asay ubbay miishshaa naagiyaa Leewiyaa Gershshoona yara gidiyaa Yihi'eela baggana Med'inaa Godaa Geeshsha Golliyaa miishshaa minjjiyaa gollew immeedda. <verse eid="1CH 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9"/>Asay bare sheniyaan bare kumentsaa wozanaan Med'inaa Godaw immeedda diraw nashetteedda; Kaatii Daawitekka loytsi nashetteedda.<verse eid="1CH 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Daawite S'oossaa Galateedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10"/>Hewaa diraw, Daawite shiik'uwaa ubbaa sintsan hawaadan yaagiide, Med'inaa Godaa galateedda; «Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, nu aawuwaa Israa'eeliyaa S'oossaw, neeni med'inaappe med'inaw galatiitta. <verse eid="1CH 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, saluwaaninne sa'aan de'iyaa ubbabay newaa! Gitatetsay, wolk'k'ay, bonchchu, s'oonuunne anggay newaa! Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, maatay newaa; neeni ubbaappe bollanne huup'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:13">Mat. 6:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12"/>Duretaynne bonchchu neeppe yee; neeni ubbabaa moodasaa. Wolk'k'aynne minotay ne kushiyaanna; neeni asaa ubbaa d'ok'k'issanawunne minisanaw danddayaasa. <verse eid="1CH 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13"/>Ha"ikka nu S'oossaw, nuuni neena galateetto; ne bonchcho suntsaakka sabbeetto.<verse eid="1CH 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14"/>«Nuuni hawaa keeshshabaa Immanaw tanne ta asaynne oonee? Ayaw gooppe, ubbabay neeppe yee; nuuni ne kushiyaappe akkeeddawaa new zaaretsi immeedda. <verse eid="1CH 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15"/>Kase nu aawotuwaa ubbaadan nuunikka ne sintsan betenne imatsaa. Ha sa'aa bollan nu de'uwaa laytsay kuwaadan aad'd'iyaawaa; nuuni hayk'oppe attanaw danddayokko. <verse eid="1CH 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, nu S'oossaw, ne geeshsha suntsaw nuuni Geeshsha Golliyaa kees's'anaw shiishsheedda ubbay ne kushiyaappe yeeddawaa; hawe ubbay nebaa.<verse eid="1CH 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17"/>«Ta S'oossaw, neeni wozanaa paac'c'iyaawaanne suuretetsaa dosiyaawaa taani eray. Taani ta wozanaa suuretetsan ta sheniyaan hawaa ubbaa immaad. Ha sa'aan de'iyaa ne asaykka new bare sheniyaan nashechchan immeeddawe taani be'aaddi. <verse eid="1CH 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18"/>Abeet Med'inaa Godaw, nu mayza aawotuwaa Abrahaama, Yisaak'anne Israa'eeliyaa S'oossaw, ne asaa wozanaan ha wolk'k'aama siik'uwaa med'inaw naaga; unttunttu wozanaakka neekko shiishsha. <verse eid="1CH 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19"/>Ne wogaa, ne azazuwaanne ne higgiyaa naaganaadaaninne taani halchchaade giigissa wotseeddaban Geeshsha Golliyaa I kees's'anaadan ta na'aa Solomonaw kumentsaa wozanaa imma» yaagiide galateedda.<verse eid="1CH 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Daawite yaa'aw ubbaw, «Med'inaa Godaa hinttenttu S'oossaa galatite» yaageedda. Yaa'ay ubbay Med'inaa Godaa barenttu aawotuwaa S'oossaa galateeddino. Med'inaa Godaw guufanniide goynneeddinonne kaatiyawukka kundda giide guufanneeddino.<verse eid="1CH 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Solomona Kaatetussaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 29:21-25">29:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21"/>Wonttetsa gallassi Asay Med'inaa Godaw yarshshuwaa yarshsheedda. K'ay s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaakka S'oossaw yarshsheedda; itti sha"a korumatuwaa, itti sha"a dorssaa orggetuwaa, itti sha"a dorssaa maratuwaa, ushshaa yarshshuwaanne daro yarshshotuwaa yarshsheedda. <verse eid="1CH 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22"/>Asay he gallassi Med'inaa Godaa sintsan loytsi nashettidde, meeddanne usheeddanne. Yaatiide Asay Kaatiyaa Daawita na'aa Solomona laa'entsuwaa zayitiyaa okkiide, Aa kawutetsan miniseedda. S'aadook'akka k'eese gidanaadan Med'inaa Godaa sintsan okkeedda.<verse eid="1CH 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Solomone bare aawuwaa Daawita koshiyan Med'inaa Godaa kawutetsaa araatan utteedda. Aw ubbabay haneedda; Israa'eeliyaa ubbaykka aw azazetteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:12">1 Kat. 2:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24"/>Kaappatuu ubbay, mino asatuunne Kaatiyaa Daawita naanay Kaatiyaa Solomonaw azazettanaw k'aalaa geleeddino. <verse eid="1CH 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25"/>Med'inaa Goday Solomona Israa'eeliyaa asaa ubbaa sintsan d'ok'k'u d'ok'k'u ootseedda; aappe kase Israa'eeliyaa kaatetoo imettibeenna bonchchuwaa Solomonaw immeedda.<verse eid="1CH 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Daawita Hayk'uwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 29:26-30">29:26-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26"/>Isseya na'ay Daawite Israa'eeliyaa ubbaa bolla kaateteedda. <verse eid="1CH 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27"/>Daawite Israa'eeliyaa bolla oytamu laytsaa kaateteedda; Kebroonan I laappun laytsaa kaateteedda; Yerusaalamen hattamanne heezzu laytsaa kaateteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:4-5">2 Sam. 5:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:4">1 Od. 3:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CH 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28"/>Daawite daro laytsaa de'iide, durettiide, bonchchettiide, lo"o c'imiide hayk'k'eedda. Aa kotan Aa na'ay Solomone kaateteedda. <verse eid="1CH 29:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29"/>Daawite koyroppe doommiide wurssetsaa gakkanaw ootseeddabay, Timbbitiyaa Odiyaa Sammeela Taarikiyaa mas'aafan, Timbbitiyaa Odiyaa Naataana Taarikiyaa Mas'aafaaninne Timbbitiyaa Odiyaa Gaade Taarikiyaa mas'aafan s'aafetti utteedda. <verse eid="1CH 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30"/>I woot mooddeeddenttonne I waaneedda wolk'k'aama asaakko, I haneeddabay, Israa'eeliyaa asaynne heeraan de'iyaa kawutetsatuu ubbay haneeddabay he mas'aafatuwan s'aafetti utteedda.<verse eid="1CH 29:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29"/>
</usx>
